rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "This spell doesn\'t resolve and you get no Saprolings if the enchantment is an illegal target on resolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The land does not count toward your one per turn limit because it was put onto the battlefield by an effect.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If Howling Mine leaves the battlefield before it resolves, then the last known tap or untap state of the card is used for resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It does not trigger at all if this is tapped at the start of the draw step, and it checks this again on resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The additional draw is separate from any other draw during your draw step. It happens when the triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The triggered ability is put onto the stack after you have already drawn your card for the turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If there are multiple attacks in a turn, then you have to pay for each attack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If there is more than one Propaganda on the battlefield, the cost is cumulative.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Paying this cost is not an instant or any other kind of ability, it is an additional cost on the declaration of the attacker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The payment is made during the declare attackers step at the same time you are declaring the attacker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-02-01\', \'text\': \'In the Two-Headed Giant format, you still only have to pay once per creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can\'t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It is perfectly legal for either or both players to have zero creatures. They give control of all their zero creatures as instructed.'}, {'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'You only untap creatures controlled by you and the targeted opponent, not all creatures.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'It only produces one mana even if the land can produce more than one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The ability can be activated if the opponent has no lands that produce mana, but the effect will not be able to generate any mana.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "This works even if the opponent\'s lands are tapped. It only checks what kinds of mana can be produced, not if the abilities that produce them are usable right now."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Fellwar Stone checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Fellwar Stone, you can tap Fellwar Stone for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Fellwar Stone doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Fellwar Stone can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, take into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there is more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Playing a land will trigger it, but putting a land onto the battlefield as part of an effect will not.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The X in the ability has the same value as the X paid in the Morph ability. This is pretty easy to derive since there is no other source of X.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The trigger occurs when you use the Morph ability to turn the card face up, or when an effect turns it face up. It will not trigger on being revealed or on leaving the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The precombat main phase is the first main phase of the turn. All others are postcombat main phases, even if they technically occur before combat.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The “precombat main phase” is the first main phase of the turn. All other main phases are “postcombat main phases.”'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This spell is countered and you get no Saprolings if the artifact is an illegal target on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You are never forced to sacrifice any permanents. You can choose to discard your entire hand if your hand is smaller than the number of cards you are required to discard.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You draw the cards, then sacrifice any permanents you want to sacrifice, then discard the required number of card from your hand. There is no chance to play any cards in between these actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Damage wears off simultaneously with this effect ending, so it does save an artifact creature from lethal damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If you cast this with Entwine, you don’t get priority in the middle of resolution. You can’t steal something, do anything (like attack with it), and then sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If you choose the “sacrifice a creature” mode, you choose the target of the damage on announcement, but don’t choose what to sacrifice until resolution. You must sacrifice a creature when Grab the Reins resolves, even if you don’t want to. If you don’t control any creatures at that time, Grab the Reins deals no damage.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'If you pay the entwine cost, you can sacrifice the creature you gain control of with Grab the Reins.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can get just one basic land card if you wish (or even none at all). If you get only one land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can’t split up a life total when you redistribute it. For example, suppose that in a two-player game your life total is 5 and your opponent’s life total is 15 when Reverse the Sands starts to resolve. You can choose to (a) leave the life totals as they are or (b) make your life total 15 and your opponent’s 5. You can’t choose to make your life total 20 and your opponent’s 0.'}, {'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You choose which player gets which life total when the spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If there isn’t a legal creature to attach Breath of Fury to after the enchanted creature is sacrificed, you don’t untap your creatures or get an additional combat phase, and Breath of Fury is put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'The ability doesn’t care why a card goes to your opponent’s graveyard — only that it does. The ability triggers when a card is put into your opponent’s graveyard from the stack (a spell resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered), from the battlefield (a permanent is destroyed or sacrificed), from the player’s hand (a card is discarded), from the player’s library (from a Millstone-like effect), or from any other zone.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'This ability triggers only on cards, so it won’t trigger when a token is put into your opponent’s graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "This spell isn\'t Modal. When it resolves, it will destroy the target if it\'s a creature or an enchantment, even if it changed from one to the other between targeting and resolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "This spell isn\'t modal. When it resolves, it will destroy the target if it\'s a creature or an artifact, even if it changed from one to the other between targeting and resolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-07-15\', \'text\': "The creature doesn\'t enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it. It enters the battlefield, then the ability triggers. If either that creature or Juniper Order Ranger leaves the battlefield before the ability resolves, the remaining creature will still get a +1/+1 counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-02-01\', \'text\': \'In the Two-Headed Giant format, you still only have to pay once per creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can\'t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-09-16\', \'text\': "The controller of the countered spell doesn\'t choose how many cards to draw until the relevant ability resolves. The player may draw 0, 1, or 2 cards. They choose the number before drawing any cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "At the time the ability resolves, you\'ll get to play the card if you declared three different creatures as attackers at any point in the turn. A creature declared as an attacker in two different attack phases counts only once. A creature that entered the battlefield attacking (such as a token created by Militia\'s Pride) doesn\'t count because you never attacked with it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \' Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'"Hideaway N" means "When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains \\\'The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\\\'"\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads "[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped," and they now have hideaway 4.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "At the time the last ability resolves, you\'ll get to play the card if a player who is currently your opponent, or a player who was your opponent at the time they left the game, has been dealt 7 damage over the course of the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter how the opponent was dealt damage or by whom, as long as the total damage is 7 or more. You don\'t specify an opponent when you activate the ability."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "You\'ll get to play the card even if Spinerock Knoll wasn\'t on the battlefield at the time some or all of the 7 damage was dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads “[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped,” and they now have hideaway 4.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "“Hideaway N” means “When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains ‘The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\'”"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability has you draw multiple cards, Hoofprints of the Stag\'s ability triggers that many times."}]', "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less to cast a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less while casting it for its evoke cost, too. That’s because they affect the total cost of the spell, not its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Evoke doesn’t change the timing of when you can cast the creature that has it. If you could cast that creature spell only when you could cast a sorcery, the same is true for cast it with evoke.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If a creature spell cast with evoke changes controllers before it enters the battlefield, it will still be sacrificed when it enters the battlefield. Similarly, if a creature cast with evoke changes controllers after it enters the battlefield but before its sacrifice ability resolves, it will still be sacrificed. In both cases, the controller of the creature at the time it left the battlefield will control its leaves-the-battlefield ability.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If you’re casting a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t use its evoke ability.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'When you cast a spell by paying its evoke cost, its mana cost doesn’t change. You just pay the evoke cost instead.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Whether evoke’s sacrifice ability triggers when the creature enters the battlefield depends on whether the spell’s controller chose to pay the evoke cost, not whether they actually paid it (if it was reduced or otherwise altered by another ability, for example).'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Reveillark’s ability may target zero, one, or two creature cards in your graveyard. Each target must have power 2 or less.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-04-01\', \'text\': \'Murmuring Bosk is a Forest, but it isn\\\'t a basic land. Things that affect basic lands don\\\'t affect it. Things that affect basic land types do. For example, you can\\\'t find Murmuring Bosk with Fertilid\\\'s ability ("searches their library for a basic land card"), but you can find Murmuring Bosk with Everbark Shaman\\\'s ability ("search your library for two Forest cards").\'}]', "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'The player whose turn it is searches their library (or chooses not to), then each other player in turn order does the same. Then the player whose turn it is shuffles their library (if that player searched), then each other player in turn order does the same.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'As the turn ends, the other creatures revert to what they were before. If two Mirrorweaves are cast on the same turn, they’ll both wear off at the same time.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Each other creature copies the printed values of the targeted creature, plus any copy effects that have been applied to that creature. They won’t copy other effects that have changed the targeted creature’s power, toughness, types, color, or so on. They also won’t copy counters on the targeted creature (they’ll each just retain the counters they already have).'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is a token, each other creature copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield. Those creatures don’t become tokens.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is itself copying a creature, each other creature will become whatever it’s copying, as modified by that copy effect. For example, if you target a Cemetery Puca that’s copying a Grizzly Bears (a 2/2 creature with no abilities), each other creature will become a Grizzly Bears with the Cemetery Puca ability.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Noncopy effects that have already applied to the other creatures will continue to apply to them. For example, if Giant Growth had given one of them +3/+3 earlier in the turn, then Mirrorweave made it a copy of Grizzly Bears, it will be a 5/5 Grizzly Bears.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This effect can cause each other creature to stop being a creature. For example, if you target an animated Mutavault (a land with an activated ability that turns it into a creature), only the printed wording will be copied — the “becomes a creature” effect won’t. Each other creature will become an unanimated Mutavault.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Effects that replace an event with gaining life (like Words of Worship’s effect does) will end up replacing the event with nothing.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Effects that would replace gaining life with some other effect won’t be able to do anything because it’s impossible for players to gain life.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a cost includes life gain (like Invigorate’s alternative cost does), that cost can’t be paid.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If an effect says to set your life total to a certain number, and that number is higher than your current life total, that effect will normally cause you to gain life equal to the difference. With Everlasting Torment on the battlefield, that part of the effect won’t do anything. (If the number is lower than your current life total, the effect will work as normal.)'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Spells and abilities that replace or redirect damage aren’t affected by Everlasting Torment’s second ability. They’ll work as normal.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Spells and abilities that would normally cause a player to gain life still resolve, but the life-gain part simply has no effect.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The last ability affects all damage, whether it’s dealt by creatures, other permanents, spells, or cards that aren’t on the battlefield. Wither works everywhere.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The “damage can’t be prevented” statement overrides all forms of preventing damage, including protection abilities. Damage prevention spells and abilities can still be cast and played; they just don’t do anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a nontoken creature that gains persist this way is put into a graveyard, that card will be returned to the battlefield with a -1/-1 counter on it. However, because it’s a new object with no relation to its previous existence, the returned creature will not have persist.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist stops being a creature, persist will still work.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won’t trigger and the card won’t return to the battlefield. That’s because persist checks the creature’s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a permanent has multiple instances of persist, they’ll each trigger separately, but the redundant instances will have no effect. If one instance returns the card to the battlefield, the next to resolve will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a token with no -1/-1 counters on it has persist, the ability will trigger when the token is put into the graveyard. However, the token will cease to exist and can’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with persist are put into the graveyard at the same time (due to combat damage or a spell that destroys all creatures, for example), the active player (the player whose turn it is) puts all of their persist triggers on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last trigger put on the stack is the first one that resolves. That means that in a two-player game, the nonactive player’s persist creatures will return to the battlefield first, then the active player’s persist creatures do the same. The creatures return to the battlefield one at a time.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The persist ability triggers when the permanent is put into a graveyard. Its last known information (that is, how the creature last existed on the battlefield) is used to determine whether it had a -1/-1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'When a permanent with persist returns to the battlefield, it’s a new object with no memory of or connection to its previous existence.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': \'A retrace card cast from your graveyard follows the normal timing rules for its card type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': "As the token is created, it checks the printed values of the creature it\'s copying — or, if that creature is itself a token, the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield — as well as any copy effects that have been applied to it. It won\'t copy counters on the creature, nor will it copy other effects that have changed the creature\'s power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': "Casting a card by using its retrace ability works just like casting any other spell, with two exceptions: You\'re casting it from your graveyard rather than your hand, and you must discard a land card in addition to any other costs."}, {\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': "If the active player casts a spell that has retrace, that player may cast that card again after it resolves, before another player can remove the card from the graveyard. The active player has priority after the spell resolves, so they can immediately cast a new spell. Since casting a card with retrace from the graveyard moves that card onto the stack, no one else would have the chance to affect it while it\'s still in the graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2008-08-01\', \'text\': "When a retrace card you cast from your graveyard resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered, it\'s put back into your graveyard. You may use the retrace ability to cast it again."}]', "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A retrace card cast from your graveyard follows the normal timing rules for its card type.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'Casting a card by using its retrace ability works just like casting any other spell, with two exceptions: You’re casting it from your graveyard rather than your hand, and you must discard a land card in addition to any other costs.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If the active player casts a spell that has retrace, that player may cast that card again after it resolves, before another player can remove the card from the graveyard. The active player has priority after the spell resolves, so they can immediately cast a new spell. Since casting a card with retrace from the graveyard moves that card onto the stack, no one else would have the chance to affect it while it’s still in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If you cast Worm Harvest from your graveyard by using retrace, the land you discard as an additional cost will be counted by Worm Harvest when it resolves.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'When a retrace card you cast from your graveyard resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered, it’s put back into your graveyard. You may use the retrace ability to cast it again.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Casting a card with retrace from your graveyard follows the normal timing rules for its card type.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'When a retrace card you cast from your graveyard resolves or is countered, it’s put back into your graveyard. You may use the retrace ability to cast it again. If it’s your turn, you may do so before any other player may take actions to try to remove it from your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If the opponent only has lands that produce colorless or no mana, this card’s ability can still be activated; it just won’t produce any mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with devour are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, you may use each one’s devour ability. A creature you already control can be devoured by only one of them, however. (In other words, you can’t sacrifice the same creature to satisfy multiple devour abilities.) All creatures devoured this way are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If you cast this as a spell, you choose how many and which creatures to devour as part of the resolution of that spell. (It can’t be countered at this point.) The same is true of a spell or ability that lets you put a creature with devour onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The number of Saproling tokens created by the triggered ability is based on the number of +1/+1 counters on Mycoloth, not on the number of creatures Mycoloth devoured. It doesn’t matter where the +1/+1 counters came from.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may choose not to sacrifice any creatures for the Devour ability.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may sacrifice only creatures that are already on the battlefield. If a creature with devour and another creature are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, the creature with devour can’t devour that other creature. The creature with devour also can’t devour itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted card is removed from the graveyard before the ability resolves, the ability doesn’t resolve. You won’t get a Saproling token.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If this spell is copied, the copy will have the same mode as the original.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "While the spell is on the stack, treat it as though its only text is the chosen mode. The other two modes are treated as though they don\'t exist. You don\'t choose targets for those modes."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "You can choose a mode only if you can choose legal targets for that mode. If you can\'t choose legal targets for any of the modes, you can\'t cast the spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "This effect can reduce only the generic portion of the artifact spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "This effect doesn\'t change the mana cost or mana value of an artifact spell. Rather, it reduces the total cost of the spell, which is the amount you actually pay while casting it. The total cost takes into account additional or alternative costs."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Reliquary Tower onto the battlefield, you\'ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents enter the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two."}]', "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Blood Tyrant’s second ability causes each player to lose 1 life, including you. Blood Tyrant will count each player’s life loss, including yours, when determining how many +1/+1 counters it gets.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Blood Tyrant’s third ability will trigger no matter how a player loses the game: due to a state-based action (as a result of having a life total of 0 or less, trying to draw a card from an empty library, or having ten poison counters), a spell or ability that says that player loses the game, a concession, or a game loss awarded by a judge.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game using the limited range of influence option (such as a Grand Melee game), if a spell or ability says that you win the game, it instead causes all of your opponents within your range of influence to lose the game. This is another way by which Blood Tyrant’s third ability can trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Creatures with bribery counters on them can’t be declared as attackers or blockers. However, if a bribery counter is put on a creature that’s already been declared as an attacker or blocker, that creature will continue to attack or block that combat.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'If Gwafa Hazid leaves the battlefield, any bribery counters will remain where they are. However, without a Gwafa Hazid on the battlefield, creatures with bribery counters on them can attack and block as normal. If another Gwafa Hazid enters the battlefield, its ability will affect all creatures with bribery counters on them, including the ones that received counters from a different Gwafa Hazid.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Exotic Orchard checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Exotic Orchard, you can tap Exotic Orchard for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Exotic Orchard doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Lands that produce mana based only on what other lands "could produce" won\\\'t help each other unless some other land allows one of them to actually produce some type of mana. For example, if you control an Exotic Orchard and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, none of those lands would produce mana if their mana abilities were activated. On the other hand, if you control a Forest and an Exotic Orchard, and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, then each of those lands can be tapped to produce {G}. Your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G} because you control a Forest. Your Exotic Orchard and your opponent\\\'s Reflecting Pool can each produce {G} because your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Exotic Orchard can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, Exotic Orchard takes into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there are more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'The card you find must be both an artifact and a creature.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-05-01\', \'text\': "Because Lavalanche doesn\'t target any creatures, it will deal damage to creatures with shroud. Any damage it would deal to creatures with appropriate protection abilities will still be prevented, however."}, {\'date\': \'2009-05-01\', \'text\': "If the targeted player has become an illegal target by the time Lavalanche resolves, Lavalanche doesn\'t resolve. Nothing will be dealt damage."}]', "[{'date': '2009-05-01', 'text': 'Filigree Angel’s enters-the-battlefield ability counts Filigree Angel itself, assuming that it’s still on the battlefield and still an artifact by the time the ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Forest or Plains, not for lands named Forest or Plains. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Hallowed Fountain (a nonbasic land with the land types Plains and Island), Sunpetal Grove will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Mountain or Forest, not for lands named Mountain or Forest. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Temple Garden (a nonbasic land with the land types Forest and Plains), Rootbound Crag will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Swamp or Mountain, not for lands named Swamp or Mountain. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Stomping Ground (a nonbasic land with the land types Mountain and Forest), Dragonskull Summit will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "If you attack with multiple creatures, Beastmaster Ascension\'s first ability triggers multiple times."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If an opponent casts a spell, this ability triggers and is put on the stack on top of that spell. This ability will resolve (meaning that a revealed creature card will enter the battlefield) before the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You must put the revealed card onto the battlefield if it’s a creature card. If it’s not a creature card and you don’t put it on the bottom of your library, it stops being revealed and simply remains on top of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability can only target an opponent of the current player.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The targeted player controlling more creatures than the current player is a part of the targeting requirement. A player can’t be targeted by this ability unless it’s true, and the ability doesn’t resolve if it’s no longer true at that time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "As the ability resolves, you can\'t put the Ogre token onto the battlefield without explicitly giving the attacking player the option to pay {3}, even if the attacking player has forgotten about this ability."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'If an attacking creature has a "Whenever this creature attacks" ability, that ability is put on the stack first, then Kazuul\\\'s ability is put on the stack. Although Kazuul\\\'s ability will resolve first, and potentially create an Ogre token, any target of the other ability will already have been chosen at this point, and thus could not have been the new Ogre token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "If you\'re the defending player, Kazuul\'s ability triggers once for each creature that attacks, not just once per combat. The attacking player chooses whether to pay {3} or let you have an Ogre token each time one of those abilities resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, the ability checks whether you\'re the defending player for each individual attacking creature. For example, if one creature attacks you and two creatures attack another player, Kazuul\'s ability triggers just once."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'The ability triggers and resolves during the declare attackers step. If you put an Ogre token onto the battlefield as a result, you may block with it during that combat phase.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "You\'re the defending player if a creature is attacking you, a planeswalker you control, or a battle you protect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined as the ability starts to resolve. If the targeted player has five cards in their graveyard at that time, for example, this ability will put five more cards into that graveyard from the top of that player\'s library."}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you choose to find only one basic land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Venser’s Journal onto the battlefield, you’ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents enter the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Although creature tokens go to the graveyard before ceasing to exist, they never count as creature cards and won\'t increase the bonus granted by Bonehoard, however briefly."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If lethal damage is dealt simultaneously to the equipped creature and another creature, both creatures are put into the graveyard at the same time. The equipped creature won\'t get an additional bonus from the other creature."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If there are no creature cards in any graveyard when Bonehoard\'s living weapon ability resolves, the Germ will be 0/0 and put into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'The value of X is calculated continuously as the number of creature cards in graveyards changes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the Germ token is destroyed, the Equipment remains on the battlefield as with any other Equipment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the living weapon trigger causes two Germs to be created (due to an effect such as that of Doubling Season), the Equipment becomes attached to one of them. The other will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Like other Equipment, each Equipment with living weapon has an equip cost. You can pay this cost to attach an Equipment to another creature you control. Once the Germ token is no longer equipped, it will be put into your graveyard and subsequently cease to exist, unless another effect raises its toughness above 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'The Germ token enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature and the Equipment becomes attached to it before state-based actions would cause the token to die. Abilities that trigger as the token enters the battlefield see that a 0/0 creature entered the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Any triggered abilities that trigger because a creature was destroyed won\'t be put onto the stack until after Phyrexian Rebirth finishes resolving. This means the Horror creature token can be targeted by those abilities, if applicable."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If a creature regenerates or has indestructible, it won\'t be counted when determining the value of X."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "The ability will trigger when Ichor Wellspring is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, even if the ability that triggered when it entered the battlefield hasn\'t resolved yet."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "The ability will trigger when Mycosynth Wellspring is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, even if the ability that triggered when it entered the battlefield hasn\'t resolved yet."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'A card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its mana cost is each color that appears in that mana cost, regardless of how that cost may have been paid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'As you cast a spell or activate an activated ability with one or more Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, you choose how to pay for each Phyrexian mana symbol at the same time you would choose modes or choose a value for X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If you\'re at 1 life or less, you can\'t pay 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Phyrexian mana is not a new color. Players can\'t add Phyrexian mana to their mana pools."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'To calculate the mana value of a card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, count each Phyrexian mana symbol as 1.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "Whenever you proliferate" triggers even if you chose no permanents or players while doing so.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a permanent ever has both +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it at the same time, they\'re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a player or permanent has more than one kind of counter on it, and you choose for it to get additional counters, it must get one of each kind of counter it already has. You can\'t have it get just one kind of counter it already has and not the others."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can choose any player who has a counter, including opponents. You can\'t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since "any number" includes zero, you don\\\'t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don\\\'t have to choose any players at all.\'}]', "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If an effect causes you to draw multiple cards, Psychosis Crawler will trigger that many times.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If one or more creatures an opponent controls are put into the graveyard at the same time as Sangromancer, Sangromancer’s first ability will trigger that many times.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'The number of artifacts you control is counted when the ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "A creature controlled by an opponent that deals combat damage to another opponent will cause Edric\'s ability to trigger. The creature\'s controller chooses whether to draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'When a creature you control deals combat damage to one of your opponents, you may draw a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-01-19\', \'text\': \'Edric, Spymaster of Trest is banned as a commander in Duel Commander format, but it may be part of your deck.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is a card with one or more of the following card types: artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the permanent is an illegal target by the time Chaos Warp tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will occur. No library will be shuffled and no card will be revealed."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the revealed card is a permanent card but can\'t enter the battlefield (perhaps because it\'s an Aura with nothing to enchant), it remains on top of that library."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'If the revealed card is not a permanent card, it remains on top of that library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "The owner of a token is the player under whose control the token was put onto the battlefield. If a token is shuffled into a player\'s library this way, that player shuffles before revealing the top card of that library."}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The card-drawing part of the effect is not optional. A player can’t choose to draw fewer than X cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The owner of a card is the player who started the game with that card in their deck.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The owner of a token is the player under whose control the token was put onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You may find any number of basic lands up to X, including zero. However, searching and shuffling your library is not optional.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'The creature that entered the battlefield and caused the ability to trigger will also get a +1/+1 counter, provided it’s still on the battlefield when the ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "Etherium-Horn Sorcerer\'s first ability can only be activated when it is on the battlefield. If Etherium-Horn Sorcerer isn\'t on the battlefield when the ability resolves, the ability won\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a recent rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If one of Spelltwine’s targets is illegal when Spelltwine tries to resolve, you’ll still exile and copy the remaining legal target.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If the card has X in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'Spelltwine has two targets: the instant or sorcery card in your graveyard and the one in an opponent’s graveyard. You can’t cast Spelltwine unless you can choose both legal targets.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The copies are created in exile and cast from exile. The cards remain exiled.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The copy you cast first will already be on the stack when you cast the other copy. If that spell targets a spell, you may choose the first copy as a legal target.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You can cast the copies in either order.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If you control Sphere of Safety, your opponents can choose not to attack with a creature with an ability that says it attacks if able.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'The value of X is determined when the triggered ability resolves. If Wild Beastmaster is no longer on the battlefield at that time, use its last known power to determine the value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If this creature\'s power is negative as its ability resolves, X is considered to be 0. (This is a change from previous rulings.)"}]', "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'Use the sacrificed creature’s toughness when it was last on the battlefield to determine the value of X.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "Fathom Mage\'s last ability will trigger whenever any +1/+1 counter is placed on it, not just ones due to the evolve ability."}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'If Fathom Mage enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it (perhaps due to Master Biomancer), its last ability will trigger once for each +1/+1 counter it entered the battlefield with.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'If multiple +1/+1 counters are placed on Fathom Mage simultaneously, its last ability will trigger once for each of those counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'If a creature enters the battlefield with +1/+1 counters on it, consider those counters when determining if evolve will trigger. For example, a 1/1 creature that enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it will cause the evolve ability of a 2/2 creature to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'If evolve triggers, the stat comparison will happen again when the ability tries to resolve. If neither stat of the new creature is greater, the ability will do nothing. If the creature that entered the battlefield leaves the battlefield before evolve tries to resolve, use its last known power and toughness to compare the stats.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'If multiple creatures enter the battlefield at the same time, evolve may trigger multiple times, although the stat comparison will take place each time one of those abilities tries to resolve. For example, if you control a 2/2 creature with evolve and two 3/3 creatures enter the battlefield, evolve will trigger twice. The first ability will resolve and put a +1/+1 counter on the creature with evolve. When the second ability tries to resolve, neither the power nor the toughness of the new creature is greater than that of the creature with evolve, so that ability does nothing.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "When comparing the stats as the evolve ability resolves, it\'s possible that the stat that\'s greater changes from power to toughness or vice versa. If this happens, the ability will still resolve and you\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature with evolve. For example, if you control a 2/2 creature with evolve and a 1/3 creature enters the battlefield under your control, it toughness is greater so evolve will trigger. In response, the 1/3 creature gets +2/-2. When the evolve trigger tries to resolve, its power is greater. You\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature with evolve."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'When comparing the stats of the two creatures for evolve, you always compare power to power and toughness to toughness.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, check its power and toughness against the power and toughness of the creature with evolve. If neither stat of the new creature is greater, evolve won\'t trigger at all."}]', "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Each player draws cards simultaneously. If this causes a player to draw more cards than are left in their library, that player will lose the game. If this causes all players to do so, the game is a draw. (In multiplayer games, multiple players drawing from an empty library will cause those players to lose although the game may continue.)'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'You’ll draw cards before deciding which creature (if any) Whispering Madness will be encoded on.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a creature with an encoded card deals combat damage to more than one player simultaneously (perhaps because some of the combat damage was redirected), the triggered ability will trigger once for each player it deals combat damage to. Each ability will create a copy of the exiled card and allow you to cast it.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If another player gains control of the creature, that player will control the triggered ability. That player will create a copy of the encoded card and may cast it.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the creature leaves the battlefield, the exiled card will no longer be encoded on any creature. It will stay exiled.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the spell with cipher doesn’t resolve, none of its effects will happen, including cipher. The card will go to its owner’s graveyard and won’t be encoded on a creature.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you choose not to cast the copy, or you can’t cast it (perhaps because there are no legal targets available), the copy will cease to exist the next time state-based actions are performed. You won’t get a chance to cast the copy at a later time.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you want to encode the card with cipher onto a noncreature permanent such as a Keyrune that can turn into a creature, that permanent has to be a creature before the spell with cipher starts resolving. You can choose only a creature to encode the card onto.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The copy of the card with cipher is created in and cast from exile.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The exiled card with cipher grants a triggered ability to the creature it’s encoded on. If that creature loses that ability and subsequently deals combat damage to a player, the triggered ability won’t trigger. However, the exiled card will continue to be encoded on that creature.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The spell with cipher is encoded on the creature as part of that spell’s resolution, just after the spell’s other effects. That card goes directly from the stack to exile. It never goes to the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You cast the copy of the card with cipher during the resolution of the triggered ability. Ignore timing restrictions based on the card’s type.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You choose the creature as the spell resolves. The cipher ability doesn’t target that creature, although the spell with cipher may target that creature (or a different creature) because of its other abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If you activate Rubblehulk’s bloodrush ability, the value of X is the number of lands you control when that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'The ability that defines Rubblehulk’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If you don’t control twenty or more artifacts at the beginning of your upkeep, Hellkite Tyrant’s last ability won’t trigger. If it does trigger, it will check again when it tries to resolve. If you don’t control twenty or more artifacts at that time, the ability will do nothing.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'The value of X is the same for each mode you choose.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'You can choose just one mode, any two of the modes, or all three. You make this choice as you cast Clan Defiance.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'To determine how many additional +1/+1 counters a creature enters the battlefield with, use Master Biomancer’s power as that creature is entering the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'You choose the mode as you cast the spell.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "A creature that deals combat damage to a player must have a +1/+1 counter on it at the time damage is dealt in order for Bred for the Hunt\'s ability to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers when something “attacks and isn\'t blocked” triggers in the declare blockers step after blockers are declared if (1) that creature is attacking and (2) no creatures are declared to block it. It will trigger even if that creature was put onto the battlefield attacking rather than having been declared as an attacker in the declare attackers step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "The effect of Vorel\'s ability will essentially double the counters on the target artifact, creature, or land. For example, if a creature has three +1/+1 counters and a divinity counter on it before the ability resolves, it will have six +1/+1 counters and two divinity counters on it after the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Progenitor Mimic enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "If Progenitor Mimic somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, it can\'t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature has {X} in its mana cost (such as Protean Hydra), X is considered to be zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "If the chosen creature is a token, Progenitor Mimic copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield. Copying a token doesn\'t make Progenitor Mimic become a token."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "If you choose to have Progenitor Mimic enter the battlefield as a copy of a creature, the triggered ability it gains will become part of its copiable values. For example, suppose Progenitor Mimic enters the battlefield as a copy of Runeclaw Bear, a 2/2 green Bear creature with mana cost {1}{G}. The resulting object is a 2/2 green Bear creature named Runeclaw Bear with mana cost {1}{G} and with “At the beginning of your upkeep, if this creature isn\'t a token, put a token onto the battlefield that\'s a copy of this creature.” If another Progenitor Mimic enters the battlefield as a copy of that creature, it will be a Runeclaw Bear with two instances of the triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "Progenitor Mimic copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing more (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'The original Progenitor Mimic will create tokens, but those token copies will not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Progenitor Mimic enters the battlefield as a 0/0 Shapeshifter creature and is probably put into the graveyard immediately.\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you tap Zhur-Taa Druid for mana during the process of casting a spell or activating an ability, its triggered ability will resolve before that spell or ability.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Zhur-Taa Druid’s last ability doesn’t trigger if it becomes tapped for any other reason. However, if Zhur-Taa Druid gains another mana ability that requires you tap it, its ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Zhur-Taa Druid’s last ability isn’t a mana ability. It uses the stack and can be responded to.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain from extort is based on the total amount of life lost, not necessarily the number of opponents you have. For example, if your opponent’s life total can’t change (perhaps because that player controls Platinum Emperion), you won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The extort ability doesn’t target any player.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You may pay {W/B} a maximum of one time for each extort triggered ability. You decide whether to pay when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The triggered ability is put onto the stack after you have already drawn your card for the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Although originally printed with a characteristic-defining ability that defined its color, this card now has a color indicator. This color indicator can’t be affected by text-changing effects (such as the one created by Crystal Spray), although color-changing effects can still overwrite it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A card with no mana cost can’t be cast normally; you’ll need a way to cast it for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost, such as by suspending it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If a card with no mana cost is given an alternative cost equal to its mana cost (by Snapcaster Mage, for example), that cost cannot be paid and the card cannot be cast this way.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Dredge lets you replace any card draw, not just the one during your draw step.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Once you decide to replace a draw using a card’s dredge ability, that card can’t be removed from your graveyard “in response.” (Replacement effects don’t use the stack.)'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You can’t use dredge unless you’re going to draw a card and the card with dredge is already in your graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "To double the number of +1/+1 counters on a creature, determine how many +1/+1 counters are on the creature and put that many more on it. Effects that interact with counters (such as the one created by Corpsejack Menace\'s ability) may change the number of counters ultimately put on the creature."}]', "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If any creature leaves your control, it will retain indestructible.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Lethal damage and effects that say “destroy” won’t cause a creature with indestructible to be put into the graveyard. However, a creature with indestructible can be put into the graveyard for a number of reasons. The most likely reasons are if it’s sacrificed, if it’s legendary and another legendary creature with the same name is controlled by the same player, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Once Dauntless Escort’s ability resolves, the set of creatures it affects is locked in. It won’t affect creatures that enter the battlefield after the ability has finished resolving.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'If the permanent is still a legal target but is not destroyed (perhaps because it regenerated or has indestructible), its controller still gets the Beast token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Beast Within tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player creates a Beast token. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create a Beast token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'If you choose the second mode, permanents that come under your control later in the turn will not have indestructible.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Planeswalkers with indestructible will still have loyalty counters removed from them as they are dealt damage. If planeswalker with indestructible has no loyalty counters, it will still be put into its owner\'s graveyard, as the rule that does this doesn\'t destroy the planeswalker."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Akroan Horse\'s enters-the-battlefield ability doesn\'t target any opponent. In a multiplayer game, you choose the opponent as the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "In the last ability, “each opponent” refers to opponents of Akroan Horse\'s controller. In most situations in two-player games, your opponent will control Akroan Horse and you\'ll put Soldier tokens onto the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "If you draw multiple cards, Horizon Chimera\'s ability will trigger that many times. Each of these abilities will cause a separate life-gaining event."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Swan Song can target a spell that can\'t be countered. That spell won\'t be countered when Swan Song resolves, but its controller will get a Bird token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Spellheart Chimera\'s power functions in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'If an Equipment attached to a creature becomes a creature, it becomes unattached. An Equipment that is also a creature can’t equip another creature.'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'If the noncreature artifact had any other supertypes, types, or subtypes, it will keep those. In most cases, the artifact creature won’t have any creature types.'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'Multiple instances of deathtouch or lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'After each opponent has decided, the effect happens simultaneously for each one who accepted the offer. Then, the effect happens again for you a number of times equal to the number of opponents who accepted.'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'Your opponents decide in turn order whether or not they accept the offer, starting with the opponent on your left. Each opponent will know the decisions of previous opponents in turn order when making their decision.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': \'If you choose 1 for the value of X, Astral Cornucopia will cost {3} to cast and enter the battlefield with one charge counter. If you choose 2 for the value of X, it will cost {6} to cast and enter the battlefield with two charge counters, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "The last ability is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', "[{'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'If you put all permanents you control into one pile, you’ll have a two-thirds chance of not having to sacrifice any permanents, but a one-third chance of having to sacrifice all of them.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'To choose a pile at random, each pile must have an equal chance of being chosen. There are many ways to do this, including assigning each pile a number and rolling a die.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'You may put Auras or Equipment into one pile and the creatures they were attached to into a different pile.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can’t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Iroas\'s last ability prevents all damage dealt to attacking creatures you control, not just combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won\'t be counted when determining this."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Counters put on a God remain on it while it\'s not a creature, even if they have no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won\'t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The abilities of Gods function as long as they\'re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they\'re creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It\'s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It\'s always a creature spell while it\'s on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Your devotion to two colors is the number of mana symbols among mana costs of permanents you control that are the first color, the second, or both. If an effect counts your devotion to two colors, a hybrid symbol that is both of those colors is counted just once.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional costs for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If all of the spell\'s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If one or more of its targets are legal when it tries to resolve, the spell will resolve and affect only those legal targets. It will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If such a spell is copied, and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Solidarity of Heroes can target any creatures, not just ones with +1/+1 counters on them. Notably, heroic abilities of any target creatures that put +1/+1 counters on that creature will resolve before Solidarity of Heroes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The mana cost and mana value of strive spells don\'t change no matter how many targets they have. Strive abilities affect only what you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "If Realm Seekers enters the battlefield directly from a player\'s hand without being cast, it counts itself when determining the value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'The value of X is determined as Realm Seekers enters the battlefield. Players can cast spells and activate abilities while Realm Seekers is on the stack to remove cards from their hands if they wish, and this will result in fewer counters being placed on Realm Seekers as it enters the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'Except in some very rare cases, the card each player draws will be the card revealed from the top of their library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "If you activate Selvala\'s ability while casting a spell, and you discover you can\'t produce enough mana to pay that spell\'s costs, the spell is reversed. The spell returns to whatever zone you were casting it from. You may reverse other mana abilities you activated while casting the spell, but Selvala\'s ability can\'t be reversed. Whatever mana that ability produced will be in your mana pool and each player will have drawn a card."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Selvala\'s parley ability is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Although Darksteel Citadel is an artifact, it can\'t be cast as a spell. Playing it follows the normal rules for playing a land."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Exiling the Soul from your graveyard is part of the last ability\'s activation cost. A player can\'t remove the Soul in response to prevent you from activating the ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'You can activate the last ability only if the Soul is in your graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "If enough -1/-1 counters are put on Chasm Skulker at the same time to make its toughness 0 or less, the number of +1/+1 counters on it before it got any -1/-1 counters will be used to determine how many Squid tokens you get. For example, if there are two +1/+1 counters on Chasm Skulker and it gets three -1/-1 counters, you\'ll get two Squid tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'If you draw multiple cards, the first ability will trigger that many times. Each of these abilities will cause a +1/+1 counter to be put on Chasm Skulker.\'}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Abilities that apply “as [this creature] enters the battlefield,” such as choosing a creature to copy with Mercurial Pretender, are also unaffected.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Abilities that create replacement effects, such as a permanent entering the battlefield tapped or with counters on it, are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Hushwing Gryff’s ability stops a creature’s own enters-the-battlefield triggered abilities as well as other triggered abilities that would trigger when a creature enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If Hushwing Gryff and another creature enter the battlefield at the same time, neither creature entering the battlefield will cause triggered abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Look at the permanent as it exists on the battlefield, taking into account continuous effects, to determine whether any triggered abilities will trigger. For example, if you control March of the Machines, which says, in part, “Each noncreature artifact is an artifact creature,” each artifact will be a creature at the time it enters the battlefield and will not cause triggered abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The trigger event doesn’t have to specify “creatures” entering the battlefield. For example, Amulet of Vigor says “Whenever a permanent enters the battlefield tapped and under your control, untap it.” If a creature enters the battlefield tapped and under your control, Amulet of Vigor’s ability would not trigger. If a land (that isn’t also a creature) enters the battlefield tapped and under your control, Amulet of Vigor’s ability would trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They’re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].”'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Multiple instances of convoke on a single spell are redundant.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "If you choose the third mode, you choose how the counters will be distributed as you cast the spell. Notably, if you choose to put one +1/+1 counter on each of two target creatures, and one of those creatures becomes an illegal target in response, the +1/+1 counter that would have been put on that creature is lost. It can\'t be put on the remaining legal target."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "You decide which creature to spare as Duneblast resolves. This choice doesn\'t target the creature. If you don\'t choose a creature, then all creatures will be destroyed."}]', "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Crackling Doom doesn’t target any player or creature. For example, a creature with protection from black could be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a player controls two or more creatures tied for the greatest power among creatures they control, that player chooses one of them to sacrifice.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, each opponent, starting with the active player and proceeding in turn order, chooses which creature they will sacrifice and then all creatures are sacrificed at the same time. Each successive player will know what the players before them chose to sacrifice.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The sacrifice is not dependent on the damage being dealt. It doesn’t matter if that damage is prevented or redirected.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Several creatures with outlast also grant an ability to creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them, including themselves. These counters could come from an outlast ability, but any +1/+1 counter on the creature will count.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "The cost to activate a creature\'s outlast ability includes the tap symbol ({T}). A creature\'s outlast ability can\'t be activated unless that creature has been under your control continuously since the beginning of your turn."}]', "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Several creatures with outlast also grant an ability to creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them, including themselves. These counters could come from an outlast ability, but any +1/+1 counter on the creature will count.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The cost to activate a creature’s outlast ability includes the tap symbol ({T}). A creature’s outlast ability can’t be activated unless that creature has been under your control continuously since the beginning of your turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The last ability is cumulative. If you control an additional Brave the Sands, your creatures will each be able to block three creatures, and so on.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to sacrifice a creature, and you control any creatures other than the creature equipped with Assault Suit, you must sacrifice one of them. You can\'t try to sacrifice the equipped creature, fail, and therefore ignore the effect."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "The equipped creature can\'t be sacrificed for any reason. If an effect instructs you to sacrifice it, you can\'t and it remains on the battlefield. You also can\'t sacrifice it to pay a cost that requires you to sacrifice a creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': \'If a triggered ability granted by a lieutenant ability triggers, and in response to that trigger you lose control of your commander (causing the lieutenant to lose that ability), that triggered ability will still resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If you gain control of a creature with a lieutenant ability owned by another player, that ability will check to see if you control your commander and will apply if you do. It won\'t check whether its owner controls their commander."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If you lose control of your commander, lieutenant abilities of creatures you control will immediately stop applying. If this causes a creature\'s toughness to become less than or equal to the amount of damage marked on it, the creature will be destroyed."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': \'Lieutenant abilities apply only if your commander is on the battlefield and under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Lieutenant abilities refer only to whether you control your commander, not any other player\'s commander."}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The ability of Daretti’s emblem will return the artifact card only if it’s still in your graveyard when the delayed triggered ability resolves at the beginning of the next end step. If the artifact card left your graveyard before that point (even if it was put back into your graveyard), the ability won’t return it to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You choose which artifact to sacrifice as the second ability resolves. You must sacrifice an artifact if you control at least one at that time. For example, if you control two artifacts when you activate the second ability, but the artifact you intended to sacrifice is destroyed in response, you must sacrifice the other artifact as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'You may choose to discard zero cards as the first ability resolves. In that case, you won’t draw any cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Bolster itself doesn\'t target any creature, though some spells and abilities that bolster may have other effects that target creatures. For example, you could put counters on a creature with protection from white with Abzan Skycaptain\'s bolster ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'You determine which creature to put counters on as the spell or ability that instructs you to bolster resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have names, they can’t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If you manifest a card owned by an opponent and you leave the game, that card is exiled.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Some older Magic sets feature double-faced cards, which have a Magic card face on each side rather than a Magic card face on one side and a Magic card back on the other. The rules for double-faced cards are changing slightly to account for the possibility that they are manifested. If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. A double-faced permanent on the battlefield still can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'The pile is shuffled to disguise from your opponents which manifested creature is which. After you manifest the cards, you can look at them.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'There are no cards in the Fate Reforged set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn’t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it’s a creature card.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on).'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'All blocking declarations must still be legal.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If there’s a cost associated with having a creature block and you choose for that creature to block, its controller can choose to pay that cost or not. If that player decides to not pay that cost, you must propose a new set of blocking creatures.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if more than one player activates Brutal Hordechief’s activated ability on the same turn, the controller of the last ability to resolve will choose how any creatures controlled by players who didn’t resolve this ability will block.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'The defending player affected by Brutal Hordechief’s triggered ability is determined relative to the creature that attacked. For example, if Brutal Hordechief attacked one opponent and two other creatures you control attacked another opponent, the first opponent would lose 1 life and the second opponent would lose 2 life. You’d gain a total of 3 life.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You’ll choose how each creature controlled by an opponent blocks, even if that creature wasn’t on the battlefield or wasn’t controlled by an opponent as the activated ability resolved.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'Each Siege will have one of the two listed abilities, depending on your choice as it enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Each of the last two abilities is linked to the first ability. They each refer only to the choice made as a result of the first ability. If a permanent enters the battlefield as a copy of one of the Sieges, its controller will make a new choice for that Siege. Which ability the copy has won\'t depend on the choice made for the original permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'The words “Khans” and “Dragons” are anchor words, connecting your choice to the appropriate ability. Anchor words are a new rules concept. “[Anchor word] — [Ability]” means “As long as you chose [anchor word] as this permanent entered the battlefield, this permanent has [ability].” Notably, the anchor word “Dragons” has no connection to the creature type Dragon.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "A creature entering the battlefield with one or more +1/+1 counters on it will cause Enduring Scalelord\'s ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "If +1/+1 counters are put on multiple creatures you control (other than Enduring Scalelord) at the same time, Enduring Scalelord\'s ability will trigger once for each of those creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "If you control two Enduring Scalelords, putting a +1/+1 counter on one of them will cause the ability of the other one to trigger. When this ability resolves, you\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on the other Scalelord. This will cause the ability of the first one to trigger. This loop will repeat until you choose not to put a +1/+1 counter on one of the Enduring Scalelords."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "If a face-down creature with megamorph is turned face up some other way (for example, if you manifest a card with megamorph and then pay its mana cost to turn it face up), you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on it."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'Megamorph is a variant of the morph ability. You can find more information on morph on cards with morph from the Khans of Tarkir set.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Turning a face-down creature with megamorph face up and putting a +1/+1 counter on it is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "You compare Den Protector\'s power to the power of any creature trying to block it only as blockers are assigned. Once Den Protector has been legally blocked by a creature, changing the power of either creature won\'t change or undo the block."}]', "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If the target has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If the target instant or sorcery card becomes an illegal target before Volcanic Vision resolves, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No damage will be dealt and Volcanic Vision won’t be exiled.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Managorger Hydra\'s last ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Like most lands, each land in this cycle is colorless. The damage dealt to you is dealt by a colorless source.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The damage dealt to you is part of the second mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Causing an opponent to lose the game after you\'ve announced that you\'re casting a spell with undaunted and determined its total cost won\'t cause you to have to pay more mana."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Effects that reduce what you pay to cast a spell don\'t affect its mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "If each target is illegal as Seeds of Renewal resolves, Seeds of Renewal doesn\'t resolve and is put into its owner\'s graveyard. It\'s not exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "If one target becomes illegal before Seeds of Renewal resolves, you\'ll still return the legal target from your graveyard to your hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Causing an opponent to lose the game after you\'ve announced that you\'re casting a spell with undaunted and determined its total cost won\'t cause you to have to pay more mana."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Effects that reduce what you pay to cast a spell don\'t affect its mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Curtains\' Call without two creatures to target. If one becomes an illegal target after you\'ve cast Curtains\' Call, the other will still be destroyed."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "If Yidris\'s triggered ability resolves more than once in one turn, spells you cast from your hand will gain cascade that many times. Each instance of cascade triggers separately; resolve one cascade trigger and the spell you cast from it before resolving the next cascade trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': \'Spells you cast from your hand this turn will gain cascade even if Yidris leaves the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a recent rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "If, during your declare attackers step, a creature you control is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, then it doesn\'t attack, even if you control one of Goblin Spymaster\'s tokens. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack, you aren\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "No player may take another action while you\'re resolving the activated ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The nonland card you reveal will be the card you draw.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Selfless Squire\'s first triggered ability prevents all damage that would be dealt to you this turn after the triggered ability resolves, even if Selfless Squire leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': \'Selfless Squire\\\'s second triggered ability doesn\\\'t trigger only when damage is prevented by its first triggered ability\\\'s effect. Any effect that uses the word "prevent" will cause it to trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "The ability of Duelist\'s Heritage triggers whenever any player attacks with one or more creatures, not just when you do. You know which players and planeswalkers the creatures are attacking before you choose the target creature."}]', "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'A token creature that’s a copy of a player’s commander isn’t a commander.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If the copied permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If the copied permanent is copying something else (for example, if the copied creature is a Clone), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that permanent copied.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If the permanent copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it’s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If you control multiple Faerie Artisans, each one’s ability only exiles tokens created with the ability of that specific Faerie Artisans.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The token is an artifact in addition to its other types. This is a copiable value of the token that other effects may copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'After Manifold Insights resolves, if it’s your turn, you may play one of the cards if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any action.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If there aren’t enough nonland cards for each opponent to choose one, all of the nonland cards are put into your hand.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Once the top ten cards of your library are revealed, no player may take any other actions until Manifold Insights has been completely resolved.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': \'An "attacking creature" is one that has been declared as an attacker or put onto the battlefield attacking during this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Entrapment Maneuver doesn\'t target the creature to be sacrificed. The target player chooses one as it resolves. No player may take any other actions between the target player choosing the creature and you creating Soldier tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': \'If you cast Entrapment Maneuver after combat damage has been dealt, only creatures that survived combat can be sacrificed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': \'To determine how many Soldier tokens are created, use the toughness of the sacrificed creature as it last existed on the battlefield.\'}]', "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'An ability of an Equipment that triggers “whenever equipped creature attacks” triggers only if the Equipment was attached to a creature at the moment that creature was declared as an attacker, and any references to “that creature” in the effect refer to the creature the Equipment was attached to when the ability triggered.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Armory Automaton’s ability can cause an Equipment one player controls to become attached to a creature another player controls. The controller of the Equipment can pay the equip cost to move that Equipment to a creature they control, but only any time that player could cast a sorcery. The controller of Armory Automaton can’t pay the equip cost to move Equipment they don’t control.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If Armory Automaton leaves the battlefield before its ability resolves, nothing happens to any of the Equipment it targeted. If they were already attached to other creatures, they remain attached to those creatures.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If an Equipment an opponent controls is attached to a creature you control, any ability of that Equipment that says “you” refers to that opponent. However, if the Equipment says that the equipped creature has an ability, the word “you” in that ability refers to you, the controller of the creature.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The triggered ability triggers both when Armory Automaton enters the battlefield and whenever it attacks. You don’t have to choose only one.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'You can choose to target no Equipment if you don’t want to attach any to Armory Automaton. Because the ability is optional, you also don’t have to attach the Equipment it targets as you resolve the ability. However, you must either attach all of the target Equipment or attach none of them.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Any abilities that trigger during the resolution of Divergent Transformations will wait to be put onto the stack until Divergent Transformations finishes resolving. An ability that triggers on the first creature entering the battlefield may target the second creature and vice versa.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Causing an opponent to lose the game after you’ve announced that you’re casting a spell with undaunted and determined its total cost won’t cause you to have to pay more mana.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Effects that reduce what you pay to cast a spell don’t affect its converted mana cost. Sublime Exhalation’s converted mana cost is 7, regardless of how many opponents you have or how much mana you spent to cast it.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If one player’s creatures are exiled this way, that player repeats this process twice.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If the controller of a creature exiled this way has no creature cards left in their library, that player reveals the cards in their library, then shuffles it.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If two players’ creatures are exiled this way, start with the player whose turn it is. If that player controlled a creature exiled this way, that player follows the process on Divergent Transformations to replace it. If not, proceed to the next player in turn order. Repeat until the players who controlled the exiled creatures have each replaced those creatures.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The two creatures that are put onto the battlefield are put onto the battlefield sequentially. Triggered abilities of the second won’t see the first enter the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'You can’t cast Divergent Transformations without two target creatures. If a targeted creature becomes an illegal target for Divergent Transformations after it’s been cast, its controller won’t exile or replace that creature, but the other creature is still affected.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Causing an opponent to lose the game after you’ve announced that you’re casting a spell with undaunted and determined its total cost won’t cause you to have to pay more mana.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Effects that reduce what you pay to cast a spell don’t affect its converted mana cost. Sublime Exhalation’s converted mana cost is 7, regardless of how many opponents you have or how much mana you spent to cast it.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Causing an opponent to lose the game after you’ve announced that you’re casting a spell with undaunted and determined its total cost won’t cause you to have to pay more mana.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Effects that reduce what you pay to cast a spell don’t affect its mana value.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Charging Cinderhorn’s triggered ability doesn’t trigger at all if a creature attacked this turn. It won’t get a fury counter or deal damage.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Charging Cinderhorn’s triggered ability triggers at the beginning of each player’s end step if no creatures attacked, including yours, and even if it wasn’t on the battlefield during combat.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If Charging Cinderhorn leaves the battlefield in response to its triggered ability, it won’t get a new fury counter, but it will deal damage equal to the number of fury counters it had before leaving the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If a player loses the game during that player’s own turn, the turn continues to completion. If no creatures attacked, Charging Cinderhorn will get a fury counter even though it won’t deal damage to any player.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Controlling a player doesn’t allow the controlling player to look at the controlled player’s sideboard. If an effect instructs that player to choose a card from outside the game, the controlling player can’t have that player choose a card.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Cruel Entertainment’s controller may be one of its targets, even if it’s less entertaining this way.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If a player who would be controlled skips their next turn, the other player will control the next turn the affected player actually takes.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If one player loses the game before controlling the other player, the other player takes their turn normally.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Multiple player-controlling effects that affect the same player overwrite each other. The last one to be created is the one that works.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The controlling player also can’t make any choices or decisions for the player being controlled that would be called for by the tournament rules (such as whether to take an intentional draw or whether to call a judge).'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The controlling player can use only the resources of the player being controlled (cards, mana, and so on) to pay costs for that player; the controlling player can’t use their own resources to pay costs for the player being controlled. Similarly, the controlling player can’t spend the resources of the player being controlled on any of the controlling player’s own costs.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The controlling player can’t make any illegal decisions or illegal choices—that player can’t do anything that the player being controlled couldn’t do. The controlling player can’t make choices or decisions for that player that aren’t called for by the game rules or by any cards, permanents, spells, abilities, and so on. If an effect causes another player to make decisions that the player being controlled would normally make (as Master Warcraft does), that effect takes precedence. In other words, if the player being controlled wouldn’t make a decision, the controlling player can’t make that decision on their behalf.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The controlling player can’t make the player being controlled concede. A player may choose to concede at any time, even while under another player’s control.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The controlling player only controls the player. The controlling player doesn’t control any of that player’s permanents, spells, or abilities.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The player being controlled is still the active player during their turn.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'While controlling another player, the controlling player also continues to make their own choices and decisions.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'While controlling another player, the controlling player can see all cards in the game that the player being controlled can see. This includes cards in that player’s hand, face-down cards that player controls, and any cards in that player’s library that they may look at.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'While controlling another player, the controlling player makes all choices and decisions that the player being controlled is allowed to make or is told to make during that turn. This includes choices about what spells to cast or what abilities to activate, as well as any decisions called for by a triggered ability or anything else.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Curse of Vengeance’s first triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If you and the enchanted player both reach 0 or less life at the same time, you’ll lose the game before Curse of Vengeance’s second triggered ability gives you more life.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Each player will have a chance to cast instants and activate abilities after Benefactor’s Draught’s delayed triggered abilities have resolved, before combat damage is dealt.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If multiple copies of Benefactor’s Draught resolve in one turn, each creates a delayed triggered ability and each will trigger when its condition is met.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'You must cast Benefactor’s Draught before blockers are declared in order to draw any cards from its delayed triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Exiling Runehorn Hellkite from your graveyard is part of the cost of its activated ability. An opponent can’t remove Runehorn Hellkite from your graveyard in response to you activating the ability.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If a player has no cards in hand, that player discards no cards, then draws seven cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'How many lands you control of a particular basic land type is irrelevant to a domain ability, as long as that number is greater than zero. As far as domain is concerned, ten Forests are the same as one Forest.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Most nonbasic lands don’t have basic land types, even if they produce colored mana. For example, Caves of Koilos is neither a Plains nor a Swamp.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Prismatic Geoscope can’t produce colorless mana.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Some nonbasic lands do have basic land types. Domain abilities don’t count the number of lands you control—they count the number of basic land types among lands you control, even if that means checking the same land twice. For example, if you control a Tundra, a Blood Crypt, and a Forest, you’ll have a Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest among the lands you control. Your domain abilities will be maxed out.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The colors of mana that Prismatic Geoscope can produce aren’t related to the specific basic land types among lands you control. For example, if you control a Plains and an Island, you can activate Prismatic Geoscope’s ability to add {R}{G} to your mana pool.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'To determine the number of basic land types among lands you control, look for the Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest subtypes among the lands you control. Count each subtype that appears one or more times toward the number of basic land types among lands you control. This number can’t exceed five.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'You can activate Prismatic Geoscope’s mana ability if you have no basic land types among lands you control, but it won’t produce any mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If Saskia leaves the battlefield and returns, you choose a player again. It doesn’t remember the previously chosen player.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If a creature you control deals combat damage to the chosen player, it deals that much damage to that player again.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Once the chosen player has left the game, Saskia’s triggered ability will have no effect.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The damage that Saskia’s ability causes a creature to deal isn’t combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If a creature has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, state-based actions remove the same number of each so that it has only one of those kinds of counters on it. There won’t be any counters of the other kind for Parting Thoughts to count.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Parting Thoughts can target a creature without any counters on it. You’ll lose no life and draw no cards.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Parting Thoughts counts every kind of counter on that creature. Effects such as that of Giant Growth, Auras, and Equipment aren’t counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If one target becomes illegal before Evolutionary Escalation’s ability resolves, you’ll put three +1/+1 counters on the target that’s still legal.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If there aren’t two legal targets for Evolutionary Escalation’s ability as it’s put onto the stack, it’s taken off the stack and no creature gets +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'You choose two targets for Evolutionary Escalation’s ability as it’s put onto the stack. No player may cast spells or activate abilities during your turn before this happens.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If the Equipment doesn’t provide a toughness boost, your Germ token will have 0 toughness and die. You’ll still control the Equipment.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The Germ token exists on the battlefield as a 0/0 for a brief moment before the Equipment becomes attached to it. Abilities that trigger when a creature enters the battlefield will trigger based on its natural characteristics, not the characteristics it has immediately after becoming equipped.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If the card you draw is a land card, you may choose it to put onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Starting with you and proceeding in turn order, each player chooses a land card from their hand or chooses not to choose one, but doesn’t reveal any chosen lands yet. Once all players have made this choice, all chosen lands are revealed and enter the battlefield simultaneously.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If there are any alternative or additional costs to cast a spell with a converge ability, the mana spent to pay those costs will count. For example, if an effect makes Crystalline Crawler cost {1} more to cast, you could pay {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} to cast it and have it enter the battlefield with five +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with converge without spending any mana to cast it (perhaps because an effect allowed you to cast it without paying its mana cost), then the number of colors spent to cast it will be zero.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Colorless is not a color.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'Unless a spell or ability allows you to, you can’t choose to pay more mana for a spell with a converge ability just to spend more colors of mana. Likewise, if a spell or ability reduces the amount of mana it costs you to cast a spell with converge, you can’t ignore that cost reduction in order to spend more colors of mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If you move Conqueror’s Flail from one creature to another, there’s no time in between that it’s not attached to a creature. Assuming it’s your turn, your opponents won’t be able to cast spells.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The first ability of Conqueror’s Flail constantly updates as the number of colors among permanents you control changes. If the number of colors decreases and the damage that was marked on the equipped creature earlier in the turn is now lethal damage, that creature is destroyed. Similarly, if its toughness becomes 0, that creature is put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The five colors are white, blue, black, red, and green. Conqueror’s Flail can’t give a creature more than +5/+5. (Gold, artifact, and colorless aren’t colors.)'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'If you win the flip, Boompile is destroyed along with all the other nonland permanents.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'You flip a coin as Boompile’s ability resolves. No player may take actions between seeing the result of the flip and all nonland permanents being destroyed.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': \'Once a player has announced that they are casting Primeval Protector, no player may take actions to try to change the number of creatures your opponents control in order to increase its cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Primeval Protector\'s ability can\'t reduce its cost below {G}."}]', "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The number of cards drawn this way might not be equal to the number of cards in your hand (for example, if you apply Necroplasm’s dredge ability instead of drawing one of those cards). The number of cards that you actually drew is what determines how many cards you discard.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The number of cards in your hand is counted only as Ancient Excavation resolves. Ancient Excavation is on the stack at this time, so it’s not counted.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'The triggered ability triggers both when Frenzied Fugue enters the battlefield and at the beginning of your upkeep. You don’t have to choose only one.'}, {'date': '2016-11-08', 'text': 'You won’t control the enchanted permanent as your upkeep begins. Any “at the beginning of your upkeep” abilities it has won’t trigger during your upkeep (unless you already controlled the permanent). Similarly, if you have an “at the beginning of your upkeep” ability that targets a permanent you control, that ability can’t target it.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-17', 'text': 'Breya, Etherium Shaper is banned as a commander in Duel Commander format, but it may be part of your deck.'}, {'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Breya can be one of the two artifacts sacrificed to pay the cost of its last ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-17\', \'text\': \'Vial Smasher the Fierce is banned as a commander in Duel Commander format, but it may be part of your deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The opponent to be dealt damage is chosen at random while the triggered ability is resolving. After that opponent is chosen, you choose whether damage will be dealt to that player or to a planeswalker they control, and if so, which planeswalker. No player may take any actions between the damage recipient being chosen and the damage being dealt.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Vial Smasher has to be on the battlefield at the moment you cast your first spell. If that spell causes Vial Smasher to leave the battlefield as an additional cost to cast it, Vial Smasher\'s ability can\'t trigger. If that spell is Vial Smasher itself, Vial Smasher\'s ability can\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Vial Smasher\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. If Vial Smasher\'s ability resolves and the spell that caused it to trigger has been countered, use that spell\'s mana value as it last existed on the stack to determine how much damage is dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Vial Smasher\'s triggered ability triggers when you cast your first spell each turn, regardless of whose turn it is."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Creatures you control that have +1/+1 counters put on them after Inspiring Call resolves won\'t gain indestructible."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'Once a creature gains indestructible, it will have it for the turn, even if it loses all its +1/+1 counters.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Wight of Precinct Six is dealt lethal damage at the same time as a creature an opponent controls, they’re destroyed at the same time. It won’t get an additional +1/+1 from its ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Wight of Precinct Six’s ability applies only while it’s on the battlefield. In all other zones, it’s a 1/1 creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a creature you control would enter the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it, it enters with twice that many instead.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If you control two Corpsejack Menaces, the number of +1/+1 counters put on a creature is four times the original number. Three Corpsejack Menaces multiplies the original number by eight, and so on.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Swiftfoot Boots to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to find one basic land card with Myriad Landscape\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Apply power bonuses from counters the creature enters the battlefield with and continuous effects such as that of Valiant Knight before checking to see if Mentor of the Meek\'s ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Mentor of the Meek\'s ability checks the power of the other creature only as it enters the battlefield. If that creature\'s power is 2 or less, the ability will trigger. Once the ability triggers, raising that creature\'s power above 2 won\'t affect that ability. Similarly, reducing the creature\'s power to 2 or less after it enters the battlefield won\'t cause the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "While resolving the triggered ability of Mentor of the Meek, you can\'t pay {1} multiple times to draw more than one card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If an effect puts a card into your hand without using the word "draw," the card wasn\\\'t drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If the card with miracle leaves your hand before the triggered ability resolves, you won\'t be able to cast it using its miracle ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "It\'s important to reveal a card with miracle before it is mixed with the other cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Miracle is an alternative cost to cast the spell with miracle. It can\\\'t be combined with other alternative costs, such as casting a spell "without paying its mana cost."\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Multiple card draws are always treated as a sequence of individual card draws. For example, if you haven\'t drawn any cards yet during a turn and cast a spell that instructs you to draw three cards, you\'ll draw them one at a time. Only the first card drawn this way may be revealed and cast using its miracle ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a miracle cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You can cast a card for its miracle cost only as the miracle triggered ability resolves. If you don\'t want to cast it at that time (or you can\'t cast it, perhaps because there are no legal targets available), you won\'t be able to cast it later for the miracle cost."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You can reveal and cast a card with miracle on any turn, not just your own, if it\'s the first card you\'ve drawn that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You cast the card with miracle during the resolution of the triggered ability. Ignore any timing rules based on the card\'s type."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to reveal a drawn card with miracle if you don\'t wish to cast it at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You still draw the card, whether you use the miracle ability or not. Any ability that triggers whenever you draw a card, for example, will trigger. If you don\'t cast the card using its miracle ability, it will remain in your hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Lands you control won\'t lose any other abilities they had. They also won\'t gain or lose any land types."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If a player has fewer than seven cards in their library, that player loses the game after Dragon Mage’s triggered ability resolves. If each player loses the game this way, the game’s a draw.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target card is an illegal target when the ability tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No +1/+1 counter will be put on Scavenging Ooze and you won\'t gain life. Notably, this means that if you activate Scavenging Ooze\'s ability multiple times targeting the same creature card, only the first instance of the ability to resolve will have any effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "After you draw cards while Shamanic Revelation is resolving, nothing else can happen before you gain the appropriate amount of life. Notably, abilities that trigger when you draw cards won\'t be put onto the stack until after you\'ve gained life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "An Aura put onto the battlefield this way can\'t enchant an artifact or enchantment that\'s also being put onto the battlefield with Open the Vaults."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If an Aura can be returned to the battlefield with Open the Vaults, it must be, even if its owner doesn\'t like what it would enchant."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If an Aura is put onto the battlefield without being cast, the Aura\'s controller-to-be chooses what it will enchant as it enters the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn\'t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent\'s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura\'s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can\'t legally be attached to anything, it remains in its current zone."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If multiple players have Auras in their graveyards, the player whose turn it is announces what their Auras will enchant, then each other player in turn order does the same, then all artifacts and enchantments (including both Auras and non-Auras) enter the battlefield at the same time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "As Deepglow Skate\'s ability resolves, you must double each kind of counter on the permanents it targets."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'To double the number of each kind of counter on a permanent, put another counter on it for each counter it already has. Effects that interact with counters being put onto permanents apply as appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can choose no targets if you don\'t want to double the counters on any permanents."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "As the last ability resolves, you can tap untapped Myr you control even if Myr Battlesphere is no longer on the battlefield by then. If that has happened, Myr Battlesphere won\'t be able to get the +X/+0 bonus, but it will still deal X damage to the appropriate player or planeswalker."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped Myr you control as the last ability resolves, not just the Myr tokens you created with the first ability. This includes Myr that haven\'t been under your control since your most recent turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You choose the value for X as the last ability resolves. You can\'t choose a value for X that\'s greater than the number of untapped Myr you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Cards that would be put into your graveyard are exiled even if you didn\'t play them this turn, such as a nontoken creature that would die."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If another effect tries to change where a spell is put as it resolves, such as that of a rebound or buyback ability, you may choose whether to exile the card to Magus of the Will\'s effect or to apply the other effect."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Magus of the Will doesn\'t change when you can play the cards in your graveyard. For example, if you have a creature card without flash in your graveyard, you can cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Tokens are put into your graveyard as normal (and cease to exist soon after). Abilities that trigger when a creature dies can trigger on token creatures being put into your graveyard but won\'t trigger on nontoken creatures being exiled instead of being put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'You may play a land card from your graveyard only if you have an available land play.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You pay the costs for a card in your graveyard if you cast it. You may pay alternative costs such as overload rather than the card\'s mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Champion of Lambholt\'s first ability applies even if it isn\'t attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The comparison of power is done only when blockers are declared. Decreasing the power of a blocking creature (or increasing the power of Champion of Lambholt) after this point won\'t cause any creature to stop blocking or become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Lightning Greaves to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can\'t simply unequip Equipment from a creature. If Lightning Greaves is attached to the only creature you control, you won\'t be able to attach other equipment to it (or target it with anything else) until you have another creature onto which you can move Lightning Greaves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If the target card is an illegal target by the time Beacon of Unrest tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t shuffle it into your library."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the permanent you control from Beacon of Unrest is exiled.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Unlike many effects that grant additional combat phases, you don\'t get an additional main phase with Godo, Bandit Warlord\'s ability. The additional combat phase happens immediately after the first combat phase."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'As long as Master of Etherium is on the battlefield, its ability will count itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Master of Etherium may become lethal if other artifacts you control leave the battlefield during that turn, and damage dealt to other artifact creatures you control may become lethal if Master of Etherium leaves the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Master of Etherium\'s power and toughness applies in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If Myr Retriever dies at the same time as another artifact you own, its ability can target that other artifact card.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If Sharuum the Hegemon is put into your graveyard as a state-based action immediately after Sharuum the Hegemon enters the battlefield (most likely due to the “legend rule”) it can be the artifact card targeted by its own ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay the cost of unattaching Sunforger unless Sunforger is attached to a creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'The artifact that you sacrifice is sacrificed after determining the total cost to cast Trash for Treasure. Its abilities may affect that cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Trash for Treasure can\'t target the artifact that you sacrifice to pay its additional cost."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice an artifact to generate mana to pay towards Trash for Treasure\'s cost and also to pay its additional cost."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'You may sacrifice Thopter Foundry to pay the cost of its own ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Although players may respond to Blasphemous Act once it\'s been cast, once it\'s announced, they can\'t respond before the cost is calculated and paid."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Blasphemous Act\'s ability can\'t reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {R}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Blasphemous Act is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if there are three creatures on the battlefield, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Blasphemous Act is {5}{R}. Then you can sacrifice the creature when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Blasphemous Act). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Humble Defector\'s ability can be activated any time during your turn, including in response to a spell or ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If Humble Defector is controlled by a player other than its owner, and its controller leaves the game, the effect giving that player control of Humble Defector ends. Humble Defector will return to the control of the player still in the game who most recently controlled it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Humble Defector isn\'t on the battlefield as its ability resolves, but the target player is still a legal target, the ability will resolve. You\'ll draw two cards, even though the player doesn\'t gain control of Humble Defector."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Humble Defector\'s owner leaves the game, Humble Defector humbly leaves the game along with that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Opal Palace\'s last ability produces two mana (most likely due to Mana Reflection) and you spend them to cast a commander, that commander enters with two counters for each time it\'s been cast from the command zone this game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Opal Palace\'s last ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the last ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Opal Palace\'s last ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The "number of times it\\\'s been cast from the command zone" includes the most recent time. For example, the first time you cast your commander from the command zone in a game, if you spent mana from Opal Palace\\\'s last ability to do so, it will enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If a player chooses to accept Orzhov Advokist\'s gift, that player can\'t attack you or a planeswalker you control with any creatures during their next turn, even creatures that weren\'t on the battlefield as Orzhov Advokist\'s ability resolved."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Orzhov Advokist\'s ability doesn\'t target the creatures that receive +1/+1 counters. Their controllers choose them as the ability resolves. Players can\'t take actions between making their choices and the +1/+1 counters being placed."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Orzhov Advokist\'s effect keeps creatures from attacking you even if Orzhov Advokist leaves the battlefield, if the creature that received counters is no longer on the battlefield, or if an effect has moved those counters off of the creature that received them and put them onto another creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "While resolving Orzhov Advokist\'s ability, you choose a creature you control or choose not to put any counters on a creature, then each other player in turn order does the same. Each player will know the choices made by players who chose before them. Then simultaneously each player who chose a creature puts two +1/+1 counters on the creature they chose."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting a spell, players can\'t attempt to remove Shimmer Myr from the battlefield to make that casting illegal. Removing Shimmer My after you\'ve cast a spell won\'t affect that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Shimmer Myr has no effect on artifact lands because they aren\'t cast as spells."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You don\'t sacrifice Nevinyrral\'s Disk to activate its ability. It\'s destroyed as part of the ability\'s resolution if it\'s still on the battlefield. If an effect gives Nevinyrral\'s Disk indestructible or regenerates it, it stays on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that instructs you to "cast" a card doesn\\\'t allow you to play lands.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Casting the card causes it to leave your graveyard and become a new object. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t cast the card, it remains in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Silas Renn doesn\'t change when you can cast the target artifact card. For example, if you target an artifact card without flash, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may cast that card this turn even if Silas Renn leaves the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You pay the costs for the target artifact card if you cast it. You may pay alternative costs rather than the card\'s mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to creatures you control may become lethal if Ravos leaves the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If a player was dealt combat damage and subsequently lost the game, Tymna\'s triggered ability counts that player to determine the value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If an effect creates an additional combat phase in a turn, it may also create an additional main phase after that combat phase. Tymna\'s ability triggers at the beginning of each of these postcombat main phases."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You must pay exactly X life or none. You can\'t pay less life to draw fewer cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Cards put into your hand without using the word "draw" don\\\'t count as cards drawn for Kydele\\\'s ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you haven\'t drawn any cards this turn, you can activate Kydele\'s mana ability, but it won\'t produce any mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Kydele\'s ability counts every card you\'ve drawn this turn, whether or not they\'re still in your hand and whether or not Kydele was on the battlefield or under your control at the time they were drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt to a player causes that player to lose that much life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a player lost life and subsequently lost the game, the player whose turn it is may draw a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Ludevic\'s ability checks only if another player lost life during the turn, not whether that player\'s life total decreased over the course of the turn. For example, if a player other than Ludevic\'s controller lost 2 life and then gained 8 life this turn, the player whose turn it is may draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Ludevic\'s ability looks at the entire turn to determine whether the player may draw a card or not. It doesn\'t matter whether Ludevic was on the battlefield when the opponent lost life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Ludevic\'s triggered ability triggers at the beginning of each player\'s end step, including yours, even if no player has lost life that turn. Whether or not a player has lost life is checked only as the triggered ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Ludevic\'s triggered ability will allow the player to draw a card if any player other than Ludevic\'s controller, including the player whose turn it is, lost life this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Only one card may be drawn no matter how much life was lost or how many players lost life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If enough -1/-1 counters are put on a creature at the same time to make its toughness 0 or less, the number of +1/+1 counters on it before it got any -1/-1 counters will be used to determine how many counters you put on target creature. For example, if there are three +1/+1 counters on Reyhan and it gets six -1/-1 counters, the target creature gets three +1/+1 counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Kraum\'s ability looks at the entire turn to determine which spell is a player\'s second spell. It doesn\'t matter whether Kraum was on the battlefield when the first spell was cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Kraum\'s triggered ability can trigger only once each turn for each opponent."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Kraum\'s triggered ability will resolve regardless of whether the first or second spell that a given opponent cast that turn has resolved, was countered, or is still on the stack. Notably, the ability will always resolve before the second spell resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "One opponent must cast two spells for Kraum\'s triggered ability to trigger. Two spells from different opponents won\'t cause it to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once an attacking creature has been blocked by a creature without flying or reach, reducing its power to 2 or less won\'t change or undo that block."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Sidar Kondo\'s blocking restriction applies to creatures your opponents control even when an opponent is being attacked by a player other than you."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The amount of life you gain is determined as Ikra Shidiqi\'s triggered ability resolves. If that creature is no longer on the battlefield, use its toughness as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life to gain."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The triggered ability triggers both when Bruse Tarl enters the battlefield and whenever it attacks. You don\'t have to choose only one."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An effect that checks whether you control your commander is satisfied if you control one or both of your two commanders.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards (or 58 cards in a Commander Draft game) of your deck are shuffled to become your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If something refers to your commander while you have two commanders, it refers to one of them of your choice. If you are instructed to perform an action on your commander (e.g. put it from the command zone into your hand due to Command Beacon), you choose one of your commanders at the time the effect happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders\' combined color identities. If Falthis and Kediss are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with black and/or red in their color identity, but not cards with green, white, or blue."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won\'t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from any one of them, not from both of them combined."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To have two commanders, both must have the partner ability as the game begins. Losing the ability during the game doesn\'t cause either to cease to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You can choose two commanders with partner that are the same color or colors. In Commander Draft, you can even choose two of the same commander with partner if you drafted them. If you do this, make sure you keep the number of times you\\\'ve cast each from the command zone clear for "commander tax" purposes.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If an opponent leaves the game, all permanents you gave to them courtesy of Zedruu will return to your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If either the opponent or the permanent you control becomes an illegal target by the time Zedruu\'s last ability tries to resolve, the ability does nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you leave the game, all permanents you own leave the game with you.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, use the value chosen for X when determining the spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "A face-down spell has mana value 0 and can\'t be targeted by Disdainful Stroke."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Alesha\'s triggered ability checks the card\'s power only in your graveyard. The creature will still be tapped and attacking if its power is greater than 2 after it\'s on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Although the returned creature is an attacking creature, it was never declared as an attacking creature. This means that abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won\'t trigger when it enters the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Any effects that say that the returned creature can\'t attack (such as that of Propaganda, or if the creature has defender) affect only the declaration of attackers. They won\'t stop the returned creature from entering the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "While resolving Alesha\'s triggered ability, you can\'t pay the cost multiple times to return more than one creature card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You choose which player or planeswalker the returned creature is attacking. It doesn\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker Alesha is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Because delve isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs, such as flashback. It can also be used to pay for additional costs that include generic mana."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Delve doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value. For example, Treasure Cruise\'s mana value is 8 even if you exiled three cards to cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can exile cards to pay only for generic mana, and you can\'t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can\'t exile more than seven cards from your graveyard to cast Treasure Cruise unless an effect has increased its cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can cast Everflowing Chalice without kicking it at all if you wish. However, if Everflowing Chalice has no charge counters on it, activating its last ability won\'t produce any mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If a card has multiple instances of flashback, you may choose any of its flashback costs to pay.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with no mana cost gains flashback, it has no flashback cost. It can\'t be cast this way."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a split card gains flashback, you pay only the cost of the half you\'re casting."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with flashback, you can\'t pay any alternative costs such as overload costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the spell with flashback."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you cast an instant or sorcery with {X} in its mana cost this way, you still choose the value of X as part of casting the spell and pay that cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Past in Flames affects only cards in your graveyard at the time it resolves. Instant and sorcery cards put into your graveyard later in the turn won\'t gain flashback."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Activating the ability with X = 0 will cause all creatures you control to become 0/0 and be put into the graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Changeling applies in all zones, not just the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Mirror Entity\'s ability overwrites any effects that previously set a creature\'s base power and/or toughness. Any existing effects or counters that raise or lower a creature\'s power and/or toughness continue to apply to the creature\'s newly-set power and toughness."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an opponent has no land cards in their library, all the cards from that library will be revealed and put into their graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Consuming Aberration\'s power and toughness applies in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Aeon Chronicler may become lethal if cards leave your hand during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Aeon Chronicler\'s power and toughness applies in all zones, not just the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A creature cast using suspend will enter the battlefield with haste. It will have haste until another player gains control of it. (In some rare cases, another player may gain control of the creature spell itself. If this happens, the creature won\'t enter the battlefield with haste.)"}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don\'t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a "suspended card," that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If this is suspended, then when the last time counter is removed from it, both its triggered ability and the "cast this spell" part of the suspend ability will trigger. They can be put on the stack in either order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," such as with suspend, you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it\'s on the stack)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn\'t paid."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage\'s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Saproling may become lethal if Thelonite Hermit leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Cranial Plating is counted by its own ability, so it gives at least +1/+0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Cranial Plating\'s first activated ability is similar to an equip ability, but it\'s not an equip ability. Most importantly, it can be activated any time you could cast an instant, even during another player\'s turn."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Farseek can find any land with any of the listed land types, including nonbasic ones, even if that land is a Forest in addition to one or more of those types.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a recent rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \' Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'"Hideaway N" means "When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains \\\'The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\\\'"\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads "[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped," and they now have hideaway 4.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Creatures may still attack planeswalkers you control without their controller paying a cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Forgotten Ancient’s first ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger. Putting a +1/+1 counter on Forgotten Ancient is optional.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Forgotten Ancient’s last ability doesn’t target any creatures. You choose how many +1/+1 counters will be moved (and onto which creatures) as the ability resolves. Notably, once the ability starts resolving and you make these choices, no player may take actions until the ability has finished resolving.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Gamekeeper is no longer in your graveyard as its triggered ability resolves, you can’t choose to exile it. You won’t reveal cards from your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Use the power of the creature from when it was last on the battlefield to determine how much life is gained.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'You must choose a legal target for each target required by Decimate. However, if a permanent has multiple card types, it may be chosen as the target for more than one instance of the word "target." For example, you could cast Decimate targeting an artifact creature, an enchantment, and a land.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "Whenever you proliferate" triggers even if you chose no permanents or players while doing so.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a permanent ever has both +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it at the same time, they\'re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a player or permanent has more than one kind of counter on it, and you choose for it to get additional counters, it must get one of each kind of counter it already has. You can\'t have it get just one kind of counter it already has and not the others."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can choose any player who has a counter, including opponents. You can\'t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since "any number" includes zero, you don\\\'t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don\\\'t have to choose any players at all.\'}]', "[{'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'Each additional Hardened Scales you control will increase the number of +1/+1 counters placed on a creature you control by one.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If a creature you control would enter the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it, it enters with that many plus one instead.'}, {'date': '2023-09-01', 'text': 'If two or more effects attempt to modify how many counters would be put on a creature you control, you choose the order to apply those effects, no matter who controls the sources of those effects.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Aasfressender Schlamm\', \'text\': \'{G}: Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte war, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Aasfressenden Schlamm und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': \'In der Natur wird kein Knochen und kein Fleischfetzen je verschwendet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421485&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a60fcf8d-4596-400e-ad31-3b8042d4eb6d\', \'multiverseId\': 421485}, \'multiverseid\': 421485}, {\'name\': \'Cieno carroñero\', \'text\': \'{G}: Exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio. Si era una carta de criatura, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Cieno carroñero y gana 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': \'En la naturaleza, ni un hueso ni un jirón de carne se desperdician.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a72cb176-07e1-421f-8a80-721d09ec1c0f\', \'multiverseId\': 423240}, \'multiverseid\': 423240}, {\'name\': \'Limon nécrophage\', \'text\': "{G} : Exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière. Si c\'était une carte de créature, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Limon nécrophage et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': \'La nature ne gaspille pas un os, pas un bout de chair.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421836&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'063f223c-db0f-45ce-bc6e-e882425d1500\', \'multiverseId\': 421836}, \'multiverseid\': 421836}, {\'name\': \'Melma Mangiacarogne\', \'text\': \'{G}: Esilia una carta bersaglio da un cimitero. Se era una carta creatura, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Melma Mangiacarogne e guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': \'In natura, non un solo ossicino o pezzo di carne viene sprecato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a12f5aa2-7ede-46b8-bc15-d8095759e6f6\', \'multiverseId\': 422187}, \'multiverseid\': 422187}, {\'name\': \'漁る軟泥\', \'text\': \'{G}：墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、漁る軟泥の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置き、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': \'自然では、骨の一本、肉の一切れとて無駄にはならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca0ce8a5-0a4d-4316-8b3d-931b38e56ed8\', \'multiverseId\': 422538}, \'multiverseid\': 422538}, {\'name\': \'Lodo Necrófago\', \'text\': \'{G}: Exile o card alvo de um cemitério. Se era um card de criatura, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Lodo Necrófago e ganhe 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lodo\', \'flavor\': \'Na natureza, nem um único osso ou pedaço de carne é desperdiçado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cd07a92-1476-4eb4-81af-f3d568b1dd1a\', \'multiverseId\': 422889}, \'multiverseid\': 422889}, {\'name\': \'腐食流浆\', \'text\': \'{G}：将目标牌从坟墓场放逐。如果它是生物牌，则在腐食流浆上放置一个+1/+1指示物，且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～流浆\', \'flavor\': \'在自然界中，没有半块骨头或半片肉会被浪费掉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6129e83-51d9-4e74-87b8-7c2ad75aa27b\', \'multiverseId\': 421134}, \'multiverseid\': 421134}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abschiedsworte\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Du ziehst X Karten und verlierst X Lebenspunkte, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Marken auf jener Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Leben mit einer Suche zu vergeuden und am Ende alles zu bereuen … das ist die herrlichste Ironie von allen." —Leshrac, Wanderer der Nacht\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421334&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82bf3d21-c6ac-406a-bd92-dc5c9332f3f9\', \'multiverseId\': 421334}, \'multiverseid\': 421334}, {\'name\': \'Reflexiones finales\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo. Robas X cartas y pierdes X vidas, donde X es la cantidad de contadores sobre esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Pasarte la vida buscando solo para lamentar lo conseguido... Esa es la ironía más deliciosa de todas". —Leshrac, caminante de la noche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f812507c-4ba1-4bb9-b8ec-465e9733852b\', \'multiverseId\': 423089}, \'multiverseid\': 423089}, {\'name\': \'Pensées séparatrices\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature ciblée. Vous piochez X cartes et vous perdez X points de vie, X étant le nombre de marqueurs sur cette créature.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Passer sa vie entière à chercher et ne trouver que des regrets... c\'est là le comble de l\'ironie. » —Leshrac, Trépasseur de la Nuit", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421685&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12dd04b6-03db-49a3-a3c7-14b8b42314d2\', \'multiverseId\': 421685}, \'multiverseid\': 421685}, {\'name\': \'Pensieri di Commiato\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Pesca X carte e perdi X punti vita, dove X è il numero di segnalini su quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Dedicare la vita alla ricerca, per trovare solo rimpianto una volta raggiunta la meta... questa è l\\\'ironia più deliziosa di tutte." —Leshrac, Errante della Notte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe6ebb22-7bac-42d6-925e-d2aa83b14687\', \'multiverseId\': 422036}, \'multiverseid\': 422036}, {\'name\': \'別れの思い\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。あなたはカードをＸ枚引き、あなたはＸ点のライフを失う。Ｘはそのクリーチャーの上に置かれているカウンターの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「生涯を探求に捧げるも、成就より得るは後悔ばかり……なんたる甘美な皮肉よ。」 ――夜歩みし者、レシュラック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cc3279f-c53a-4acb-874b-c63ec01e3220\', \'multiverseId\': 422387}, \'multiverseid\': 422387}, {\'name\': \'Pensamentos de Despedida\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo. Você compra X cards e perde X pontos de vida, sendo X o número de marcadores naquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Passar a vida buscando, só para se arrepender ao encontrar... essa é a ironia mais deliciosa de todas." — Leshrac, Andarilho da Noite\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0c73291-a1b2-45dd-ac42-94f394fd4b64\', \'multiverseId\': 422738}, \'multiverseid\': 422738}, {\'name\': \'临终思绪\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。你抓X张牌且失去X点生命，X为该生物上的指示物数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你穷尽一生去追寻，到头来却只寻到悔恨. . . 这真是最绝妙的讽刺。」 ～夜访者拉席克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0edffcb8-e9df-44ad-baa1-c3c33f4b70d2\', \'multiverseId\': 420983}, \'multiverseid\': 420983}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abweichende Transformationen\', \'text\': \'Unverzagt (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jeden Gegner {1} weniger.)\\nSchicke zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl ins Exil. Für jede dieser Kreaturen deckt ihr Beherrscher Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf, bis er eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckt. Er bringt die Karte ins Spiel und mischt dann den Rest der aufgedeckten Karten in seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421336&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12a73999-1664-417f-bb54-aafcd793b7b1\', \'multiverseId\': 421336}, \'multiverseid\': 421336}, {\'name\': \'Transformaciones divergentes\', \'text\': \'Audacia. (Cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada oponente.)\\nExilia dos criaturas objetivo. Por cada una de esas criaturas, su controlador muestra cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que muestre una carta de criatura, la pone en el campo de batalla y luego baraja el resto en su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c467de86-5d95-4d0a-b3fd-b2eef9653eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 423091}, \'multiverseid\': 423091}, {\'name\': \'Transformations divergentes\', \'text\': "Témérité (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque adversaire.)\\nExilez deux créatures ciblées. Pour chacune de ces créatures, son contrôleur révèle les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il révèle une carte de créature, met cette carte sur le champ de bataille, puis mélange le reste dans sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421687&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba2b246d-a6c8-4c41-bb4d-00a170e12d0d\', \'multiverseId\': 421687}, \'multiverseid\': 421687}, {\'name\': \'Trasformazioni Divergenti\', \'text\': \'Impavido (Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni avversario.)\\nEsilia due creature bersaglio. Per ognuna di quelle creature, il suo controllore rivela carte dalla cima del suo grimorio finché non rivela una carta creatura, mette quella carta sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola le altre nel suo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fb07a90-3a56-454f-b790-12f9ce7e7928\', \'multiverseId\': 422038}, \'multiverseid\': 422038}, {\'name\': \'分岐変容\', \'text\': \'不抜（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは対戦相手１人につき{1}少なくなる。）\\nクリーチャー２体を対象とし、それらを追放する。それらのクリーチャー１体につき、それのコントローラーは、クリーチャー・カードが公開されるまで自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開し、そのカードを戦場に出し、その後残りを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e93c8e2-47d6-4a37-b998-d23150edb229\', \'multiverseId\': 422389}, \'multiverseid\': 422389}, {\'name\': \'Transformações Divergentes\', \'text\': \'Inabalável (Esta mágica custa {1} a menos por cada oponente para ser conjurada.)\\nExile duas criaturas alvo. Para cada uma dessas criaturas, seu controlador revela cards do topo do próprio grimório até revelar um card de criatura, coloca aquele card no campo de batalha e, em seguida, embaralha os demais no próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1352e4a1-09ab-4b9f-91ae-469be452278e\', \'multiverseId\': 422740}, \'multiverseid\': 422740}, {\'name\': \'趋异转化\', \'text\': \'不屈（每有一位对手，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。）\\n放逐两个目标生物。为每个这类生物各进行以下流程～其操控者从其牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张生物牌为止，将该牌放进战场，然后将其余的牌洗回牌库。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'142e0501-d8ad-4663-9e9a-660317e35f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 420985}, \'multiverseid\': 420985}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abzan-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 3 oder mehr ins Exil.\\n• Du ziehst zwei Karten und verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\\n• Verteile zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine oder zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421496&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d075b644-19f2-4a53-b784-90e7b78cf55a\', \'multiverseId\': 421496}, \'multiverseid\': 421496}, {\'name\': \'Sortilegio abzano\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Exilia la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 3 o más.\\n• Robas dos cartas y pierdes 2 vidas.\\n• Distribuye dos contadores +1/+1 entre una o dos criaturas objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'770768dd-d700-4aa4-96c1-63df742c1d15\', \'multiverseId\': 423251}, \'multiverseid\': 423251}, {\'name\': "Charme d\'Abzan", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Exilez une créature ciblée avec une force supérieure ou égale à 3.\\n• Vous piochez deux cartes et vous perdez 2 points de vie.\\n• Répartissez deux marqueurs +1/+1 entre une ou deux créatures ciblées.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421847&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76616107-b6c6-4478-8086-f48b1258fd88\', \'multiverseId\': 421847}, \'multiverseid\': 421847}, {\'name\': \'Talismano Abzan\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Esilia una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o superiore a 3.\\n• Pesca due carte e perdi 2 punti vita.\\n• Distribuisci due segnalini +1/+1 tra una o due creature bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39f8af8c-8a26-4a2a-80bf-fcc9c4185619\', \'multiverseId\': 422198}, \'multiverseid\': 422198}, {\'name\': \'アブザンの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• パワーが３以上のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。\\n• あなたはカードを２枚引き、あなたは２点のライフを失う。\\n• クリーチャー１体か２体を対象とする。それらに２個の＋１/＋１カウンターを好きなように割り振って置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a46aa28-32aa-45c5-91b4-19441714f824\', \'multiverseId\': 422549}, \'multiverseid\': 422549}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto Abzan\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Exile a criatura alvo com poder igual ou superior a 3.\\n• Você compra dois cards e perde 2 pontos de vida.\\n• Distribua dois marcadores +1/+1 entre uma ou duas criaturas alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5193838f-baf2-4bb0-b015-8242cd27b9a6\', \'multiverseId\': 422900}, \'multiverseid\': 422900}, {\'name\': \'阿布赞护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•放逐目标力量等于或大于3的生物。\\n•你抓两张牌且失去2点生命。\\n•将两个+1/+1指示物分配给一个或两个目标生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd2be2f0-19c4-47bd-8bf5-faa8d8ef7a18\', \'multiverseId\': 421145}, \'multiverseid\': 421145}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abzan-Falkner\', \'text\': \'Standhaft {W} ({W}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur. Spiele Standhaft wie eine Hexerei.)\\nJede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, hat Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Der schnellste Weg durch die Dünen führt darüber.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421376&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74f7976c-309a-4c83-b3ce-94d9fcc2235b\', \'multiverseId\': 421376}, \'multiverseid\': 421376}, {\'name\': \'Halconero abzano\', \'text\': \'Supervivencia {W}. ({W}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura. Activa la habilidad de supervivencia solo como un conjuro.)\\nCada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'El camino más rápido para cruzar las dunas es por encima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfdbe157-b1ce-4604-93f1-78375c7aadf9\', \'multiverseId\': 423131}, \'multiverseid\': 423131}, {\'name\': \'Fauconnier abzan\', \'text\': "Résilience {W} ({W}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature. N\'utilisez la résilience que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\\nChaque créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle a le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Le moyen le plus rapide de traverser les dunes reste encore de les survoler.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421727&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c500542-5515-4232-926e-088decc5c535\', \'multiverseId\': 421727}, \'multiverseid\': 421727}, {\'name\': \'Falconiere Abzan\', \'text\': \'Perdurare {W} ({W}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura. Perdura solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\\nOgni creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'La via più breve attraverso le dune è il cielo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e87cea63-984c-4b6d-b67e-2d42d75e2043\', \'multiverseId\': 422078}, \'multiverseid\': 422078}, {\'name\': \'アブザンの鷹匠\', \'text\': \'長久{W}（{W}, {T}：このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。長久はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nあなたのコントロールする＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'砂丘群を越えるのに最も速い手段は、上から行くことだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10763b28-aa63-4871-a10f-209347072504\', \'multiverseId\': 422429}, \'multiverseid\': 422429}, {\'name\': \'Falcoeiro Abzan\', \'text\': \'Sobreviver {W} ({W}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura. Use sobreviver somente como um feitiço.)\\nCada criatura com um marcador +1/+1 que você controla tem voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'O modo mais rápido de cruzar as dunas é por cima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29e3469d-8780-4131-aa9a-57ba3e5db6a6\', \'multiverseId\': 422780}, \'multiverseid\': 422780}, {\'name\': \'阿布赞训隼兵\', \'text\': \'延生{W}（{W}，{T}：在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。延生的时机视同法术。）\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'横跨沙丘的捷径在空中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1de5db23-0b2c-45b5-a02a-6867859d0a5c\', \'multiverseId\': 421025}, \'multiverseid\': 421025}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aggressive Amnesie\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine bleibende Karte\\nWenn die Aggressive Amnesie ins Spiel kommt oder zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments, übernimm die Kontrolle über die verzauberte bleibende Karte bis zum Ende des Zuges. Enttappe die bleibende Karte. Sie erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Fortan lebte sie immer in Angst, der Wahn könne erneut ihre Gedanken vernebeln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421337&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f9385ae-fbfa-425f-bdea-374961867365\', \'multiverseId\': 421337}, \'multiverseid\': 421337}, {\'name\': \'Fuga frenética\', \'text\': \'Encantar permanente.\\nCuando la Fuga frenética entre al campo de batalla o al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, ganas el control del permanente encantado hasta el final del turno. Endereza ese permanente. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Después de aquello, vivió temiendo que la locura volviera a apoderarse de ella.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbd118bb-df6c-4800-bf6e-161f3412fe72\', \'multiverseId\': 423092}, \'multiverseid\': 423092}, {\'name\': \'Fugue hystérique\', \'text\': "Enchanter : permanent\\nQuand la Fugue hystérique arrive sur le champ de bataille ou au début de votre entretien, acquérez le contrôle du permanent enchanté jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez ce permanent. Il acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Elle vécut ensuite dans la peur que la folie ne s\'empare à nouveau d\'elle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421688&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77d74840-7626-426e-918c-22c221dbe076\', \'multiverseId\': 421688}, \'multiverseid\': 421688}, {\'name\': \'Fuga Forsennata\', \'text\': "Incanta permanente\\nQuando la Fuga Forsennata entra nel campo di battaglia o all\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, prendi il controllo del permanente incantato fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quel permanente. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Da quel momento in poi, visse nel timore che la follia tornasse a controllarla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67873267-fd95-451a-bd22-1b982b65fcc3\', \'multiverseId\': 422039}, \'multiverseid\': 422039}, {\'name\': \'激情の遁走\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（パーマネント）\\n激情の遁走が戦場に出たときとあなたのアップキープの開始時に、ターン終了時まで、エンチャントされているパーマネントのコントロールを得る。そのパーマネントをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'あの狂気に再び陥るのではないかと、彼女はその後ずっと恐怖し続けた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'609fe98d-abfe-473a-8eb5-ac287d935627\', \'multiverseId\': 422390}, \'multiverseid\': 422390}, {\'name\': \'Fuga Frenética\', \'text\': \'Encantar permanente\\nQuando Fuga Frenética entrar no campo de batalha ou no início de sua manutenção, ganhe o controle da permanente encantada até o final do turno. Desvire aquela permanente. Ela ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'O medo de ser novamente tomada pela loucura a atormentou para sempre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b5220b0-af40-4e14-aed4-ab21734a8c5b\', \'multiverseId\': 422741}, \'multiverseid\': 422741}, {\'name\': \'丧志神游\', \'text\': \'结附于永久物\\n当丧志神游进战场或在你的维持开始时，获得所结附之永久物的操控权直到回合结束。重置该永久物。它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'从此之后，她便一直害怕再有此般狂热附体。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'409016af-681c-4b7e-8b5f-179502cc4fa5\', \'multiverseId\': 420986}, \'multiverseid\': 420986}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akiri, Seilschleuderin\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, Wachsamkeit\\nAkiri, Seilschleuderin, erhält +1/+0 für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst.\\nPartner (Du kannst zwei Kommandeure haben, falls beide Partner haben.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Kor, Soldat, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Der präzise Einsatz jedes Seils ermöglicht ihr ihre waghalsigen Manöver.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421345&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5925283a-bb5a-45ef-82d1-6a7ff44c340d\', \'multiverseId\': 421345}, \'multiverseid\': 421345}, {\'name\': \'Akiri, lanzacuerdas\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, vigilancia.\\nAkiri, lanzacuerdas obtiene +1/+0 por cada artefacto que controlas.\\nCamarada. (Puedes tener dos comandantes si ambos tienen camarada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado kor aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Sus osados movimientos están ligados a la cuidada precisión de cada cuerda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'862b3919-b4be-4b0d-906a-8b8dc7667c9f\', \'multiverseId\': 423100}, \'multiverseid\': 423100}, {\'name\': \'Akiri, élingueuse de filins\', \'text\': \'Initiative, vigilance\\nAkiri, élingueuse de filins gagne +1/+0 pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez.\\nPartenariat (Vous pouvez avoir deux commandants si les deux ont le partenariat.)\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : kor et soldat et allié\', \'flavor\': \'Ses mouvements audacieux sont ancrés dans la précision minutieuse de chaque corde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421696&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8746ffb-9a61-4136-a25a-fc5a064c7e28\', \'multiverseId\': 421696}, \'multiverseid\': 421696}, {\'name\': \'Akiri, Lanciafuni\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, cautela\\nAkiri, Lanciafuni prende +1/+0 per ogni artefatto che controlli.\\nPartner (Puoi avere due comandanti se entrambi hanno partner.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Alleato Soldato Kor\', \'flavor\': "I suoi audaci movimenti sono ancorati nell\'attenta precisione di ogni fune.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ebca4df-fdea-4c66-ac39-b1ff5e0cfd41\', \'multiverseId\': 422047}, \'multiverseid\': 422047}, {\'name\': \'綱投げ、アキリ\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、警戒\\n綱投げ、アキリは、あなたがコントロールするアーティファクト１つにつき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n共闘（両方が共闘を持つなら、あなたは２体の統率者を使用できる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — コー・兵士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'注意深く正確な綱捌きが、大胆な動作を支えている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a2a7036-b78d-436b-8562-2ebdb7e7bd96\', \'multiverseId\': 422398}, \'multiverseid\': 422398}, {\'name\': \'Akiri, Fundeira de Linha\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa, vigilância\\nAkiri, Fundeira de Linha, recebe +1/+0 para cada artefato que você controla.\\nParceiro (Você pode ter dois comandantes se ambos tiverem parceiro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Kor Soldado Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Seus movimentos ousados estão ancorados na cuidadosa precisão de cada corda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5529bbcf-d005-4423-b063-cb8fc958495e\', \'multiverseId\': 422749}, \'multiverseid\': 422749}, {\'name\': \'掷索人娅奇丽\', \'text\': \'先攻，警戒\\n你每操控一个神器，掷索人娅奇丽便得+1/+0。\\n拍档（你可将两个具有拍档异能的生物共同用作指挥官。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～寇族／士兵／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'每根绳索的谨慎精准，奠定了她每次行动的大胆无畏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1f90e9e-89bd-4260-ab82-cebf0d49cd1c\', \'multiverseId\': 420994}, \'multiverseid\': 420994}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akroisches Pferd\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nWenn das Akroische Pferd ins Spiel kommt, übernimmt ein Gegner die Kontrolle darüber.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erzeugt jeder Gegner einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Pferd\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421560&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eee4e33-0053-4e28-90d3-df2ea391d920\', \'multiverseId\': 421560}, \'multiverseid\': 421560}, {\'name\': \'Caballo akroniense\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\nCuando el Caballo akroniense entre al campo de batalla, un oponente gana su control.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, cada oponente crea una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Caballo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49b6a1d7-cc4e-4f20-9c1d-b5f7d52bc2cb\', \'multiverseId\': 423315}, \'multiverseid\': 423315}, {\'name\': "Cheval d\'Akros", \'text\': "Défenseur\\nQuand le Cheval d\'Akros arrive sur le champ de bataille, un adversaire en acquiert le contrôle.\\nAu début de votre entretien, chaque adversaire crée un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : cheval\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421911&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54dc5a00-b403-46d6-9237-46b7241e0483\', \'multiverseId\': 421911}, \'multiverseid\': 421911}, {\'name\': \'Cavallo di Akros\', \'text\': "Difensore\\nQuando il Cavallo di Akros entra nel campo di battaglia, un avversario ne prende il controllo.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, ogni avversario crea una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Cavallo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26332df4-8009-4491-a1c9-15810c559791\', \'multiverseId\': 422262}, \'multiverseid\': 422262}, {\'name\': \'アクロスの木馬\', \'text\': \'防衛\\nアクロスの木馬が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人はこれのコントロールを得る。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、各対戦相手はそれぞれ白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 馬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47b693c0-8efd-4e19-9c07-d7ace08ef6da\', \'multiverseId\': 422613}, \'multiverseid\': 422613}, {\'name\': \'Cavalo de Ácros\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\nQuando Cavalo de Ácros entra no campo de batalha, um oponente ganha o controle dele.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, cada oponente cria uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Cavalo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'379903d7-1ba8-490e-8d31-a4fcb0815195\', \'multiverseId\': 422964}, \'multiverseid\': 422964}, {\'name\': \'阿喀洛斯木马\', \'text\': \'守军\\n当阿喀洛斯木马进战场时，任一对手获得其操控权。\\n在你的维持开始时，每位对手各派出一个1/1白色士兵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～马\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd016153-196e-440a-8a96-63c2d4e45fcc\', \'multiverseId\': 421209}, \'multiverseid\': 421209}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alesha, Verachterin des Todes\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn Alesha, Verachterin des Todes, angreift, kannst du {W/B}{W/B} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Stärke 2 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof getappt und angreifend ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Begegne dem Tod mit dem Schwert in der Hand."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421438&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb3b8f94-0fc6-460b-b8a0-abc2578792e3\', \'multiverseId\': 421438}, \'multiverseid\': 421438}, {\'name\': \'Alesha, la que sonríe a la muerte\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nSiempre que Alesha, la que sonríe a la muerte ataque, puedes pagar {W/B}{W/B}. Si lo haces, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con fuerza de 2 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girada y atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Saluda a la muerte con una espada en la mano".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4851837e-f0dc-4e15-bd6f-8ada72b7be54\', \'multiverseId\': 423193}, \'multiverseid\': 423193}, {\'name\': \'Alesha, Celle-qui-sourit-devant-la-mort\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Alesha, Celle-qui-sourit-devant-la-mort attaque, vous pouvez payer {W/B}{W/B}. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de créature ciblée de force inférieure ou égale à 2, engagée et attaquante.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Saluez la mort une épée à la main. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421789&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52ff961f-dc61-4909-a152-224edd8ae650\', \'multiverseId\': 421789}, \'multiverseid\': 421789}, {\'name\': \'Alesha, Che Sorride alla Morte\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nOgniqualvolta Alesha, Che Sorride alla Morte attacca, puoi pagare {W/B}{W/B}. Se lo fai, rimetti sul campo di battaglia dal tuo cimitero una carta creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a 2 TAPpata e attaccante.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Saluta la morte impugnando la spada."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c6ad003-bcab-40ea-80ec-40c255157a8f\', \'multiverseId\': 422140}, \'multiverseid\': 422140}, {\'name\': \'死に微笑むもの、アリーシャ\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n死に微笑むもの、アリーシャが攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地からパワーが２以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたは{W/B}{W/B}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、それをタップ状態で攻撃している状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「手に剣を持って死を迎えよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f418b9c-59ec-4ffc-8e90-2cb0af1273df\', \'multiverseId\': 422491}, \'multiverseid\': 422491}, {\'name\': \'Alesha, a Que Sorri Para a Morte\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nToda vez que Alesha, a Que Sorri Para a Morte, ataca, você pode pagar {W/B}{W/B}. Se fizer isso, devolva o card de criatura alvo com poder igual ou inferior a 2 do seu cemitério para o campo de batalha virado e atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cumprimente a morte com uma espada em punho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a63b61e3-bd6c-483d-8f7c-85ae80472b54\', \'multiverseId\': 422842}, \'multiverseid\': 422842}, {\'name\': \'蔑死者阿列莎\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n每当蔑死者阿列莎攻击时，你可以支付{W/B}{W/B}。若你如此作，则将目标力量等于或小于2的生物牌从你的坟墓场横置移回战场且正进行攻击。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「持剑在手，笑迎死亡。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4345dff-b307-41d4-af2a-a913cc4cc254\', \'multiverseId\': 421087}, \'multiverseid\': 421087}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett aus Naya\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Das Amulett aus Naya fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\n• Tappe alle Kreaturen, die ein Spieler deiner Wahl kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e9f9337-7c85-46bf-9e4c-4926d37ef922\', \'multiverseId\': 421533}, \'multiverseid\': 421533}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto nayano\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• El Amuleto nayano hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n• Regresa la carta objetivo de un cementerio a la mano de su propietario.\\n• Gira todas las criaturas que controla el jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5278e798-8915-4b33-8c80-9b79c8f4d927\', \'multiverseId\': 423288}, \'multiverseid\': 423288}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Naya\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Le Charme de Naya inflige 3 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\n• Renvoyez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n• Engagez toutes les créatures que le joueur ciblé contrôle.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421884&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cc8d286-ea82-4578-a5db-e2ff40a473b4\', \'multiverseId\': 421884}, \'multiverseid\': 421884}, {\'name\': \'Monile di Naya\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Il Monile di Naya infligge 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Fai riprendere in mano al suo proprietario una carta bersaglio da un cimitero.\\n• TAPpa tutte le creature controllate da un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82c4f97c-c8fb-4e54-9fb5-a63eaf6e3a28\', \'multiverseId\': 422235}, \'multiverseid\': 422235}, {\'name\': \'ナヤの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ナヤの魔除けはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n• 墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするすべてのクリーチャーをタップする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9ebdcb2-4efc-46a8-83f1-e00d88f15e76\', \'multiverseId\': 422586}, \'multiverseid\': 422586}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão de Naya\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Medalhão de Naya causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\\n• Devolva o card alvo de um cemitério para a mão de seu dono.\\n• Vire todas as criaturas que o jogador alvo controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'159716b7-0379-41de-8c29-fe00f5b9898a\', \'multiverseId\': 422937}, \'multiverseid\': 422937}, {\'name\': \'纳雅护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•纳雅护符对目标生物造成3点伤害。\\n•将目标牌从坟墓场移回其拥有者手上。\\n•横置所有由目标牌手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdca7496-3b82-443f-8093-ca8d206aef09\', \'multiverseId\': 421182}, \'multiverseid\': 421182}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angriffslustiges Zunderhorn\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nZu Beginn des Endsegments jedes Spielers und falls in diesem Zug keine Kreaturen angegriffen haben, lege eine Tobsuchtsmarke auf das Angriffslustige Zunderhorn. Dann fügt das Angriffslustige Zunderhorn jenem Spieler so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie Tobsuchtsmarken auf ihm liegen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Ochse\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421335&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'591544de-4063-472f-9c28-a6ed0a6b9494\', \'multiverseId\': 421335}, \'multiverseid\': 421335}, {\'name\': \'Cuernolumbre a la carga\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nAl comienzo del paso final de cada jugador, si ninguna criatura atacó este turno, pon un contador de furia sobre el Cuernolumbre a la carga. Luego el Cuernolumbre a la carga hace daño igual a la cantidad de contadores de furia sobre él a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Buey elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fff4bf9d-fd5e-4e0e-8a4d-fee053fcd5ac\', \'multiverseId\': 423090}, \'multiverseid\': 423090}, {\'name\': \'Braisecorne chargeur\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nAu début de l\'étape de fin de chaque joueur, si aucune créature n\'a attaqué ce tour-ci, mettez un marqueur « furie » sur le Braisecorne chargeur. Ensuite, le Braisecorne chargeur inflige un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de marqueurs « furie » sur lui à ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et bovidé\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421686&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fbe91eb-2f98-44db-ab3e-60e332cca7e1\', \'multiverseId\': 421686}, \'multiverseid\': 421686}, {\'name\': \'Bracicorno alla Carica\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\nAll\'inizio della sottofase finale di ogni giocatore, se nessuna creatura ha attaccato in questo turno, metti un segnalino furore sul Bracicorno alla Carica. Poi il Bracicorno alla Carica infligge a quel giocatore danno pari al numero di segnalini furore su di esso.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bue Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b1375bf-4fd3-4261-856a-76002424c21c\', \'multiverseId\': 422037}, \'multiverseid\': 422037}, {\'name\': \'みなぎる燃えがら角\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n各プレイヤーの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにクリーチャーが攻撃していなかった場合、みなぎる燃えがら角の上に鬱憤カウンターを１個置く。その後、みなぎる燃えがら角はそのプレイヤーに、これの上に置かれている鬱憤カウンターの総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・雄牛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc84a17c-5e36-4ec9-9c05-4956c1eccbd6\', \'multiverseId\': 422388}, \'multiverseid\': 422388}, {\'name\': \'Chifre-ígneo de Assalto\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nNo início da etapa final de cada jogador, se nenhuma criatura atacou neste turno, coloque um marcador de fúria em Chifre-ígneo de Assalto. Em seguida, Chifre-ígneo de Assalto causa àquele jogador dano igual ao número de marcadores de fúria que possui.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Boi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f4a360f-e1a1-4165-bfee-b6eadfacdc57\', \'multiverseId\': 422739}, \'multiverseid\': 422739}, {\'name\': \'烬角蛮牛\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n在每位牌手的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中没有生物攻击过，则在烬角蛮牛上放置一个狂怒指示物。然后烬角蛮牛对该牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于其上狂怒指示物的数量。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素／牛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccaff645-f218-455e-9df9-ced4cebe0523\', \'multiverseId\': 420984}, \'multiverseid\': 420984}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anspornender Ruf\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Karte für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt. Diese Kreaturen erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421472&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b4ff1ae-4a0b-4373-8010-1739771aff62\', \'multiverseId\': 421472}, \'multiverseid\': 421472}, {\'name\': \'Llamada inspiradora\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta por cada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella. Esas criaturas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5221db46-b166-4a36-a0c6-f3be04328018\', \'multiverseId\': 423227}, \'multiverseid\': 423227}, {\'name\': \'Appel inspirateur\', \'text\': "Piochez une carte pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Ces créatures acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421823&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cde72cd5-892b-4e37-bd35-8a38bf0feb18\', \'multiverseId\': 421823}, \'multiverseid\': 421823}, {\'name\': \'Chiamata Ispiratrice\', \'text\': \'Pesca una carta per ogni creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli. Quelle creature hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70be4069-6364-4096-a7f2-dda5ba37b077\', \'multiverseId\': 422174}, \'multiverseid\': 422174}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞する呼び声\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体につき、カードを１枚引く。ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e993a5ef-8859-459a-b070-aea79103737f\', \'multiverseId\': 422525}, \'multiverseid\': 422525}, {\'name\': \'Chamado Inspirador\', \'text\': \'Compre um card para cada criatura que você controla com um marcador +1/+1. Essas criaturas ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c66d3906-a230-4b5e-b672-72404aef8a78\', \'multiverseId\': 422876}, \'multiverseid\': 422876}, {\'name\': \'振奋呼号\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个其上有+1/+1指示物的生物，便抓一张牌。这些生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ffdf7fc-2eef-4c74-99c4-83665b11df7c\', \'multiverseId\': 421121}, \'multiverseid\': 421121}]', "[{'name': 'Armee der Verdammten', 'text': 'Erzeuge dreizehn getappte 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nRückblende {7}{B}{B}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Manchmal klopft der Tod an. Manchmal reißt er auch Wände ein.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421424&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9449a9e-c756-4019-9d97-0e3bcc092e2d', 'multiverseId': 421424}, 'multiverseid': 421424}, {'name': 'Ejército de los condenados', 'text': 'Crea trece fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2 giradas.\\nRetrospectiva {7}{B}{B}{B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'A veces la muerte golpea a tu puerta. A veces tira abajo las paredes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423179&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16b36092-4be9-4ed6-83ce-da4ffb59857e', 'multiverseId': 423179}, 'multiverseid': 423179}, {'name': 'Armée des damnés', 'text': 'Créez treize jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie engagés.\\nFlashback {7}{B}{B}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Parfois la mort vient frapper à votre porte. Parfois, elle défonce les murs.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421775&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7cd4249-c0c4-43ab-9699-dc7a4be69cb1', 'multiverseId': 421775}, 'multiverseid': 421775}, {'name': 'Esercito dei Dannati', 'text': 'Crea tredici pedine creatura Zombie 2/2 nere TAPpate.\\nFlashback {7}{B}{B}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'A volte la morte viene bussando. A volte sfonda le pareti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422126&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c75bc62e-8251-44e0-9356-5adbab0483f1', 'multiverseId': 422126}, 'multiverseid': 422126}, {'name': '忌むべき者の軍団', 'text': 'タップ状態の黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを13体生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{7}{B}{B}{B}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'ときに死は扉を叩く。ときに死は壁をぶち破る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422477&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10ea6569-b151-4e0e-a0c8-bbe283db17d4', 'multiverseId': 422477}, 'multiverseid': 422477}, {'name': 'Exército dos Malditos', 'text': 'Crie treze fichas de criatura preta 2/2 do tipo Zumbi viradas.\\nRecapitular {7}{B}{B}{B} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Algumas vezes, a morte bate na porta. Outras vezes, ela derruba a parede.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422828&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dccf69bf-cce4-4b70-b122-5ed28e4f4af6', 'multiverseId': 422828}, 'multiverseid': 422828}, {'name': '厄亡者大军', 'text': '派出十三个横置的2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\\n返照{7}{B}{B}{B}（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '有时死亡会先敲个门。有时它连墙壁都拆掉。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421073&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce515aee-d07c-474f-b23b-ae662f12de40', 'multiverseId': 421073}, 'multiverseid': 421073}]", '[{\'name\': \'Arsenal-Automat\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Arsenal-Automat ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Ausrüstungen deiner Wahl an ihn anlegen. (Die Kontrolle über die Ausrüstungen ändert sich nicht.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Ohne Fleisch, das schwach werden könnte, wurden Maschinen schnell zu den bevorzugten Lehrmeistern der Akademie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421370&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c038092-4d3b-4d46-8887-cfccd5a69996\', \'multiverseId\': 421370}, \'multiverseid\': 421370}, {\'name\': \'Autómata de la armería\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Autómata de la armería entre al campo de batalla o ataque, puedes anexarle cualquier cantidad de equipo objetivo. (El control del equipo no cambia.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Sin carne que se fatigue ni determinación que flaquee, las máquinas no tardaron en convertirse en los entrenadores preferidos de la Academia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e8a0734-786a-455e-9520-06244429777e\', \'multiverseId\': 423125}, \'multiverseid\': 423125}, {\'name\': "Automate de l\'armurerie", \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Automate de l\'armurerie arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, vous pouvez lui attacher n\'importe quel nombre d\'équipements ciblés. (Le contrôle de l\'équipement ne change pas.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "Sans chair à fatiguer et sans détermination à émousser, les machines devinrent rapidement les entraîneurs favoris de l\'Académie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421721&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56df3b9b-ab98-45f9-8633-8c7b122553c3\', \'multiverseId\': 421721}, \'multiverseid\': 421721}, {\'name\': "Automa dell\'Armeria", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Automa dell\'Armeria entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, puoi assegnare ad esso un qualsiasi numero di Equipaggiamenti bersaglio. (Il controllo dell\'Equipaggiamento non cambia.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': "Immuni alla stanchezza della carne e dello spirito, le macchine divennero ben presto gli addestratori preferiti dell\'Accademia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d21143db-d073-4a7d-b57b-2970649eee92\', \'multiverseId\': 422072}, \'multiverseid\': 422072}, {\'name\': \'武器庫の自動機械\', \'text\': \'武器庫の自動機械が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、望む数の装備品を対象とする。あなたはそれらをこれにつけてもよい。（それらの装備品のコントロールは変わらない。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'疲労する体も躊躇する心も持たないため、程なくこれら機械が学院で訓練者として好まれるようになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'674109ba-f574-4858-ba59-28466359a391\', \'multiverseId\': 422423}, \'multiverseid\': 422423}, {\'name\': \'Autômato do Arsenal\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Autômato do Arsenal entra no campo de batalha ou ataca, você pode anexar qualquer número de Equipamentos alvo a ele. (O controle do Equipamento não é alterado.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Desprovidos da carne que se cansa e da determinação que fraqueja, as máquinas logo se tornaram os treinadores preferidos da academia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c11c1a0-0afc-4d92-b849-84e5718818be\', \'multiverseId\': 422774}, \'multiverseid\': 422774}, {\'name\': \'军械库机械兽\', \'text\': \'每当军械库机械兽进战场或攻击时，你可以将任意数量的目标武具装备于其上。（武具的操控权并未改变。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'这些机器既无会感到疲惫的肉身，亦无会逐渐消沉的意志，于是很快就成了学院偏好的训练师。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96971d18-4bed-4fc7-960b-5e09f66341a4\', \'multiverseId\': 421019}, \'multiverseid\': 421019}]', '[{\'name\': \'Artefaktmutation\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl. Es kann nicht regeneriert werden. Erzeuge X 1/1 grüne Saproling-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich den umgewandelten Manakosten des Artefaktes ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Aus Splittern und Scherben rufe ich meine lebendige Horde empor." —Molimo, Maro-Hexer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421498&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'848e3816-b970-4dd7-8740-aa0fb9905a8d\', \'multiverseId\': 421498}, \'multiverseid\': 421498}, {\'name\': \'Mutación de artefacto\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto objetivo. No puede ser regenerado. Crea X fichas de criatura Saprolín verdes 1/1, donde X es el coste de maná convertido de ese artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"De fragmentos y astillas origino mi horda viviente". —Molimo, hechicero maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d39ae5fe-1e7b-4e95-97b7-a74faf35a506\', \'multiverseId\': 423253}, \'multiverseid\': 423253}, {\'name\': "Mutation d\'artefact", \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé. Il ne peut pas être régénéré. Créez X jetons de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte, X étant le coût converti de mana de cet artefact.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Épines et échardes, je t\'appelle, horde vivante. » —Molimo, maro-sorcier", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421849&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33201418-64da-4897-89fc-5c407c8172a6\', \'multiverseId\': 421849}, \'multiverseid\': 421849}, {\'name\': \'Mutazione degli Artefatti\', \'text\': "Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio. Non può essere rigenerato. Crea X pedine creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verdi, dove X è il costo di mana convertito di quell\'artefatto.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dai frammenti e dalle schegge, io evoco la mia orda vivente." —Molimo, stregone maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cba17fc-127b-47c2-97d3-377dac27da9a\', \'multiverseId\': 422200}, \'multiverseid\': 422200}, {\'name\': \'秘宝の突然変異\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。それは再生できない。緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体生成する。Ｘは、そのアーティファクトの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「破片やかけらから、私は生きている部下たちを呼び返すのです。」 ――マローの魔術師モリモ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'383beb3e-2b9a-4177-95ff-d95ba8f381ad\', \'multiverseId\': 422551}, \'multiverseid\': 422551}, {\'name\': \'Mutação de Artefato\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato alvo. Ele não pode ser regenerado. Crie X fichas de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Saprófita, sendo X o custo de mana convertido daquele artefato.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"De estilhaços e fragmentos eu conclamo minha horda viva." — Molimo, feiticeiro maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aed8832-71c8-4f73-a9a3-531a18c201bc\', \'multiverseId\': 422902}, \'multiverseid\': 422902}, {\'name\': \'神器异变\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器。它不能重生。派出X个1/1绿色腐生物衍生生物，X为该神器的总法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「自碎片与残迹中，我的部队应召唤而来。」 ～玛洛术士莫黎墨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'010c0522-659d-4153-a67a-ea131f6dae4e\', \'multiverseId\': 421147}, \'multiverseid\': 421147}]', "[{'name': 'Aschenödnis', 'text': '{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {C}.\\nStandardlandumwandlung {1} ({1}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421375&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4fc0d40a-b5c1-4c5b-9b9e-2099786ba73f', 'multiverseId': 421375}, 'multiverseid': 421375}, {'name': 'Yermos humeantes', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C} a tu reserva de maná.\\nCiclo de tierras básicas {1}. ({1}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423130&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30e57886-93e9-487b-b08a-fd2970480e97', 'multiverseId': 423130}, 'multiverseid': 423130}, {'name': 'Landes cendreuses', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C} à votre réserve.\\nRecyclage de terrain de base {1} ({1}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la et mettez-la dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421726&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0fbd072-b3f8-4fac-b0f2-3d9566098506', 'multiverseId': 421726}, 'multiverseid': 421726}, {'name': 'Distese di Polvere', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C} alla tua riserva di mana.\\nCicloterra base {1} ({1}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422077&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a34a75c6-71f0-4a37-8329-9a0e946c951c', 'multiverseId': 422077}, 'multiverseid': 422077}, {'name': '灰のやせ地', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n基本土地サイクリング{1}（{1}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422428&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '607c230d-6d0d-44ac-97ee-d578850fa570', 'multiverseId': 422428}, 'multiverseid': 422428}, {'name': 'Desolação Fumegante', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C} à sua reserva de mana.\\nReciclar terreno básico {1} ({1}, Descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422779&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c96f1913-d0f3-4157-b304-6f2097835e82', 'multiverseId': 422779}, 'multiverseid': 422779}, {'name': '灰烬瘠地', 'text': '{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n循环基本地{1}（{1}，弃掉此牌：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，并置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421024&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6fef88e-8bed-4527-87bd-fac9e5865453', 'multiverseId': 421024}, 'multiverseid': 421024}]", "[{'name': 'Astrales Füllhorn', 'text': 'Das Astrale Füllhorn kommt mit X Ladungsmarken ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Bestimme eine Farbe. Erhöhe für jede Ladungsmarke auf dem Astralen Füllhorn deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421562&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17541802-e386-4743-bcbc-37acf81ad359', 'multiverseId': 421562}, 'multiverseid': 421562}, {'name': 'Cornucopia astral', 'text': 'La Cornucopia astral entra al campo de batalla con X contadores de carga sobre ella.\\n{T}: Elige un color. Agrega un maná de ese color a tu reserva de maná por cada contador de carga sobre la Cornucopia astral.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423317&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7961bc2a-4f0c-42a0-b640-0dbb9eea5043', 'multiverseId': 423317}, 'multiverseid': 423317}, {'name': 'Cornucopée astrale', 'text': 'La Cornucopée astrale arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs « charge » sur elle.\\n{T} : Choisissez une couleur. Ajoutez un mana de cette couleur à votre réserve pour chaque marqueur « charge » sur la Cornucopée astrale.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421913&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e54a0ab-09da-4ba9-a412-85755985759e', 'multiverseId': 421913}, 'multiverseid': 421913}, {'name': 'Cornucopia Astrale', 'text': 'La Cornucopia Astrale entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini carica.\\n{T}: Scegli un colore. Aggiungi un mana di quel colore alla tua riserva di mana per ogni segnalino carica sulla Cornucopia Astrale.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422264&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94e09f09-5fd0-4570-a412-292472dc5c94', 'multiverseId': 422264}, 'multiverseid': 422264}, {'name': '霊体のヤギ角', 'text': '霊体のヤギ角は、蓄積カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：色１色を選ぶ。霊体のヤギ角の上に置かれた蓄積カウンター１個につき、あなたのマナ・プールにその色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422615&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a82c54f2-fd2a-4d1a-b757-de70d7fa735d', 'multiverseId': 422615}, 'multiverseid': 422615}, {'name': 'Cornucópia Astral', 'text': 'Cornucópia Astral entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores de carga.\\n{T}: Escolha uma cor. Adicione um mana daquela cor à sua reserva de mana para cada marcador de carga em Cornucópia Astral.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422966&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4094557-c5f9-4b2c-b8d6-168696752c97', 'multiverseId': 422966}, 'multiverseid': 422966}, {'name': '星幽羊角', 'text': '星幽羊角进战场时上面有X个充电指示物。\\n{T}：选择一种颜色。星幽羊角上每有一个充电指示物，便加一点该色法术力到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421211&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26a7c07d-8dde-47b7-b5f8-215f05694ae9', 'multiverseId': 421211}, 'multiverseid': 421211}]", '[{\'name\': \'Atraxa, Stimme der Prätoren\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, Todesberührung, Lebensverknüpfung\\nFühre zu Beginn deines Endsegments Wucherung durch. (Du bestimmst eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern, auf denen Marken liegen, und gibst ihnen dann eine weitere Marke einer Sorte, die dort bereits liegt.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421347&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8d2e4ac-ea6f-4033-9c98-701ddb87d709\', \'multiverseId\': 421347}, \'multiverseid\': 421347}, {\'name\': \'Atraxa, voz de los magistrados\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia, toque mortal, vínculo vital.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, prolifera. (Eliges cualquier cantidad de permanentes y/o jugadores con contadores sobre ellos y pones sobre cada uno un contador de un tipo que ya tenga.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Horror ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b34d2bf-2c8a-45af-8a45-5526db1ec94f\', \'multiverseId\': 423102}, \'multiverseid\': 423102}, {\'name\': \'Atraxa, voix des praetors\', \'text\': "Vol, vigilance, contact mortel, lien de vie\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, proliférez. (Vous choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs avec des marqueurs sur eux, puis vous leur donnez à chacun un autre marqueur d\'une sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ange et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421698&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c91666f-6950-40f1-945f-41946810c1af\', \'multiverseId\': 421698}, \'multiverseid\': 421698}, {\'name\': \'Atraxa, Voce dei Pretori\', \'text\': "Volare, cautela, tocco letale, legame vitale\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, prolifera. (Scegli un qualsiasi numero di permanenti e/o giocatori con segnalini su di essi, poi metti su ognuno un altro segnalino di un tipo già presente.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Orrore Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f30969b-9067-4be5-9bd2-2601239ea452\', \'multiverseId\': 422049}, \'multiverseid\': 422049}, {\'name\': \'法務官の声、アトラクサ\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒、接死、絆魂\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、増殖を行う。（あなたはカウンターの置かれているパーマネントやプレイヤーを望む数だけ選び、その後それらのそれぞれに、その上に置かれているうち１種類のカウンターを１個置く。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f60e525d-b398-43ce-aa40-67a56953c97d\', \'multiverseId\': 422400}, \'multiverseid\': 422400}, {\'name\': \'Atraxa, Voz dos Pretores\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância, toque mortífero, vínculo com a vida\\nNo início de sua etapa final, prolifere. (Você escolhe um número qualquer de permanentes e/ou jogadores com marcadores e depois dá a cada um outro marcador de um tipo que eles já tenham.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anjo Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea5ad3aa-cd77-407f-8fc8-a58910c3033d\', \'multiverseId\': 422751}, \'multiverseid\': 422751}, {\'name\': \'魔判官之声亚崔夏\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒，死触，系命\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，增殖。（你选择任意数量其上有指示物的永久物和／或牌手，然后在其上放置一个它已有之种类的指示物。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～天使／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f6fe360-2746-48cd-9b65-62fa6f2171de\', \'multiverseId\': 420996}, \'multiverseid\': 420996}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf Garruks Pfad\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen, die du nicht kontrollierst, und alle Planeswalker, die du nicht kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Jenseits des Schmerzes, der Besessenheit und der wilden Verzweiflung existiert ein Ort perverser Macht, den nur die gequältesten Seelen erreichen können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421432&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc06b07a-9239-4af2-a1ba-748107e6697c\', \'multiverseId\': 421432}, \'multiverseid\': 421432}, {\'name\': \'Tras los pasos de Garruk\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas que no controlas y todos los planeswalkers que no controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Más allá del dolor, más allá de la obsesión y de la desesperanza incontrolable, existe un lugar de retorcido poder que solo pueden alcanzar las almas más atormentadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cba0ad1d-0351-44ca-b3cc-f4adc845200c\', \'multiverseId\': 423187}, \'multiverseid\': 423187}, {\'name\': \'Dans le sillage de Garruk\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures que vous ne contrôlez pas et tous les planeswalkers que vous ne contrôlez pas.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Au-delà de la souffrance, de l\'obsession et du noir désespoir existe un lieu de corruption que seules les âmes les plus tourmentées peuvent atteindre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421783&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfd71740-6902-45c1-9c64-8ca57d41b011\', \'multiverseId\': 421783}, \'multiverseid\': 421783}, {\'name\': \'Sulla Scia di Garruk\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature che non controlli e tutti i planeswalker che non controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Oltre il dolore, oltre l\'ossessione e la pura disperazione, si trova un luogo dal potere corrotto che solo le anime più tormentate possono raggiungere.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51900bcf-2068-48b2-9dac-5e6adc140664\', \'multiverseId\': 422134}, \'multiverseid\': 422134}, {\'name\': \'ガラクの目覚め\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていないすべてのクリーチャーと、あなたがコントロールしていないすべてのプレインズウォーカーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'苦痛や執着、そして激しい無念を超越したある場所に、極限まで苛まれた魂のみが到達することができる所があるという。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2f0915d-34e3-4e10-9c11-ba307b302225\', \'multiverseId\': 422485}, \'multiverseid\': 422485}, {\'name\': \'No Rastro de Garruk\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas que você não controla e todos os planeswalker que você não controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Além da dor, da obsessão e do desespero selvagem, há um lugar de poder distorcido que só as almas mais atormentadas conseguem alcançar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30c956f0-681d-4eb4-94c0-cb740300bc4e\', \'multiverseId\': 422836}, \'multiverseid\': 422836}, {\'name\': \'贾路开道\', \'text\': \'消灭所有不由你操控的生物和鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'有一处超越痛苦，超越执着与绝望，充满扭曲力量的所在，只有遭受折磨最深的灵魂才能到达。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dade770-e744-4b95-a1a0-4a9faa3af015\', \'multiverseId\': 421081}, \'multiverseid\': 421081}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufblühen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner ein Land spielt, kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die erste Ranke weist den anderen den Weg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421462&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54315ca6-733b-48c4-a9be-834702b20fb4\', \'multiverseId\': 421462}, \'multiverseid\': 421462}, {\'name\': \'Germinación\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente juegue una tierra, puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'La primera vid muestra a las demás por dónde crecer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31920929-a67b-4075-bc55-7c6dfc2a8254\', \'multiverseId\': 423217}, \'multiverseid\': 423217}, {\'name\': \'Bourgeonnement\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire joue un terrain, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain de votre main.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'La première liane montre aux autres où pousser.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421813&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9881d2a7-8c0e-4dad-83bb-f87f9071fde8\', \'multiverseId\': 421813}, \'multiverseid\': 421813}, {\'name\': \'Germogliare\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario gioca una terra, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Il primo arbusto mostra agli altri dove crescere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bc251ff-353c-473a-b03b-82699ad8b363\', \'multiverseId\': 422164}, \'multiverseid\': 422164}, {\'name\': \'芽ぐみ\', \'text\': \'対戦相手が土地を１つプレイするたび、あなたはあなたの手札から土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'初めのツタが伸びると他のツタも従う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58bc3ed1-2d88-4bf4-a297-67550bd12b7c\', \'multiverseId\': 422515}, \'multiverseid\': 422515}, {\'name\': \'Brotamento\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente joga um terreno, você pode colocar um card de terreno de sua mão no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'A primeira vinha mostra às outras para onde crescer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d53de97-9750-4bab-bc4b-8e914e1370a0\', \'multiverseId\': 422866}, \'multiverseid\': 422866}, {\'name\': \'发芽\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手使用地时，你可以将一张地牌从你手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'第一支藤蔓指引其他的向何处生长。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'107197e3-2e11-4123-b277-ad79af3b6d4f\', \'multiverseId\': 421111}, \'multiverseid\': 421111}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg des Bändigers\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, angreift, kannst du eine Quest-Marke auf den Aufstieg des Bändigers legen.\\nSolange auf dem Aufstieg des Bändigers sieben oder mehr Quest-Marken liegen, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +5/+5.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421461&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd59a3de-40fe-4e6c-b400-632f74bde5bb\', \'multiverseId\': 421461}, \'multiverseid\': 421461}, {\'name\': \'Ascenso del domador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque, puedes poner un contador de búsqueda sobre el Ascenso del domador.\\nMientras el Ascenso del domador tenga siete o más contadores de búsqueda sobre él, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +5/+5.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a2d5075-134a-4f55-ab4e-d6be43835c9e\', \'multiverseId\': 423216}, \'multiverseid\': 423216}, {\'name\': \'Ascension du maître des bêtes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur « quête » sur l\'Ascension du maître des bêtes.\\nTant que l\'Ascension du maître des bêtes a au moins sept marqueurs « quête » sur elle, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +5/+5.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421812&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd769695-861c-4dc9-99be-d4216782e48e\', \'multiverseId\': 421812}, \'multiverseid\': 421812}, {\'name\': \'Ascensione del Domatore\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca, puoi mettere un segnalino ricerca sull\'Ascensione del Domatore.\\nFintanto che l\'Ascensione del Domatore ha sette o più segnalini ricerca, le creature che controlli prendono +5/+5.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e61a1131-bbe3-4a25-bd21-2182b91b88f8\', \'multiverseId\': 422163}, \'multiverseid\': 422163}, {\'name\': \'獣使いの昇天\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーが１体攻撃するたび、あなたは獣使いの昇天の上に探索カウンターを１個置いてもよい。\\n獣使いの昇天の上に探索カウンターが７個以上置かれているかぎり、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋５/＋５の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a80a9a-5111-4257-8bf3-095ced78222b\', \'multiverseId\': 422514}, \'multiverseid\': 422514}, {\'name\': \'Ascensão do Senhor das Feras\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca, você pode colocar um marcador de busca em Ascensão do Senhor das Feras.\\nEnquanto Ascensão do Senhor das Feras tiver sete ou mais marcadores de busca nele, as criaturas que você controla receberão +5/+5.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecbc2992-c766-4256-9094-a6aaec2f0184\', \'multiverseId\': 422865}, \'multiverseid\': 422865}, {\'name\': \'兽侯腾扬\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物攻击时，你可以在兽侯腾扬上放置一个探索指示物。\\n只要兽侯腾扬上有七个或更多探索指示物，由你操控的生物便得+5/+5。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54579c4b-8a19-467b-a1e5-23a7c82c73a2\', \'multiverseId\': 421110}, \'multiverseid\': 421110}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aurenmutation\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl. Erzeuge X 1/1 grüne Saproling-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich den umgewandelten Manakosten der Verzauberung ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Leben kann in allen Dingen gefunden werden, selbst in unnatürlichen." —Multani, Maro-Zauberer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421499&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be86e5e0-6da9-45f5-a119-ab44bd8461c6\', \'multiverseId\': 421499}, \'multiverseid\': 421499}, {\'name\': \'Mutación de aura\', \'text\': \'Destruye el encantamiento objetivo. Crea X fichas de criatura Saprolín verdes 1/1, donde X es el coste de maná convertido de ese encantamiento.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La vida se puede encontrar en todas las cosas, incluso en las que no son naturales". —Multani, hechicero maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6542e6a-e746-479a-91a6-8f4d47c10091\', \'multiverseId\': 423254}, \'multiverseid\': 423254}, {\'name\': "Mutation d\'aura", \'text\': "Détruisez l\'enchantement ciblé. Créez X jetons de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte, X étant le coût converti de mana de cet enchantement.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« La vie est partout, et pas seulement dans la nature. » —Multani, maro-sorcier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421850&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'836cd5f8-ec43-4573-93af-035b4cd71b46\', \'multiverseId\': 421850}, \'multiverseid\': 421850}, {\'name\': "Mutazione dell\'Aura", \'text\': "Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio. Crea X pedine creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verdi, dove X è il costo di mana convertito di quell\'incantesimo.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La vita si può trovare in tutte le cose, anche in quelle innaturali." —Multani, stregone maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27c606bf-a9d4-4021-8c69-0b0053be5e28\', \'multiverseId\': 422201}, \'multiverseid\': 422201}, {\'name\': \'オーラの突然変異\', \'text\': \'エンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体生成する。Ｘは、そのエンチャントの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「あらゆる物の中に命を見ることができる。自然でない物の中にもね。」 ――マローの魔術師ムルタニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'935a8ab7-6562-4ad8-a0c9-f5631f684e17\', \'multiverseId\': 422552}, \'multiverseid\': 422552}, {\'name\': \'Mutação de Aura\', \'text\': \'Destrua o encantamento alvo. Crie X fichas de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Saprófita, sendo X o custo de mana convertido daquele encantamento.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A vida pode ser encontrada em todas as coisas, mesmo nas antinaturais." — Multani, Feiticeiro-maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25b8b8c5-c84d-4c9e-af15-273dcdd903bb\', \'multiverseId\': 422903}, \'multiverseid\': 422903}, {\'name\': \'灵气突变\', \'text\': \'消灭目标结界。派出X个1/1绿色腐生物衍生生物，X为该结界的总法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「万物皆蕴生机，纵非自然之物亦若是。」 ～玛洛术士穆塔尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1557af5-a32e-452a-89b2-8d1b4bfd9489\', \'multiverseId\': 421148}, \'multiverseid\': 421148}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus dem Gesicht geschnitten\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer Kreatur deiner Wahl ist.\\nZurückverfolgen (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Kosten eine Länderkarte abwirfst.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Bespucken ist die normale Begrüßung zwischen einer Kreatur und ihrem magischen Ebenbild.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421555&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55a94a08-0993-46d9-ad63-f96c9e955ccb\', \'multiverseId\': 421555}, \'multiverseid\': 421555}, {\'name\': \'Imagen escupidora\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha que es una copia de la criatura objetivo.\\nDesandar. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio descartando una carta de tierra además de pagar sus otros costes.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Escupir es el saludo acostumbrado entre una criatura y su impostor mágico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69b67d21-e126-4ee1-bf17-82b0564ac358\', \'multiverseId\': 423310}, \'multiverseid\': 423310}, {\'name\': \'Portrait craché\', \'text\': "Créez un jeton qui est une copie de la créature ciblée.\\nPistage (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière en vous défaussant d\'une carte de terrain en plus de payer ses autres coûts.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Une créature et son imposteur magique s\'accueillent toujours l\'un l\'autre par un crachat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421906&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e8a3308-87f4-4c88-90f1-0ff436a1662a\', \'multiverseId\': 421906}, \'multiverseid\': 421906}, {\'name\': \'Immagine Sputata\', \'text\': \'Crea una pedina che è una copia di una creatura bersaglio.\\nRievocare (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero scartando una carta terra oltre a pagare gli altri suoi costi.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Sputare è il saluto abituale tra una creatura e il suo impostore magico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'248777a4-6d22-43c0-b2e2-ab19c4c3ff70\', \'multiverseId\': 422257}, \'multiverseid\': 422257}, {\'name\': \'瓜二つ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。\\n回顧（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードを、他のコストの支払いに加えて土地・カード１枚を捨てることで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'瓜を投げあうのが、生き物と魔法の偽物とのよくある挨拶だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17cac251-6316-42bd-8c45-4a4711475952\', \'multiverseId\': 422608}, \'multiverseid\': 422608}, {\'name\': \'Cuspido e Escarrado\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia da criatura alvo.\\nRetraçar (Você pode conjurar este card a partir de seu cemitério ao descartar um card de terreno além de pagar seus outros custos.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Cuspir é a saudação habitual entre uma criatura e seu impostor mágico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1e2b8f9-741d-45d0-a4ec-432b0ce2417a\', \'multiverseId\': 422959}, \'multiverseid\': 422959}, {\'name\': \'射影\', \'text\': \'派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标生物之复制品。\\n追溯（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，但必须支付其所需费用，并额外弃掉一张地牌。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'生物碰上自己的法术假冒品时，通常会行互射口水之礼。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0970f3fc-bb3c-43ad-b0ec-552f7070f9a9\', \'multiverseId\': 421204}, \'multiverseid\': 421204}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus und vorbei\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kam auf der Suche nach einer Herausforderung. Alles, was ich fand, warst du." —Zurgo, Khan der Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421545&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6700bec0-c295-47f7-bb79-562e55d3a630\', \'multiverseId\': 421545}, \'multiverseid\': 421545}, {\'name\': \'Fin absoluto\', \'text\': \'Exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vine en busca de un desafío... pero solo te he encontrado a ti". —Zurgo, kan de los Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e247ef25-c328-414e-9c50-81c6cd944430\', \'multiverseId\': 423300}, \'multiverseid\': 423300}, {\'name\': \'Destruction totale\', \'text\': \'Exilez le permanent non-terrain ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je venais en quête de défi. Mais je n\'ai trouvé que toi. » —Zurgo, khan des Mardu", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421896&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'774e991d-b85b-4bd6-9558-4cc45fdd2116\', \'multiverseId\': 421896}, \'multiverseid\': 421896}, {\'name\': \'Fine Assoluta\', \'text\': \'Esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono giunto in cerca di una sfida, ma non ho trovato che te." —Zurgo, khan dei Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f938fd9-16fa-4c62-96e5-02d9d3fb2549\', \'multiverseId\': 422247}, \'multiverseid\': 422247}, {\'name\': \'完全なる終わり\', \'text\': \'土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「俺は挑戦を求めて来たというのに。ここにいたのはお前だけというわけか。」 ――マルドゥのカン、ズルゴ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3bd2c3a-e025-4c14-a4f8-a193430b2b41\', \'multiverseId\': 422598}, \'multiverseid\': 422598}, {\'name\': \'Fim Absoluto\', \'text\': \'Exile a permanente alvo que não seja terreno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu vim em busca de um desafio. Tudo o que encontrei foi você." — Zurgo, khan dos Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b0adadb-9d15-4090-bcb6-e2e663533b67\', \'multiverseId\': 422949}, \'multiverseid\': 422949}, {\'name\': \'彻底终结\', \'text\': \'放逐目标非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我来寻求挑战。可我只找到了你。」 ～玛尔都可汗珠高\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42443841-8feb-4c05-a419-5a887b0697f1\', \'multiverseId\': 421194}, \'multiverseid\': 421194}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausdauernde Schuppenfürstin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere +1/+1-Marken auf eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, gelegt werden, kannst du eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Ausdauernde Schuppenfürstin legen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Nur die Sonne, die auf Arashins Mauern niederbrennt, könnte heller strahlen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421515&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'285f0f35-d2c1-4e75-8a6f-b532862885b7\', \'multiverseId\': 421515}, \'multiverseid\': 421515}, {\'name\': \'Señora de escamas resistente\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que se pongan uno o más contadores +1/+1 sobre otra criatura que controlas, puedes poner un contador +1/+1 sobre la Señora de escamas resistente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Solo el sol que refulge sobre los muros de Arashin podría brillar con más fuerza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64670d95-2e61-4884-b5ab-5d0d3229aa9d\', \'multiverseId\': 423270}, \'multiverseid\': 423270}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur squameux perpétuel\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins un marqueur +1/+1 est placé sur une autre créature que vous contrôlez, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Seigneur squameux perpétuel.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "Seul le soleil qui chauffe les murs d\'Arashin pourrait être plus brillant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421866&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b973ab-a383-47d6-be74-981d25c34bf5\', \'multiverseId\': 421866}, \'multiverseid\': 421866}, {\'name\': \'Signore della Scaglia Perpetua\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta vengono messi uno o più segnalini +1/+1 su un\'altra creatura che controlli, puoi mettere un segnalino +1/+1 sul Signore della Scaglia Perpetua.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Soltanto il sole che picchia sulle mura di Arashin potrebbe brillare di una luce più accecante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00a6b3b9-ad27-44a9-931b-b5d2a598355a\', \'multiverseId\': 422217}, \'multiverseid\': 422217}, {\'name\': \'忍耐の鱗王\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンターが１個以上置かれるたび、あなたは忍耐の鱗王の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'その輝きを超えることができるのは、アラシンの城壁を焦がす太陽だけである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac8ae2ae-e340-4fe8-9ab8-2e0a36d28a0c\', \'multiverseId\': 422568}, \'multiverseid\': 422568}, {\'name\': \'Senhor Escamado Resistente\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que um ou mais marcadores +1/+1 são colocados em outra criatura que você controla, você pode colocar um marcador +1/+1 em Senhor Escamado Resistente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Somente o sol que ilumina as muralhas de Arashin possui uma luz mais forte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'926ebd2b-54aa-4cff-a5ed-a1f4078c8aff\', \'multiverseId\': 422919}, \'multiverseid\': 422919}, {\'name\': \'不朽王鳞\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当在由你操控的另一个生物上放置一个或数个+1/+1指示物时，你可以在不朽王鳞上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙\', \'flavor\': \'只有洒在阿拉辛城墙上的阳光才能散出更耀眼的光辉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4013bd98-c64f-4eb2-af44-064a23c88513\', \'multiverseId\': 421164}, \'multiverseid\': 421164}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Kanzlei\', \'text\': \'Die Azorius-Kanzlei kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Azorius-Kanzlei ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421601&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b92e690-c84c-4779-b184-7209eb8bb4d8\', \'multiverseId\': 421601}, \'multiverseid\': 421601}, {\'name\': \'Tribunal azorio\', \'text\': \'El Tribunal azorio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Tribunal azorio entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controles a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}{U} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7066a8fe-02c4-4061-b425-ea433e02fc16\', \'multiverseId\': 423356}, \'multiverseid\': 423356}, {\'name\': "Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius", \'text\': "La Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}{U} à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421952&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52467fe6-e7d3-46c9-9789-da1273bd8df5\', \'multiverseId\': 421952}, \'multiverseid\': 421952}, {\'name\': \'Cancelleria Azorius\', \'text\': \'La Cancelleria Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Cancelleria Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}{U} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15700c37-0d6f-48a4-ac46-425a662a239c\', \'multiverseId\': 422303}, \'multiverseid\': 422303}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの大法官庁\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスの大法官庁はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nアゾリウスの大法官庁が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールする土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b814939c-ce7e-4ec7-a472-4419bf90c508\', \'multiverseId\': 422654}, \'multiverseid\': 422654}, {\'name\': \'Chancelaria Azorius\', \'text\': \'Chancelaria Azorius entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Chancelaria Azorius entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}{U} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f25af150-1454-48cd-aff8-fc7cbe8ba1e0\', \'multiverseId\': 423005}, \'multiverseid\': 423005}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立衡平法院\', \'text\': \'俄佐立衡平法院须横置进战场。\\n当俄佐立衡平法院进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{W}{U}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe087cad-46e0-4b10-9b7b-f1d183934ab3\', \'multiverseId\': 421250}, \'multiverseid\': 421250}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bann alles Lebens\', \'text\': \'Morph {X}{B}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Bann alles Lebens aufgedeckt wird, erhalten alle Kreaturen -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421425&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1fe4a12-151b-479e-a1a1-953c50ece870\', \'multiverseId\': 421425}, \'multiverseid\': 421425}, {\'name\': \'Ruina de los vivos\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosis {X}{B}{B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\\nCuando Ruina de los vivos se pone boca arriba, todas las criaturas obtienen -X/-X hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b03d0db9-0c26-4c37-8cdb-9a3c221ef072\', \'multiverseId\': 423180}, \'multiverseid\': 423180}, {\'name\': \'Fléau des vivants\', \'text\': "Mue {X}{B}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand le Fléau des vivants est retourné face visible, toutes les créatures gagnent -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421776&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9c724d5-d74d-4b8a-b5cc-1938a8367060\', \'multiverseId\': 421776}, \'multiverseid\': 421776}, {\'name\': \'Sventura dei Viventi\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosi {X}{B}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando la Sventura dei Viventi viene girata a faccia in su, tutte le creature prendono -X/-X fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21f70ec9-4743-4fff-b217-814f3cc101d8\', \'multiverseId\': 422127}, \'multiverseid\': 422127}, {\'name\': \'生命を破滅させるもの\', \'text\': \'変異{X}{B}{B}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２クリーチャーとして裏向きに唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、これをいつでも表向きにしてよい。）\\n生命を破滅させるものが表向きになったとき、ターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a14c2f26-14d7-4860-8f74-df5e8cd80ade\', \'multiverseId\': 422478}, \'multiverseid\': 422478}, {\'name\': \'Perdição dos Vivos\', \'text\': \'Metamorfose {X}{B}{B} (Você pode conjurar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\\nQuando Perdição dos Vivos tem a face voltada para cima, todas as criaturas recebem -X/-X até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1facd2f5-570e-4bfc-a09a-080c467c7fef\', \'multiverseId\': 422829}, \'multiverseid\': 422829}, {\'name\': \'夺命邪祟\', \'text\': \'变身{X}{B}{B}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。可随时支付其变身费用使其翻回正面。）\\n当夺命邪祟翻回正面时，所有生物得-X/-X直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef7f3c1f-f70d-4b94-835b-32f590ecf3b6\', \'multiverseId\': 421074}, \'multiverseid\': 421074}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bedrohlicher Leichenflößer\', \'text\': \'Falls eine oder mehrere +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur gelegt würden, die du kontrollierst, werden stattdessen doppelt so viele +1/+1-Marken auf sie gelegt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Schwäche liegt nicht in der Natur des Schwarms.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76e7f414-a1fb-4980-897c-8f6e05e11de0\', \'multiverseId\': 421509}, \'multiverseid\': 421509}, {\'name\': \'Guíacuerpos amenazante\', \'text\': \'Si fueran a colocarse uno o más contadores +1/+1 sobre una criatura que controlas, en vez de eso, se coloca el doble de esa cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hongo\', \'flavor\': \'La debilidad no forma parte de la naturaleza del Enjambre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a5cda9c-2004-4d4c-8da0-9e1ffd540910\', \'multiverseId\': 423264}, \'multiverseid\': 423264}, {\'name\': \'Menace guidecorps\', \'text\': \'Si au moins un marqueur +1/+1 devait être placé sur une créature que vous contrôlez, placez deux fois ce nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle à la place.\', \'type\': \'Créature : fongus\', \'flavor\': "La faiblesse n\'est pas dans la nature de l\'Essaim.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421860&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ddeb97d-ab14-4790-851d-70eeaf6eb140\', \'multiverseId\': 421860}, \'multiverseid\': 421860}, {\'name\': \'Minaccia della Guida dei Cadaveri\', \'text\': \'Se uno o più segnalini +1/+1 stanno per essere messi su una creatura che controlli, metti invece su quella creatura il doppio di quei segnalini.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Fungus\', \'flavor\': \'La debolezza non è nella natura dello Sciame.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1aed632-2264-431e-aba8-bd81c54f19d6\', \'multiverseId\': 422211}, \'multiverseid\': 422211}, {\'name\': \'屍体屋の脅威\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが１個以上置かれるなら、代わりにそれの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをその２倍の個数置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス\', \'flavor\': \'そもそも大群は弱点という概念とは無縁だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebbca8cb-618e-40d0-99d9-874f1a130eca\', \'multiverseId\': 422562}, \'multiverseid\': 422562}, {\'name\': \'Ameaça Guia de Cadáver\', \'text\': \'Se um ou mais marcadores +1/+1 seriam colocados em uma criatura que você controla, em vez disso, será colocado o dobro de marcadores +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fungo\', \'flavor\': \'A fraqueza não é da natureza do Enxame.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a07d7e11-2834-4510-93fc-4f63f599b57e\', \'multiverseId\': 422913}, \'multiverseid\': 422913}, {\'name\': \'占尸威逼\', \'text\': \'如果将会在由你操控的生物上放置一个或数个+1/+1指示物，则改为在其上放置该数量两倍的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～真菌\', \'flavor\': \'软弱非群落的天性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eab41cd-1ae2-4074-a387-2e9d434268c0\', \'multiverseId\': 421158}, \'multiverseid\': 421158}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befehlsturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Niederlage nah und die Anführer verschwunden sind, schauen alle Augen in eine Richtung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421605&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d4781af-1b95-4751-8b4a-ea9357aca2e2\', \'multiverseId\': 421605}, \'multiverseid\': 421605}, {\'name\': \'Torre de mando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega a tu reserva de maná un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se acerca la derrota y escasea el liderazgo, todos los ojos miran en una misma dirección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82073151-f1c7-4549-97a3-6fbe04af53a4\', \'multiverseId\': 423360}, \'multiverseid\': 423360}, {\'name\': \'Tour de commandement\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez à votre réserve un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Quand la défaite est proche et que les ordres viennent à manquer, tous les yeux se portent dans la même direction.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421956&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bd78dc4-8e39-49a6-9f60-636a965bdb6c\', \'multiverseId\': 421956}, \'multiverseid\': 421956}, {\'name\': \'Torre di Comando\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi alla tua riserva di mana un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Quando la sconfitta si avvicina e manca la guida, tutti gli occhi guardano in una sola direzione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d87e6e43-1781-4229-b3f0-f143f7c561b9\', \'multiverseId\': 422307}, \'multiverseid\': 422307}, {\'name\': \'統率の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'敗北が間近で指揮も不十分になったとき、すべての目は一つの方向に向けられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fe02c6f-808f-4185-8b9c-9442d594270c\', \'multiverseId\': 422658}, \'multiverseid\': 422658}, {\'name\': \'Torre de Comando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione a sua reserva de mana um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Quando a derrota está próxima e as orientações são escassas, todos os olhos miram uma direção.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f7c2bd0-3b61-4e05-bd9a-6941f6635a91\', \'multiverseId\': 423009}, \'multiverseid\': 423009}, {\'name\': \'指挥塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力到你的法术力池中，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'当落败已成定局，当指引无处可寻，全军目光便会聚集一处。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1849310-0a24-48ee-a5be-e3f2cc8ff602\', \'multiverseId\': 421254}, \'multiverseid\': 421254}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beinschienen des Blitzes\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Eile und Verhülltheit. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)\\nAusrüsten {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Als der Blitz in die Klippen einschlug, wurde Erz zu Eisen, Eisen zu Stahl und Stahl zu Beinschienen. Der Blitz blieb für immer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421579&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66f4da1a-e8d1-405f-902c-e9db897abead\', \'multiverseId\': 421579}, \'multiverseid\': 421579}, {\'name\': \'Grebas relámpago\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de prisa y velo. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)\\nEquipar {0}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Después de que el relámpago golpeó los acantilados, el mineral se transformó en hierro, el hierro se convirtió en acero y el acero se convirtió en grebas. El relámpago nunca se fue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'209d00c5-a26f-4184-8146-03edb368d5e7\', \'multiverseId\': 423334}, \'multiverseid\': 423334}, {\'name\': "Jambières d\'éclair", \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la célérité et le linceul. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)\\nÉquipement {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Quand l\'éclair frappa les falaises, le minerai devint du fer, le fer de l\'acier, et l\'acier, des jambières. Jamais l\'éclair ne partit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421930&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46b1407b-2744-4ecc-bc5d-c8aa72ef72d4\', \'multiverseId\': 421930}, \'multiverseid\': 421930}, {\'name\': \'Schinieri dei Fulmini\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha rapidità e velo. (Non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.)\\nEquipaggiare {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "Dopo che il fulmine colpì i dirupi, il minerale divenne ferro, il ferro divenne acciaio e l\'acciaio divenne uno schiniere. Il fulmine non se ne andò mai.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52953e4d-e659-4bef-97fa-bd6c0892237a\', \'multiverseId\': 422281}, \'multiverseid\': 422281}, {\'name\': \'稲妻のすね当て\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは速攻と被覆を持つ。（それは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n装備{0}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'稲妻が崖を打った後、鉱石は鉄となり、鉄は鋼となり、鋼はすね当てとなった。稲妻はそこに残ったままだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d57668d-6469-411a-b94a-e66d83813988\', \'multiverseId\': 422632}, \'multiverseid\': 422632}, {\'name\': \'Grevas Faiscantes\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem manto e ímpeto. (Ele não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades.)\\nEquipar {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Depois que o relâmpago atingiu os penhascos, o minério fez-se ferro, o ferro fez-se aço e o aço fez-se grevas. E o relâmpago jamais as deixou.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5929162-691d-43b4-968b-62ae13905a4d\', \'multiverseId\': 422983}, \'multiverseid\': 422983}, {\'name\': \'迅雷护胫\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有敏捷与帷幕异能。（它不能成为咒语或异能的目标。）\\n佩带{0}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'闪电击中山崖后，矿石成铁，铁成钢，钢成护胫。迅雷长存其间。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a29b601f-a316-4339-82c2-62466f819574\', \'multiverseId\': 421228}, \'multiverseid\': 421228}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerung der Zitadelle\', \'text\': \'Sowie Belagerung der Zitadelle ins Spiel kommt, wähle Khane oder Drachen.\\n• Khane — Lege zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\n• Drachen — Tappe zu Beginn des Kampfes im Zug jedes Gegners eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die dieser Spieler kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421381&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b4c0bab-f50f-41ba-8d63-520ccfdb3fd1\', \'multiverseId\': 421381}, \'multiverseid\': 421381}, {\'name\': \'Asedio a la ciudadela\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Asedio a la ciudadela entre al campo de batalla, elige kans o dragones.\\n• Kans — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\n• Dragones — Al comienzo del combate en el turno de cada oponente, gira la criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b17f746f-c55f-43f2-8ba4-0f449688e9af\', \'multiverseId\': 423136}, \'multiverseid\': 423136}, {\'name\': \'Siège de la citadelle\', \'text\': \'Au moment où le Siège de la citadelle arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez Khans ou Dragons.\\n• Khans — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\n• Dragons — Au début du combat pendant le tour de chaque adversaire, engagez une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421732&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9333116f-6552-44de-b76b-c461769ac4d8\', \'multiverseId\': 421732}, \'multiverseid\': 421732}, {\'name\': \'Assedio della Roccaforte\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Assedio della Roccaforte entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli Khan o Draghi.\\n• Khan — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\n• Draghi — All\'inizio del combattimento nel turno di ogni avversario, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d6c5073-5f8e-428f-8b02-94adc0f4b0b4\', \'multiverseId\': 422083}, \'multiverseid\': 422083}, {\'name\': \'城塞の包囲\', \'text\': \'城塞の包囲が戦場に出るに際し、カンか龍かを選ぶ。\\n• カン ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。\\n• 龍 ― 各対戦相手のターンの戦闘の開始時に、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29f24312-0465-4446-acbc-b83fd159ba47\', \'multiverseId\': 422434}, \'multiverseid\': 422434}, {\'name\': \'Cerco à Cidadela\', \'text\': \'Conforme Cerco à Cidadela entra no campo de batalha, escolha Khans ou Dragões.\\n• Khans — No início do combate no seu turno, coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla.\\n• Dragões — No início do combate no turno de cada oponente, vire a criatura alvo que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'740defb0-b62c-4cba-96f3-ce9a2064345a\', \'multiverseId\': 422785}, \'multiverseid\': 422785}, {\'name\': \'围攻殿堂\', \'text\': \'于围攻殿堂进战场时，选择可汗或龙王。\\n•可汗～在你回合的战斗开始时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\\n•龙王～在每位对手回合的战斗开始时，横置目标由该牌手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b511a43a-4cb7-4093-8468-d95c0eb56d35\', \'multiverseId\': 421030}, \'multiverseid\': 421030}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beschwörer-Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Beschwörer-Sphinx ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Artefaktkreaturenkarte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Falls du dies tust, mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421542&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cf17285-9286-4bf1-be4a-ca21ad834d98\', \'multiverseId\': 421542}, \'multiverseid\': 421542}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge invocadora\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Esfinge invocadora entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura artefacto, mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Si lo haces, baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a8e1f02-ed77-45d4-af26-0753614b506c\', \'multiverseId\': 423297}, \'multiverseid\': 423297}, {\'name\': \'Invocatrice sphinge\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Invocatrice sphinge arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature-artefact, la révéler et la mettre dans votre main. Si vous faites ainsi, mélangez votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421893&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e271f65f-a5a9-498f-a60b-beb576a2e23d\', \'multiverseId\': 421893}, \'multiverseid\': 421893}, {\'name\': \'Sfinge Evocatrice\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Sfinge Evocatrice entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta creatura artefatto, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Se lo fai, rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a1ad8b7-8c42-4044-8a39-bc6de8f58eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 422244}, \'multiverseid\': 422244}, {\'name\': \'スフィンクスの召喚士\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nスフィンクスの召喚士が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーからアーティファクト・クリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'002f1490-c47f-4ca5-aef6-8df42fce72fc\', \'multiverseId\': 422595}, \'multiverseid\': 422595}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge Invocadora\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Invocador de Esfinge entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar em seu grimório um card de criatura artefato, revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão. Se fizer isso, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edcdb30c-d628-48c8-af19-625f601ec6d3\', \'multiverseId\': 422946}, \'multiverseid\': 422946}, {\'name\': \'史芬斯召唤师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当史芬斯召唤师进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张神器生物牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。若你如此作，则将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a36f12f-b424-416c-bf7b-b0cfbd26fd9e\', \'multiverseId\': 421191}, \'multiverseid\': 421191}]', "[{'name': 'Beschützerin des Baus', 'text': 'Kreaturen, deren Stärke kleiner ist als die der Beschützerin des Baus, können sie nicht blocken.\\nMegamorph {1}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Megamorph-Kosten auf und lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.)\\nWenn die Beschützerin des Baus aufgedeckt wird, bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421466&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0dbbea9d-df8c-4922-8c0d-796ec6fb47b5', 'multiverseId': 421466}, 'multiverseid': 421466}, {'name': 'Protectora de la guarida', 'text': 'Las criaturas con fuerza menor que la Protectora de la guarida no pueden bloquearla.\\nMegametamorfosis {1}{G}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de megametamorfosis y pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nCuando la Protectora de la guarida se ponga boca arriba, regresa la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423221&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edf829d9-2e1a-47b8-8975-1d5fce3c0ae6', 'multiverseId': 423221}, 'multiverseid': 423221}, {'name': 'Protectrice de la tanière', 'text': 'Les créatures dont la force est inférieure à celle de la Protectrice de la tanière ne peuvent pas la bloquer.\\nMégamue {1}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mégamue et mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nQuand la Protectrice de la tanière est retournée face visible, renvoyez une carte ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et guerrier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421817&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c869d399-45c0-44df-97b0-c031e71bdbcb', 'multiverseId': 421817}, 'multiverseid': 421817}, {'name': 'Protettrice del Rifugio', 'text': 'Le creature con forza inferiore a quella della Protettrice del Rifugio non possono bloccarla.\\nMegamorfosi {1}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di megamorfosi e metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.)\\nQuando la Protettrice del Rifugio viene girata a faccia in su, riprendi in mano una carta bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422168&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bf012cf-b502-4429-ad25-c2f51f8c71d3', 'multiverseId': 422168}, 'multiverseid': 422168}, {'name': '棲み家の防御者', 'text': '棲み家の防御者よりパワーの小さいクリーチャーでは、これをブロックできない。\\n大変異{1}{G}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２クリーチャーとして裏向きに唱えてもよい。これの大変異コストで、これをいつでも表向きにしてよい。そうしたなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。）\\n棲み家の防御者が表向きになったとき、あなたの墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422519&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63443c94-263f-424e-b623-7fc24066e329', 'multiverseId': 422519}, 'multiverseid': 422519}, {'name': 'Protetor do Covil', 'text': 'As criaturas com poder menor que o de Protetor do Covil não podem bloqueá-lo.\\nMegamorfose {1}{G} (Você pode conjurar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de megamorfose e coloque um marcador +1/+1 nele.)\\nQuando Protetor do Covil for voltado para cima, devolva o card alvo do seu cemitério para sua mão.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422870&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6d38ada-09d3-4379-9bad-3853aca9f04f', 'multiverseId': 422870}, 'multiverseid': 422870}, {'name': '家园卫护人', 'text': '力量小于家园卫护人的生物不能阻挡它。\\n威力变身{1}{G}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。可随时支付其威力变身费用使其翻回正面，并在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n当家园卫护人翻回正面时，将目标牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。', 'type': '生物～人类／战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421115&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03a98685-0e61-46be-8def-5411d9aeb72b', 'multiverseId': 421115}, 'multiverseid': 421115}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blasphemische Tat\', \'text\': \'Die Blasphemische Tat kostet beim Wirken für jede Kreatur im Spiel {1} weniger.\\nDie Blasphemische Tat fügt jeder Kreatur 13 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Heilige Orte schützen nicht mehr vor dem Tod, und der Tod schützt auch nicht mehr vor allem." —Thalia, Katharerritterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421439&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'460db60b-5ddc-47a4-8ab7-59d6fae18972\', \'multiverseId\': 421439}, \'multiverseid\': 421439}, {\'name\': \'Acto blasfemo\', \'text\': \'Cuesta {1} menos lanzar el Acto blasfemo por cada criatura en el campo de batalla.\\nEl Acto blasfemo hace 13 puntos de daño a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los lugares sagrados ya no son un santuario contra la muerte, y la muerte ya no es un santuario contra nada". —Thalia, caballero cátaro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'502c59e2-b93b-4b71-8c0e-c49df9e73d55\', \'multiverseId\': 423194}, \'multiverseid\': 423194}, {\'name\': \'Acte blasphématoire\', \'text\': "L\'Acte blasphématoire coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature sur le champ de bataille.\\nL\'Acte blasphématoire inflige 13 blessures à chaque créature.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Les lieux sacrés ne sont plus un sanctuaire contre la mort, et la mort n\'est plus un sanctuaire du tout. » —Thalia, chevalière cathare", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421790&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c725da26-f943-45fb-b6f9-822fe5040415\', \'multiverseId\': 421790}, \'multiverseid\': 421790}, {\'name\': \'Atto Blasfemo\', \'text\': "L\'Atto Blasfemo costa {1} in meno per essere lanciato per ogni creatura sul campo di battaglia.\\nL\'Atto Blasfemo infligge 13 danni a ogni creatura.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"I luoghi sacri non offrono più rifugio dalla morte e la morte non offre più rifugio da nulla." —Thalia, Cavaliera Catara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b343cc82-4c1e-4ec7-b573-8a4ab07f9b03\', \'multiverseId\': 422141}, \'multiverseid\': 422141}, {\'name\': \'冒涜の行動\', \'text\': \'冒涜の行動を唱えるためのコストは、戦場にあるクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\n冒涜の行動は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ13点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「聖なる地は、すでに死からの安住の地ではありません。そして死は、すでにあらゆるものにとっての安住の地ではありません。」 ――聖戦騎士サリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32c62c4d-9801-407a-a2ad-2c787319e6da\', \'multiverseId\': 422492}, \'multiverseid\': 422492}, {\'name\': \'Ato Blasfemo\', \'text\': \'Ato Blasfemo custa {1} a menos para ser conjurado para cada criatura no campo de batalha.\\nAto Blasfemo causa 13 pontos de dano a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Os lugares sagrados não são mais refúgios contra a morte, e a morte não é mais refúgio contra nada." — Thalia, Cátara Cavaleira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56aa29a2-6872-4a23-a34b-3a6204d9163b\', \'multiverseId\': 422843}, \'multiverseid\': 422843}, {\'name\': \'渎神行径\', \'text\': \'战场上每有一个生物，渎神行径便减少{1}来施放。\\n渎神行径对每个生物各造成13点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「圣地不再免于死亡沾惹，死亡也不再免于任何沾惹。」 ～护教军骑士莎利雅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e71e8e3-fb98-4d01-9c77-9d0eb089904b\', \'multiverseId\': 421088}, \'multiverseid\': 421088}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blinder Gehorsam\', \'text\': \'Abnötigen (Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du {W/B} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte dazu.)\\nArtefakte und Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, kommen getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn deine Knie erst deine Robe verschlissen haben, beginnst du vielleicht zu begreifen, wo dein Platz ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421378&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f05c25b-85c7-487f-8d29-5f0a74212a16\', \'multiverseId\': 421378}, \'multiverseid\': 421378}, {\'name\': \'Obediencia ciega\', \'text\': \'Extorsionar. (Siempre que lances un hechizo, puedes pagar {W/B}. Si lo haces, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas esa cantidad de vidas.)\\nLos artefactos y criaturas que controlan tus oponentes entran al campo de batalla girados.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Para cuando hayas desgastado la túnica con las rodillas, quizá hayas empezado a entender cuál es tu sitio".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f71bf8e-9663-4dd6-9ead-35b3edc13fd6\', \'multiverseId\': 423133}, \'multiverseid\': 423133}, {\'name\': \'Obéissance aveugle\', \'text\': \'Extorsion (À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, vous pouvez payer {W/B}. Si vous faites ainsi, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez autant de points de vie.)\\nLes artefacts et les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand tes genoux auront fini par trouer ta robe, tu auras peut-être commencé à apprendre quel est ton rang. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421729&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5bc84d8-d041-41fe-93a4-d55c1b9c6c0b\', \'multiverseId\': 421729}, \'multiverseid\': 421729}, {\'name\': \'Cieca Obbedienza\', \'text\': \'Estorsione (Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia, puoi pagare {W/B}. Se lo fai, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni altrettanti punti vita.)\\nGli artefatti e le creature controllati dai tuoi avversari entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando avrai consumato la tunica a forza di inginocchiarti, avrai imparato qual è il tuo posto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1109007-7e70-43fc-a99d-462442aeb6ec\', \'multiverseId\': 422080}, \'multiverseid\': 422080}, {\'name\': \'盲従\', \'text\': \'強請（あなたが呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたは{W/B}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\\n対戦相手がコントロールするアーティファクトとクリーチャーはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「法衣の膝が抜けるぐらいになってようやく、おのれの卑小さを自覚しはじめると言えよう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32707358-c75e-4232-9dd3-c856b23dc2cb\', \'multiverseId\': 422431}, \'multiverseid\': 422431}, {\'name\': \'Obediência Cega\', \'text\': \'Extorquir (Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica, poderá pagar {W/B}. Se fizer isso, cada oponente perderá 1 ponto de vida e você ganhará uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\\nOs artefatos e as criaturas que seus oponentes controlam entram no campo de batalha virados.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando seus joelhos tiverem rasgado seu manto, talvez você terá aprendido qual é o seu lugar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8260d061-8ab0-4b03-ab08-92dafc2f328e\', \'multiverseId\': 422782}, \'multiverseid\': 422782}, {\'name\': \'盲目服从\', \'text\': \'敲诈（每当你施放咒语时，你可以支付{W/B}。若你如此作，则每位对手各失去1点生命，且你获得等量的生命。）\\n由对手操控的神器与生物须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「跪到长袍磨破时，你就会明白自己的地位到哪里。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f82aef8a-0bf4-4f07-896e-2f8aa313c548\', \'multiverseId\': 421027}, \'multiverseid\': 421027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blinkmottenurne\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn der Hauptphase vor dem Kampf jedes Spielers und falls die Blinkmottenurne ungetappt ist, erhöht dieser Spieler seinen Manavorrat um {C} für jedes Artefakt, das er kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Vedalken bauen solche Urnen gerne in ihre lebenden Artefaktkreationen ein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421563&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d8ab6f2-bc54-4f94-b818-8d7b93b6713b\', \'multiverseId\': 421563}, \'multiverseid\': 421563}, {\'name\': \'Urna de polillas titilantes\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de la fase principal precombate de cada jugador, si la Urna de polillas titilantes está enderezada, ese jugador agrega {C} a su reserva de maná por cada artefacto que controla.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los vedalken incrustan estas urnas en sus artefactos vivientes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f4f91fc-097c-41ed-8575-73760cd319cd\', \'multiverseId\': 423318}, \'multiverseid\': 423318}, {\'name\': \'Urne à scintimite\', \'text\': "Au début de la première phase principale de chaque joueur, si l\'Urne à scintimite est dégagée, ce joueur ajoute {C} à sa réserve pour chaque artefact qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les vedalkens scellent ces urnes dans tous les artefacts vivants qu\'ils fabriquent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421914&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8080bc53-39bc-4a06-a6d7-99d7b34447ca\', \'multiverseId\': 421914}, \'multiverseid\': 421914}, {\'name\': \'Urna di Lampidotteri\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della fase principale pre-combattimento di ogni giocatore, se l\'Urna di Lampidotteri è STAPpata, quel giocatore aggiunge {C} alla sua riserva di mana per ogni artefatto che controlla.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I vedalken incastonano queste urne in tutti gli artefatti viventi che creano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65e6fb39-faa5-45f4-8450-d2c22947c112\', \'multiverseId\': 422265}, \'multiverseid\': 422265}, {\'name\': \'ちらつき蛾の甕\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーの戦闘前メイン・フェイズの開始時に、ちらつき蛾の甕がアンタップ状態である場合、そのプレイヤーは自分のマナ・プールに、自分がコントロールするアーティファクト１つにつき{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ヴィダルケンは、この手の甕を生命を持つアーティファクトの中に埋め込んでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd8389ce-c3d2-49ec-86ee-a45473e98870\', \'multiverseId\': 422616}, \'multiverseid\': 422616}, {\'name\': \'Urna de Mosco-lumes\', \'text\': \'No início da fase principal pré-combate de cada jogador, se Urna de Mosco-lumes estiver desvirada, aquele jogador adiciona {C} à sua própria reserva de mana para cada artefato que ele próprio controla.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os vedalkeanos incrustam tais urnas nos artefatos vivos que criam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e4eef28-b618-4310-aca4-3d7af4a048d0\', \'multiverseId\': 422967}, \'multiverseid\': 422967}, {\'name\': \'光蛾壶\', \'text\': \'在每位牌手战斗前的行动阶段开始时，若光蛾壶未横置，则该牌手每操控一个神器，便加{C}到其法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'维多肯族将这类壶嵌入所创作的可动神器中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c7e6ce0-4913-4656-a072-6d4f34e541c1\', \'multiverseId\': 421212}, \'multiverseid\': 421212}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bluttyrann\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments verliert jeder Spieler 1 Lebenspunkt. Lege für jeden auf diese Weise verlorenen Lebenspunkt eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Bluttyrannen.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler die Partie verliert, lege fünf +1/+1-Marken auf den Bluttyrannen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421502&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b936ee24-eebb-446d-8ac7-3c833c303c64\', \'multiverseId\': 421502}, \'multiverseid\': 421502}, {\'name\': \'Tirano sangriento\', \'text\': \'Vuela, arrolla.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, cada jugador pierde 1 vida. Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Tirano sangriento por cada vida perdida de esta manera.\\nSiempre que un jugador pierda el juego, pon cinco contadores +1/+1 sobre el Tirano sangriento.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c0ff11a-0a96-449f-92bc-08a9bd379561\', \'multiverseId\': 423257}, \'multiverseid\': 423257}, {\'name\': \'Tyran de sang\', \'text\': "Vol, piétinement\\nAu début de votre entretien, chaque joueur perd 1 point de vie. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Tyran de sang pour chaque 1 point de vie perdu de cette manière.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur perd la partie, mettez cinq marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Tyran de sang.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421853&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c844d28e-663b-4feb-ba30-2650546359fd\', \'multiverseId\': 421853}, \'multiverseid\': 421853}, {\'name\': \'Tiranno Sanguinario\', \'text\': "Volare, travolgere\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, ogni giocatore perde 1 punto vita. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Tiranno Sanguinario per ogni punto vita perso in questo modo.\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore perde la partita, metti cinque segnalini +1/+1 sul Tiranno Sanguinario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c3106f4-79ef-4f14-9e13-7b1bdecc11b4\', \'multiverseId\': 422204}, \'multiverseid\': 422204}, {\'name\': \'血の暴君\', \'text\': \'飛行、トランプル\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。これにより失われたライフ１点につき、血の暴君の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\nプレイヤーが１人ゲームに敗北するたび、血の暴君の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを５個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7be92f68-e00d-44fd-9094-daf43678bba9\', \'multiverseId\': 422555}, \'multiverseid\': 422555}, {\'name\': \'Tirano do Sangue\', \'text\': \'Voar, atropelar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, cada jogador perde 1 ponto de vida. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Tirano do Sangue para cada 1 ponto de vida perdido desta maneira.\\nToda vez que um jogador perder o jogo, coloque cinco marcadores +1/+1 em Tirano do Sangue.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a66727d-b988-42ec-b02c-a80026a00730\', \'multiverseId\': 422906}, \'multiverseid\': 422906}, {\'name\': \'嗜血暴君\', \'text\': \'飞行，践踏\\n在你的维持开始时，每位牌手各失去1点生命。每以此法失去1点生命，便在嗜血暴君上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当一位牌手输掉这盘游戏时，在嗜血暴君上放置五个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89a35d48-2e25-4ba0-9131-f9b1b134bf84\', \'multiverseId\': 421151}, \'multiverseid\': 421151}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutzopf-Elf\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nKaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke so lange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Karte ins Exil schickst, die kein Land ist und die weniger kostet als dieser Zauberspruch. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Berserker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421503&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afe9946b-32a0-4637-956a-ac1fd2f29ea7\', \'multiverseId\': 421503}, \'multiverseid\': 421503}, {\'name\': \'Elfo trenzas sangrientas\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nCascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3107f293-6a16-46c1-8739-49efc88ac496\', \'multiverseId\': 423258}, \'multiverseid\': 423258}, {\'name\': \'Elfe aux Nattes sanguinolentes\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nCascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et berserker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421854&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24251da6-447b-481e-8720-42691b9012e5\', \'multiverseId\': 421854}, \'multiverseid\': 421854}, {\'name\': \'Elfa dalle Trecce Rosse\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nCascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2676e09-ea04-4fcb-a368-7d358da87bc0\', \'multiverseId\': 422205}, \'multiverseid\': 422205}, {\'name\': \'血編み髪のエルフ\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n続唱（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低い土地でないカードが追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ追放する。あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。追放したカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e8d76fe-8555-41ee-a34d-ade499351d0c\', \'multiverseId\': 422556}, \'multiverseid\': 422556}, {\'name\': \'Elfo Tranças-de-sangue\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nCascata (Quando conjurar esta mágica, exile os cards do topo do seu grimório até exilar um que não seja terreno e que tenha custo inferior. Você pode conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque os cards exilados no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Amoque\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'341e9e71-a808-4eab-bdca-7c004a46e8e9\', \'multiverseId\': 422907}, \'multiverseid\': 422907}, {\'name\': \'血辫妖精\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n倾曳（当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比此咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'生物～妖精／狂战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d81248e4-ebf2-46b4-8165-75a96b5778b1\', \'multiverseId\': 421152}, \'multiverseid\': 421152}]', "[{'name': 'Blütenmauer', 'text': 'Verteidiger\\nWenn die Blütenmauer ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Pflanze, Mauer', 'flavor': 'Jede Blüte war identisch, jeder Zweig, jedes Blatt fast störend exakt gleich.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421494&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1224bade-3878-490f-ac4f-ac9d1898d57f', 'multiverseId': 421494}, 'multiverseid': 421494}, {'name': 'Muro de flores', 'text': 'Defensor.\\nCuando el Muro de flores entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura — Muro planta', 'flavor': 'Cada flor, idéntica; cada hoja y pétalo, perturbadoramente exactos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423249&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a29639b6-e935-4d0d-920a-4335547a14d4', 'multiverseId': 423249}, 'multiverseid': 423249}, {'name': 'Mur de fleurs', 'text': 'Défenseur\\nQuand le Mur de fleurs arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Créature : plante et mur', 'flavor': 'Les fleurs sont toutes identiques, avec une troublante exactitude. Chaque feuille, chaque pétale !', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421845&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9adedbbb-2721-4ef9-ae4e-0e907bcb7448', 'multiverseId': 421845}, 'multiverseid': 421845}, {'name': 'Muro di Bocciuoli', 'text': 'Difensore\\nQuando il Muro di Bocciuoli entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura — Muro Pianta', 'flavor': 'Ogni fiore identico a se stesso, ogni foglia e petalo uguali in modo inquietante.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422196&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68cc15a9-1dd3-409d-9584-1aca3147b270', 'multiverseId': 422196}, 'multiverseid': 422196}, {'name': '花の壁', 'text': '防衛\\n花の壁が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 植物・壁', 'flavor': '花の一つ一つが全く同じだ。葉の一枚一枚、花びらの一枚一枚が、気味悪いほど同じなのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422547&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07755f1f-1d7d-4e82-aebd-ae834f7f8fe5', 'multiverseId': 422547}, 'multiverseid': 422547}, {'name': 'Barreira de Flores', 'text': 'Defensor\\nQuando Barreira de Flores entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.', 'type': 'Criatura — Planta Barreira', 'flavor': 'Cada flor, idêntica; cada folha e pétala, perturbadoramente exatas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422898&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '004cd602-b3eb-43ab-9f64-6530110cca61', 'multiverseId': 422898}, 'multiverseid': 422898}, {'name': '花丛之墙', 'text': '守军\\n当花丛之墙进战场时，抓一张牌。', 'type': '生物～植物／墙', 'flavor': '每枝花，每片叶和每朵瓣都精确地相同。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421143&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfb5dbaa-c921-430a-92d0-43872eafbbcc', 'multiverseId': 421143}, 'multiverseid': 421143}]", '[{\'name\': \'Boros-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Das Boros-Amulett fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421504&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97c90d8d-83df-4a7a-b80c-1a88cee7841a\', \'multiverseId\': 421504}, \'multiverseid\': 421504}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto boros\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• El Amuleto boros hace 4 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo.\\n• Los permanentes que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\n• La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29db2566-16e5-4e3f-86c7-0c102aa7d5f9\', \'multiverseId\': 423259}, \'multiverseid\': 423259}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Boros\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Le Charme de Boros inflige 4 blessures au joueur ciblé.\\n• Les permanents que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• La créature ciblée acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f9fecc5-6d9e-41b9-9b96-bb0a118aeb14\', \'multiverseId\': 421855}, \'multiverseid\': 421855}, {\'name\': \'Talismano Boros\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Il Talismano Boros infligge 4 danni a un giocatore bersaglio.\\n• I permanenti che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf78df9e-9210-4373-b944-2baee4fb056e\', \'multiverseId\': 422206}, \'multiverseid\': 422206}, {\'name\': \'ボロスの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とする。ボロスの魔除けはそのプレイヤーに４点のダメージを与える。\\n• ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするパーマネントは破壊不能を得る。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce2031f8-f43a-498a-97fa-ac73182561db\', \'multiverseId\': 422557}, \'multiverseid\': 422557}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto Boros\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Amuleto Boros causa 4 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo.\\n• As permanentes que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\\n• A criatura alvo ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43beb715-d3ea-4676-a835-57f97edf3006\', \'multiverseId\': 422908}, \'multiverseid\': 422908}, {\'name\': \'波洛斯护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•波洛斯护符对目标牌手造成4点伤害。\\n•由你操控的永久物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\\n•目标生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c3d292b-a8be-4974-9662-83a0ac20629b\', \'multiverseId\': 421153}, \'multiverseid\': 421153}]', "[{'name': 'Boros-Garnison', 'text': 'Die Boros-Garnison kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Boros-Garnison ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421602&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'adfcdc15-5732-49e9-8153-ee43314712dc', 'multiverseId': 421602}, 'multiverseid': 421602}, {'name': 'Fuerte boros', 'text': 'El Fuerte boros entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Fuerte boros entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}{W} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423357&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a25ad29f-f8f9-4958-96cf-b5a30868b707', 'multiverseId': 423357}, 'multiverseid': 423357}, {'name': 'Garnison de Boros', 'text': 'La Garnison de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Garnison de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}{W} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421953&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '609f28ba-07b8-4f77-9599-85dfdb536b43', 'multiverseId': 421953}, 'multiverseid': 421953}, {'name': 'Presidio Boros', 'text': 'Il Presidio Boros entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Presidio Boros entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}{W} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422304&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13cb87df-c545-4fa4-b298-c8c01acbe26b', 'multiverseId': 422304}, 'multiverseid': 422304}, {'name': 'ボロスの駐屯地', 'text': 'ボロスの駐屯地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボロスの駐屯地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールする土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422655&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c223a7b-41ac-4521-a99b-8914d4a56bc2', 'multiverseId': 422655}, 'multiverseid': 422655}, {'name': 'Guarnição Boros', 'text': 'Guarnição Boros entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Guarnição Boros entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controle para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}{W} à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423006&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e6e3b2f-e706-4269-9f6a-e3dff60745ad', 'multiverseId': 423006}, 'multiverseid': 423006}, {'name': '波洛斯驻防地', 'text': '波洛斯驻防地须横置进战场。\\n当波洛斯驻防地进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{R}{W}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421251&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77bb9e23-c039-41ae-a3f3-8c684e81f78f', 'multiverseId': 421251}, 'multiverseid': 421251}]", '[{\'name\': \'Breya, Ätheriumformerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn Breya, Ätheriumformerin, ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 blaue Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{2}, opfere zwei Artefakte: Bestimme eines —\\n• Breya fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -4/-4 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Du erhältst 5 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Mensch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421348&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1cb33b6-aa80-42e3-ba57-ba425af92f74\', \'multiverseId\': 421348}, \'multiverseid\': 421348}, {\'name\': \'Breya, modeladora de eterium\', \'text\': \'Cuando Breya, modeladora de eterium entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Tóptero azules 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\n{2}, sacrificar dos artefactos: Elige uno:\\n• Breya hace 3 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo.\\n• La criatura objetivo obtiene -4/-4 hasta el final del turno.\\n• Ganas 5 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fb4d24d-72f1-4448-bf31-8b13995ab73c\', \'multiverseId\': 423103}, \'multiverseid\': 423103}, {\'name\': "Breya, forgeuse d\'étherium", \'text\': "Quand Breya, forgeuse d\'étherium arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 bleue Mécanoptère avec le vol.\\n{2}, sacrifiez deux artefacts : Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Breya inflige 3 blessures au joueur ciblé.\\n• La créature ciblée gagne -4/-4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Vous gagnez 5 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : humain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421699&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14773ce4-89f1-4796-a102-a9f781b77148\', \'multiverseId\': 421699}, \'multiverseid\': 421699}, {\'name\': \'Breya, Plasmatrice di Eterium\', \'text\': \'Quando Breya, Plasmatrice di Eterium entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 blu con volare.\\n{2}, Sacrifica due artefatti: Scegli uno —\\n• Breya infligge 3 danni a un giocatore bersaglio.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio prende -4/-4 fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Guadagni 5 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e5fc124-2d78-4a38-8209-f088c80baa6d\', \'multiverseId\': 422050}, \'multiverseid\': 422050}, {\'name\': \'エーテリウム造物師、ブレイヤ\', \'text\': \'エーテリウム造物師、ブレイヤが戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ青の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\\n{2}, アーティファクト２つを生け贄に捧げる：以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とする。エーテリウム造物師、ブレイヤはそのプレイヤーに３点のダメージを与える。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－４/－４の修整を受ける。\\n• あなたは５点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — 人間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2778d811-4d19-446f-b5a8-fcc78ef84bc0\', \'multiverseId\': 422401}, \'multiverseid\': 422401}, {\'name\': \'Breya, Moldadora de Etherium\', \'text\': \'Quando Breya, Moldadora de Etherium, entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura artefato azul 1/1 do tipo Tóptero com voar.\\n{2}, Sacrifique dois artefatos: Escolha um —\\n• Breya causa 3 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo.\\n• A criatura alvo recebe -4/-4 até o final do turno.\\n• Você ganha 5 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato Lendária — Humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a202e55-462f-4621-88c4-bf24ed3186ed\', \'multiverseId\': 422752}, \'multiverseid\': 422752}, {\'name\': \'乙金塑师布莱娅\', \'text\': \'当乙金塑师布莱娅进战场时，派出两个1/1蓝色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。\\n{2}，牺牲两个神器：选择一项～\\n•布莱娅对目标牌手造成3点伤害。\\n•目标生物得-4/-4直到回合结束。\\n•你获得5点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物～人类\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'732fca33-887a-4110-8099-aeffb5464f85\', \'multiverseId\': 420997}, \'multiverseid\': 420997}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bruse Tarl, ungehobelter Hirte\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Bruse Tarl, ungehobelter Hirte, ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, Doppelschlag und Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nPartner (Du kannst zwei Kommandeure haben, falls beide Partner haben.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421349&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ff0a03-6113-4eb0-99b5-e804fb687f66\', \'multiverseId\': 421349}, \'multiverseid\': 421349}, {\'name\': \'Bruse Tarl, pastor tosco\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Bruse Tarl, pastor tosco entre al campo de batalla o ataque, la criatura objetivo que controlas gana las habilidades de dañar dos veces y vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\\nCamarada. (Puedes tener dos comandantes si ambos tienen camarada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Humano aliado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d42e37a-0112-43da-9532-7e01d716925d\', \'multiverseId\': 423104}, \'multiverseid\': 423104}, {\'name\': \'Bruse Tarl, berger rustre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Bruse Tarl, berger rustre arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez acquiert la double initiative et le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPartenariat (Vous pouvez avoir deux commandants si les deux ont le partenariat.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et allié\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421700&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56e61eab-e2fa-4070-b6e1-978bbe7a8abf\', \'multiverseId\': 421700}, \'multiverseid\': 421700}, {\'name\': \'Bruse Tarl, Mandriano Selvaggio\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Bruse Tarl, Mandriano Selvaggio entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, una creatura bersaglio che controlli ha doppio attacco e legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.\\nPartner (Puoi avere due comandanti se entrambi hanno partner.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Alleato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bbd8ab5-bba0-4368-95fc-bd53aa92e832\', \'multiverseId\': 422051}, \'multiverseid\': 422051}, {\'name\': \'粗野な牧人、ブルース・タール\', \'text\': \'粗野な牧人、ブルース・タールが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃と絆魂を得る。\\n共闘（両方が共闘を持つなら、あなたは２体の統率者を使用できる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・同盟者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad3ce0a0-c161-4f6a-beab-74d1a34c80b5\', \'multiverseId\': 422402}, \'multiverseid\': 422402}, {\'name\': \'Bruse Tarl, Pastor Rústico\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Bruse Tarl, Pastor Rústico, entra no campo de batalha ou ataca, a criatura alvo que você controla ganha golpe duplo e vínculo com a vida até o final do turno.\\nParceiro (Você pode ter dois comandantes se ambos tiverem parceiro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Aliado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f8d8bb1-ef19-4f1e-bae1-73a23fc708ff\', \'multiverseId\': 422753}, \'multiverseid\': 422753}, {\'name\': \'粗鲁牧人布斯陶\', \'text\': \'每当粗鲁牧人布斯陶进战场或攻击时，目标由你操控的生物获得连击与系命异能直到回合结束。\\n拍档（你可将两个具有拍档异能的生物共同用作指挥官。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～人类／伙伴\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2262f640-a235-48e6-bf99-c5b8c66b62e2\', \'multiverseId\': 420998}, \'multiverseid\': 420998}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutaler Hordenhäuptling\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, angreift, verliert der verteidigende Spieler 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{3}{R/W}{R/W}: Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, blocken in diesem Zug, falls möglich, und du bestimmst, wie diese Kreaturen blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ork, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421427&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7c37ad4-0c57-4b75-ae47-4787877e5b54\', \'multiverseId\': 421427}, \'multiverseid\': 421427}, {\'name\': \'Jefe de hordas brutal\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque, el jugador defensor pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\\n{3}{R/W}{R/W}: Las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes bloquean este turno si pueden. Tú eliges cómo bloquean.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'222546d0-d48a-434b-8dd7-ed83a2586ef8\', \'multiverseId\': 423182}, \'multiverseid\': 423182}, {\'name\': \'Chef de horde brutal\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque, le joueur défenseur perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{3}{R/W}{R/W} : Les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent bloquent ce tour-ci si possible, et vous choisissez comment ces créatures bloquent.", \'type\': \'Créature : orque et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421778&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7a76496-9d5d-40e2-8eca-3b65e35a32df\', \'multiverseId\': 421778}, \'multiverseid\': 421778}, {\'name\': "Condottiero dell\'Orda Brutale", \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca, il giocatore in difesa perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{3}{R/W}{R/W}: Le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari bloccano in questo turno, se possono farlo, e tu scegli come bloccano quelle creature.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46e11131-b991-431a-9e3e-161d972ab917\', \'multiverseId\': 422129}, \'multiverseid\': 422129}, {\'name\': \'粗暴な軍族長\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーが１体攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{3}{R/W}{R/W}：このターン、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャーは、可能ならブロックする。それらのクリーチャーがどうブロックするかはあなたが選ぶ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーク・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9eed072-58e6-4760-b83b-d05683cefe75\', \'multiverseId\': 422480}, \'multiverseid\': 422480}, {\'name\': \'Chefe de Horda Brutal\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca, o jogador defensor perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{3}{R/W}{R/W}: As criaturas que seus oponentes controlam bloqueiam neste turno se estiverem aptas e você escolhe como elas bloquearão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Orc Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de727ee3-385d-443f-926f-262250cbc4c9\', \'multiverseId\': 422831}, \'multiverseid\': 422831}, {\'name\': \'野蛮部落长\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物攻击时，防御牌手失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\\n{3}{R/W}{R/W}：由对手操控的生物本回合若能进行阻挡，则须如此作，且由你选择它们如何阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～半兽人／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca35c65f-672b-491b-a864-61757d8836b7\', \'multiverseId\': 421076}, \'multiverseid\': 421076}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bund der Helden\', \'text\': \'Streben — Bund der Helden kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {1}{G} mehr.\\nBestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl. Verdopple die Anzahl an +1/+1-Marken auf jeder von ihnen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421487&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a54cae-4b92-47c6-806a-d52ecdc12478\', \'multiverseId\': 421487}, \'multiverseid\': 421487}, {\'name\': \'Solidaridad de los héroes\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar la Solidaridad de los héroes cuesta {1}{G} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nElige cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo. Duplica la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre cada una de ellas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea1094d0-ee98-430a-9d49-9d9374cc0b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 423242}, \'multiverseid\': 423242}, {\'name\': \'Solidarité des héros\', \'text\': "Obstination — La Solidarité des héros coûte {1}{G} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nChoisissez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées. Doublez le nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421838&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b8ae4bd-d81b-44fb-a192-5d186b4aad3d\', \'multiverseId\': 421838}, \'multiverseid\': 421838}, {\'name\': \'Solidarietà tra Eroi\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — La Solidarietà tra Eroi costa {1}{G} in più per essere lanciata per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Raddoppia il numero di segnalini +1/+1 su ciascuna di esse.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a0e0809-96be-4f36-9d5c-e35e407147e1\', \'multiverseId\': 422189}, \'multiverseid\': 422189}, {\'name\': \'英雄たちの結束\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 英雄たちの結束を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{1}{G}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。それらの上に置かれている＋１/＋１カウンターの数を２倍にする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86112871-e43e-47ae-9b8f-f18cb399ce4e\', \'multiverseId\': 422540}, \'multiverseid\': 422540}, {\'name\': \'Solidariedade dos Heróis\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Solidariedade dos Heróis custa {1}{G} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nEscolha qualquer número de criaturas alvo. Dobre o número de marcadores +1/+1 em cada uma delas.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f562f8f7-f614-47ea-8cb3-4fd54d7efce0\', \'multiverseId\': 422891}, \'multiverseid\': 422891}, {\'name\': \'英雄齐心\', \'text\': \'积力～英雄齐心在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{1}{G}来施放。\\n选择任意数量的目标生物。将这些生物上的+1/+1指示物数量加倍。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53ab9f56-1e9f-435d-ab91-24bb47ea6ca8\', \'multiverseId\': 421136}, \'multiverseid\': 421136}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion von Lammholt\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, deren Stärke kleiner ist als die des Champions von Lammholt, können Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, nicht blocken.\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Champion von Lammholt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421463&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f706b5c8-d492-47d0-9b9b-1ba13718522f\', \'multiverseId\': 421463}, \'multiverseid\': 421463}, {\'name\': \'Campeona de Lambholt\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas con fuerza menor a la fuerza de la Campeona de Lambholt no pueden bloquear a las criaturas que controlas.\\nSiempre que otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Campeona de Lambholt.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd8b0241-964b-41f3-81c0-f56696e65df2\', \'multiverseId\': 423218}, \'multiverseid\': 423218}, {\'name\': \'Championne de Lambholt\', \'text\': "Les créatures dont la force est inférieure à celle de la Championne de Lambholt ne peuvent pas bloquer les créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Championne de Lambholt.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421814&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5d5d493-6628-487b-b20a-ab59b0ae07d2\', \'multiverseId\': 421814}, \'multiverseid\': 421814}, {\'name\': \'Campionessa di Lambholt\', \'text\': "Le creature con forza inferiore a quella della Campionessa di Lambholt non possono bloccare le creature che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Campionessa di Lambholt.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'269a36b1-1122-4321-acba-e43feb7648ce\', \'multiverseId\': 422165}, \'multiverseid\': 422165}, {\'name\': \'ラムホルトの勇者\', \'text\': \'ラムホルトの勇者のパワーよりも小さいパワーを持つクリーチャーでは、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーをブロックできない。\\n他のクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ラムホルトの勇者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ce4aa3d-db1c-4bc0-b899-3d99e3410b85\', \'multiverseId\': 422516}, \'multiverseid\': 422516}, {\'name\': \'Campeão de Lambholt\', \'text\': \'As criaturas com poder menor que o de Campeão de Lambholt não podem bloquear as criaturas que você controla.\\nToda vez que outra criatura entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Campeão de Lambholt.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'251f6ec8-8945-4f89-ba75-d22d5159c180\', \'multiverseId\': 422867}, \'multiverseid\': 422867}, {\'name\': \'羊屯斗士\', \'text\': \'力量小于羊屯斗士的生物不能阻挡由你操控的生物。\\n每当另一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，在羊屯斗士上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17797b68-0c55-433f-89b8-9af40a9bbabb\', \'multiverseId\': 421112}, \'multiverseid\': 421112}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosschleife\', \'text\': \'Der Besitzer einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl mischt diese in seine Bibliothek und deckt dann die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine bleibende Karte ist, bringt er sie ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421441&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d90d25a-bc97-46d6-b8eb-e9c9215afec2\', \'multiverseId\': 421441}, \'multiverseid\': 421441}, {\'name\': \'Distorsión caótica\', \'text\': \'El propietario del permanente objetivo lo baraja en su biblioteca y luego muestra la primera carta de su biblioteca. Si es una carta de permanente, la pone en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cb08e58-46a4-4b07-af1e-0c5dccd51897\', \'multiverseId\': 423196}, \'multiverseid\': 423196}, {\'name\': \'Distorsion chaotique\', \'text\': "Le propriétaire du permanent ciblé le mélange à sa bibliothèque et révèle ensuite la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de permanent, il la met sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421792&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e66f5ce6-ef80-4d66-8f1a-e826bba623ee\', \'multiverseId\': 421792}, \'multiverseid\': 421792}, {\'name\': \'Distorsione Caotica\', \'text\': \'Il proprietario di un permanente bersaglio lo rimescola nel suo grimorio, poi rivela la prima carta del suo grimorio. Se è una carta permanente, la mette sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38344b1b-d128-4244-942f-8adf5cf04e60\', \'multiverseId\': 422143}, \'multiverseid\': 422143}, {\'name\': \'混沌のねじれ\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それのオーナーはそれを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直し、その後自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。それがパーマネント・カードであるなら、そのプレイヤーはそれを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97f0d440-9296-47fb-8f19-7b28107b0abe\', \'multiverseId\': 422494}, \'multiverseid\': 422494}, {\'name\': \'Distorção Caótica\', \'text\': \'O dono da permanente alvo a embaralha no próprio grimório e depois revela o card do topo do grimório. Se for um card de permanente, ele pode colocá-lo no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57030332-d888-4053-a46f-7f63f9713180\', \'multiverseId\': 422845}, \'multiverseid\': 422845}, {\'name\': \'混沌歪曲\', \'text\': \'目标永久物的拥有者将它洗回牌库，然后展示其牌库顶牌。如果该牌为永久物牌，则该牌手将之放进战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e59feb83-724b-41f8-a101-f11f17c91518\', \'multiverseId\': 421090}, \'multiverseid\': 421090}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromatische Laterne\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontollierst, haben „{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Dimir-Magier setzen die Lampen geschickt ein — aus dem ungewohnten Mana erschaffen sie Gestaltwandler und Schläfer-Agenten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421566&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ff90ff0-e2cc-4791-b01f-2c4f75b7567f\', \'multiverseId\': 421566}, \'multiverseid\': 421566}, {\'name\': \'Linterna cromática\', \'text\': \'Las tierras que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná".\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los magos dimir hicieron buen uso de las linternas, creando metamorfos y agentes durmientes a partir de un maná que les era extraño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63af2986-f70f-4ccb-8a38-3c2533568cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 423321}, \'multiverseid\': 423321}, {\'name\': \'Lanterne chromatique\', \'text\': \'Les terrains que vous contrôlez ont : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve. »\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les mages dimirs tirent parti des lanternes, créant des changeformes et des agents en sommeil à partir de mana dont ils ignorent tout.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421917&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aac3eec0-a773-44f9-91fc-aea39a9f2a81\', \'multiverseId\': 421917}, \'multiverseid\': 421917}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromatica\', \'text\': \'Le terre che controlli hanno "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana".\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I maghi Dimir fanno buon uso delle lanterne, creando mutaforma e agenti infiltrati partendo da mana a loro estraneo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d3c93e6-710d-4983-9a7c-259a65e64058\', \'multiverseId\': 422268}, \'multiverseid\': 422268}, {\'name\': \'彩色の灯籠\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする土地は「{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ディミーアの魔道士は灯籠をうまく使い、異質のマナから多相の戦士や潜伏工作員を生み出している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b90b64e-eafb-4a48-b9c5-dd2f7a926535\', \'multiverseId\': 422619}, \'multiverseid\': 422619}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromática\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos que você controla têm: "{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana."\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os magos Dimir fazem bom uso das lanternas, criando metamorfos e agentes adormecidos com tipos de mana diferentes dos deles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b486b2b-2e80-4bcd-b739-ac78aad34ba9\', \'multiverseId\': 422970}, \'multiverseid\': 422970}, {\'name\': \'五彩宫灯\', \'text\': \'由你操控的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。」\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'底密尔法师充分利用宫灯，从他们不熟悉的法术力当中制造出变形兽和潜藏密探。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7f64cee-757f-40a6-bed3-a179b70f72c5\', \'multiverseId\': 421215}, \'multiverseid\': 421215}]', '[{\'name\': \'Clan-Widerstand\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines oder mehrere —\\n• Der Clan-Widerstand fügt einer fliegenden Kreatur deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Der Clan-Widerstand fügt einer nichtfliegenden Kreatur deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Der Clan-Widerstand fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421506&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56704fa3-dbf0-41d3-b224-9a220e1fd324\', \'multiverseId\': 421506}, \'multiverseid\': 421506}, {\'name\': \'Rebelión de los clanes\', \'text\': \'Elige uno o más:\\n• La Rebelión de los clanes hace X puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.\\n• La Rebelión de los clanes hace X puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo sin la habilidad de volar.\\n• La Rebelión de los clanes hace X puntos de daño al jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0b551aa-1f81-48ce-891f-d961427b58f6\', \'multiverseId\': 423261}, \'multiverseid\': 423261}, {\'name\': \'Défiance du clan\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un ou plus —\\n• La Défiance du clan inflige X blessures à une créature avec le vol ciblée.\\n• La Défiance du clan inflige X blessures à une créature sans le vol ciblée.\\n• La Défiance du clan inflige X blessures à un joueur ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421857&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a70cdce2-dd99-4309-99a2-d3df54ae5704\', \'multiverseId\': 421857}, \'multiverseid\': 421857}, {\'name\': \'Provocazione del Clan\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno o più —\\n• La Provocazione del Clan infligge X danni a una creatura bersaglio con volare.\\n• La Provocazione del Clan infligge X danni a una creatura bersaglio senza volare.\\n• La Provocazione del Clan infligge X danni a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d58a2df-6c23-41b1-8484-23ef868bc776\', \'multiverseId\': 422208}, \'multiverseid\': 422208}, {\'name\': \'一族の誇示\', \'text\': \'以下から１つ以上を選ぶ。\\n• 飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とする。一族の誇示はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n• 飛行を持たないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。一族の誇示はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とする。一族の誇示はそのプレイヤーにＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1f4bb95-4058-4e71-a5a3-6008a4f36066\', \'multiverseId\': 422559}, \'multiverseid\': 422559}, {\'name\': \'Desafio do Clã\', \'text\': \'Escolha um ou mais —\\n• Desafio do Clã causa X pontos de dano à criatura alvo com voar.\\n• Desafio do Clã causa X pontos de dano à criatura alvo sem voar.\\n• Desafio do Clã causa X pontos de dano ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ea6043f-f593-4e0e-8d08-51aca8ab4273\', \'multiverseId\': 422910}, \'multiverseid\': 422910}, {\'name\': \'部族反抗\', \'text\': \'选择一项或多项～\\n•部族反抗对目标具飞行异能的生物造成X点伤害。\\n•部族反抗对目标不具飞行异能的生物造成X点伤害。\\n•部族反抗对目标牌手造成X点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'230b8476-2ca6-4400-90eb-da45756013d1\', \'multiverseId\': 421155}, \'multiverseid\': 421155}]', '[{\'name\': \'Custodi-Seelenbinder\', \'text\': \'Die Custodi-Seelenbinder kommen mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wobei X gleich der Anzahl der anderen Kreaturen im Spiel ist.\\n{2}{W}, entferne eine +1/+1-Marke von den Custodi-Seelenbindern: Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421382&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b83feb70-29e2-465e-8886-94ea4b800525\', \'multiverseId\': 421382}, \'multiverseid\': 421382}, {\'name\': \'Custodi apresaalmas\', \'text\': \'Los Custodi apresaalmas entran al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ellos, donde X es la cantidad de otras criaturas en el campo de batalla.\\n{2}{W}, remover un contador +1/+1 de los Custodi apresaalmas: Crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4d253cb-2b7b-40b5-874f-3774e77fa20b\', \'multiverseId\': 423137}, \'multiverseid\': 423137}, {\'name\': "Lieurs d\'âme des Custodi", \'text\': "Les Lieurs d\'âme des Custodi arrivent sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur eux, X étant le nombre d\'autres créatures sur le champ de bataille.\\n{2}{W}, retirez un marqueur +1/+1 des Lieurs d\'âme des Custodi : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421733&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d68a7567-e648-419e-af00-f3fcbbd5ca0b\', \'multiverseId\': 421733}, \'multiverseid\': 421733}, {\'name\': \'Custodi Soggiogaspiriti\', \'text\': \'I Custodi Soggiogaspiriti entrano nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1, dove X è il numero delle altre creature sul campo di battaglia.\\n{2}{W}, Rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dai Custodi Soggiogaspiriti: Crea una pedina creatura Spirito 1/1 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78861ba6-cc22-4805-8b02-9f4099f38961\', \'multiverseId\': 422084}, \'multiverseid\': 422084}, {\'name\': \'カストーディの霊魂縛り\', \'text\': \'カストーディの霊魂縛りは、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘは戦場に出ている他のクリーチャーの総数に等しい。\\n{2}{W}, カストーディの霊魂縛りの上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く：飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d08e1dde-349d-4f67-82b2-57740d5da1bb\', \'multiverseId\': 422435}, \'multiverseid\': 422435}, {\'name\': \'Custodi Aprisionadores de Almas\', \'text\': \'Custodi Aprisionadores de Almas entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1, sendo X o número de outras criaturas no campo de batalha.\\n{2}{W}, Remova um marcador +1/+1 de Custodi Aprisionadores de Almas: Crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Espírito com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6e59ea5-3fc6-44c4-920c-ccf1991cce54\', \'multiverseId\': 422786}, \'multiverseid\': 422786}, {\'name\': \'缚灵柩护\', \'text\': \'缚灵柩护进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物，X为战场上其他生物的数量。\\n{2}{W}，从缚灵柩护上移去一个+1/+1指示物：派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de6221de-71d3-487b-8948-74e4fdc25148\', \'multiverseId\': 421031}, \'multiverseid\': 421031}]', '[{\'name\': \'Daretti der Schrottkundige\', \'text\': \'+2: Wirf bis zu zwei Karten ab und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten.\\n−2: Opfere ein Artefakt. Falls du dies tust, bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\n−10: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Immer wenn ein Artefakt aus dem Spiel auf deinen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe seine Karte zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Spiel zurück."\\nDaretti der Schrottkundige kann dein Kommandeur sein.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421442&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60c34ae2-d89d-42ab-8676-a116a7d1d97f\', \'multiverseId\': 421442}, \'multiverseid\': 421442}, {\'name\': \'Daretti, sabio de la chatarra\', \'text\': \'+2: Descarta hasta dos cartas, luego roba esa misma cantidad de cartas.\\n−2: Sacrifica un artefacto. Si lo haces, regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\n−10: Obtienes un emblema con "Siempre que un artefacto vaya a tu cementerio desde el campo de batalla, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla al comienzo del próximo paso final".\\nDaretti, sabio de la chatarra puede ser tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89fc3ad7-568e-455a-b394-3d6dd5cab69a\', \'multiverseId\': 423197}, \'multiverseid\': 423197}, {\'name\': \'Daretti, savant ferrailleur\', \'text\': "+2 : Défaussez-vous de jusqu\'à deux cartes, puis piochez autant de cartes.\\n−2 : Sacrifiez un artefact. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\\n−10 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « À chaque fois qu\'un artefact est mis dans votre cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille au début de la prochaine étape de fin. »\\nDaretti, savant ferrailleur peut être votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421793&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2a32e15-b24f-4001-8dc1-f3657b444e28\', \'multiverseId\': 421793}, \'multiverseid\': 421793}, {\'name\': \'Daretti, Esperto di Rottami\', \'text\': \'+2: Scarta fino a due carte, poi pesca altrettante carte.\\n-2: Sacrifica un artefatto. Se lo fai, rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n-10: Ottieni un emblema con "Ogniqualvolta un artefatto viene messo nel tuo cimitero dal campo di battaglia, rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia all\\\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale".\\nDaretti, Esperto di Rottami può essere il tuo comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0361219d-53a4-4658-8436-56281c066962\', \'multiverseId\': 422144}, \'multiverseid\': 422144}, {\'name\': \'屑鉄の学者、ダレッティ\', \'text\': \'+2：カード最大２枚を捨て、その後その枚数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n-2：あなたの墓地からアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、対象としたカードを戦場に戻す。\\n-10：あなたは「アーティファクトが１つ戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードを戦場に戻す。」を持つ紋章を得る。\\n屑鉄の学者、ダレッティは統率者として使用できる。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — ダレッティ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a8ab609-1e4f-46aa-b86d-c962d78d804f\', \'multiverseId\': 422495}, \'multiverseid\': 422495}, {\'name\': \'Daretti, Sábio da Sucata\', \'text\': \'+2: Descarte até dois cards e depois compre aquela quantidade de cards.\\n-2: Sacrifique um artefato. Se fizer isso, devolva o card de artefato alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\n-10: Você recebe um emblema com "Toda vez que um card de artefato for colocado em seu cemitério a partir do campo de batalha, devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha no início da próxima etapa final."\\nDaretti, Sábio da Sucata, pode ser seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Daretti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3626a0da-5bfb-483f-9ecc-8ce383ccc8ec\', \'multiverseId\': 422846}, \'multiverseid\': 422846}, {\'name\': \'拆解学究达雷迪\', \'text\': \'+2：弃至多两张牌，然后抓等量的牌。\\n−2：牺牲一个神器。如果你如此作，则将目标神器牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n−10：你获得具有「每当一个神器从战场进入你的坟墓场，在下一个结束步骤开始时，将该牌移回战场」的徽记。\\n拆解学究达雷迪可用作指挥官。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～达雷迪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81e6d1b7-7613-4ddd-baf3-7ff60736e225\', \'multiverseId\': 421091}, \'multiverseid\': 421091}]', "[{'name': 'Das große Kolosseum', 'text': 'Das große Kolosseum kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {C}.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Das große Kolosseum fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421618&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d115e23-cb3b-431a-815d-755c299f14da', 'multiverseId': 421618}, 'multiverseid': 421618}, {'name': 'Gran Coliseo', 'text': 'El Gran Coliseo entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná. El Gran Coliseo te hace 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423373&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0175476-ae1b-455a-a55b-54098edc9955', 'multiverseId': 423373}, 'multiverseid': 423373}, {'name': 'Grand Colisée', 'text': 'Le Grand Colisée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C} à votre réserve.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve. Le Grand Colisée vous inflige 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421969&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c11d8b20-1298-4d69-8b15-19246c597874', 'multiverseId': 421969}, 'multiverseid': 421969}, {'name': 'Gran Colosseo', 'text': 'Il Gran Colosseo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana. Il Gran Colosseo ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422320&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45a5d453-6064-487f-93dd-1d4178be0825', 'multiverseId': 422320}, 'multiverseid': 422320}, {'name': '大闘技場', 'text': '大闘技場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。大闘技場はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422671&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f8d385e-0c7a-4dfc-a483-e5a0e0e3e44b', 'multiverseId': 422671}, 'multiverseid': 422671}, {'name': 'Grande Coliseu', 'text': 'Grande Coliseu entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {C} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana. Grande Coliseu causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423022&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36c85d91-c80b-4bf1-b89e-b0a52c8935fc', 'multiverseId': 423022}, 'multiverseid': 423022}, {'name': '大竞技场', 'text': '大竞技场须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。大竞技场对你造成1点伤害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421267&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed76a311-9f6b-42ed-81f9-eb4610f3c4b4', 'multiverseId': 421267}, 'multiverseid': 421267}]", '[{\'name\': \'Demütige Überläuferin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe zwei Karten. Ein Gegner deiner Wahl übernimmt die Kontrolle über die Demütige Überläuferin. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Einst warst du eine Mardu, dein Körper und dein Wille stark. Jetzt müssen wir noch deinen Geist unterweisen." —Houn, Jeskai-Ältester\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421448&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2834542-1cf1-450a-9463-822ac9b34854\', \'multiverseId\': 421448}, \'multiverseid\': 421448}, {\'name\': \'Desertora humilde\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba dos cartas. El oponente objetivo gana el control de la Desertora humilde. Activa esta habilidad solo durante tu turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Fuiste mardu una vez, por lo que tu cuerpo y tu voluntad son fuertes. Ahora debemos entrenar tu mente". —Hun, anciana jeskai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'533c613e-99ef-46d8-ac44-a85546b6f7c6\', \'multiverseId\': 423203}, \'multiverseid\': 423203}, {\'name\': \'Humble défecteur\', \'text\': "{T} : Piochez deux cartes. L\'adversaire ciblé acquiert le contrôle de l\'Humble défecteur. N\'activez cette capacité que pendant votre tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Tu étais un Mardu, ton corps et ta volonté sont robustes. Nous devons maintenant entraîner ton esprit. » —Houn, doyen jeskaï\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421799&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e422c72-87a0-4e19-9ecf-d61715764b94\', \'multiverseId\': 421799}, \'multiverseid\': 421799}, {\'name\': \'Disertrice Umile\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pesca due carte. Un avversario bersaglio prende il controllo della Disertrice Umile. Attiva questa abilità solo durante il tuo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Un tempo eri un Mardu, perciò il tuo corpo e la tua volontà sono forti. Ora dobbiamo allenare la tua mente." —Houn, anziano Jeskai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c23b1c8-9ba1-4edf-bb6e-32f8e6dd54ac\', \'multiverseId\': 422150}, \'multiverseid\': 422150}, {\'name\': \'謙虚な離反者\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手１人を対象とする。カードを２枚引く。そのプレイヤーは謙虚な離反者のコントロールを得る。この能力は、あなたのターンの間にのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「お主はかつてマルドゥであった、故に体と意志は鍛えられている。これからはその精神を鍛えよう。」 ――ジェスカイの長老、フーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9563954-eb80-43af-9f39-da5dabbf2907\', \'multiverseId\': 422501}, \'multiverseid\': 422501}, {\'name\': \'Desertora Humilde\', \'text\': \'{T}: Compre dois cards. O oponente alvo ganha o controle de Desertora Humilde. Ative esta habilidade apenas durante o seu próprio turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Você foi Mardu um dia, seu corpo e sua força de vontade são fortes. Agora precisamos treinar sua mente." — Houn, ancião Jeskai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'041fafe6-32eb-4a26-89a3-21d8136e2bd9\', \'multiverseId\': 422852}, \'multiverseid\': 422852}, {\'name\': \'谦卑皈宗者\', \'text\': \'{T}：抓两张牌。目标对手获得谦卑皈宗者的操控权。只能于你的回合中起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「你曾属玛尔都，已有健硕身躯与顽强意志。如今我们必须锻炼你的心灵。」 ～洁斯凯长老侯恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0caa43fe-5797-4ed9-b03d-b0a41c797100\', \'multiverseId\': 421097}, \'multiverseid\': 421097}]', "[{'name': 'Der Wüste trotzen', 'text': 'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Wachsamkeit.\\nJede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, kann in jedem Kampf eine zusätzliche Kreatur blocken.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': 'Selbst unter den trostlosesten und gefährlichsten Bedingungen harren die Wachen der Abzan unerschütterlich vor den Toren der Festung aus.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421379&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24a172e0-257c-4cd7-8cca-eb18cca50d67', 'multiverseId': 421379}, 'multiverseid': 421379}, {'name': 'Resistir las arenas', 'text': 'Las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de vigilancia.\\nCada criatura que controlas puede bloquear a una criatura adicional cada combate.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': 'Aun bajo las condiciones más desoladoras y peligrosas, los centinelas abzanos jamás dejan de custodiar las puertas de la fortaleza.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423134&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd057c28-e5cc-461a-ada8-9d3dc914f2c2', 'multiverseId': 423134}, 'multiverseid': 423134}, {'name': 'Braver la furie des sables', 'text': 'Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la vigilance.\\nChaque créature que vous contrôlez peut bloquer une créature supplémentaire à chaque combat.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': 'Supportant les climats les plus dangereux, les sentinelles abzanes gardent infailliblement les portes de la forteresse.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421730&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5247fee1-6fb0-4f36-99d3-16862672ce40', 'multiverseId': 421730}, 'multiverseid': 421730}, {'name': 'Affrontare le Sabbie', 'text': 'Le creature che controlli hanno cautela.\\nOgni creatura che controlli può bloccare una creatura addizionale in ogni combattimento.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': 'Le sentinelle Abzan proteggono instancabilmente i cancelli della fortezza, sopportando le condizioni più avverse e pericolose.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422081&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '124eebab-310e-406d-8867-21135009e554', 'multiverseId': 422081}, 'multiverseid': 422081}, {'name': '砂への挑戦', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは警戒を持つ。\\n各戦闘で、あなたがコントロールする各クリーチャーは、追加で１体のクリーチャーをブロックできる。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '孤独と危険な状況を耐え忍びながら、アブザンの歩哨たちは忠実に要塞の門を警備している。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422432&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '380f96f6-694b-48f4-aa51-118e102f48a5', 'multiverseId': 422432}, 'multiverseid': 422432}, {'name': 'Resistir às Areias', 'text': 'As criaturas que você controla têm vigilância.\\nCada criatura que você controla pode bloquear uma criatura adicional a cada combate.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': 'Resistindo às condições mais desoladas e perigosas, as sentinelas Abzan guardam firmemente os portões da fortaleza.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422783&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e4e1094-dbcb-4ede-a086-697e82bfc24d', 'multiverseId': 422783}, 'multiverseid': 422783}, {'name': '不惧黄砂', 'text': '由你操控的生物具有警戒异能。\\n由你操控的每个生物每次战斗中均可以额外多阻挡一个生物。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '在如此荒芜险峻的环境当中，仍能见到阿布赞哨卫守护要塞门户的坚毅身影。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421028&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07851dc6-95c2-4e70-9ebf-49bd3c074416', 'multiverseId': 421028}, 'multiverseid': 421028}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dezimieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl und ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt viele Arten von Anarchie: sozial, individuell, Gruul …\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421512&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6829aca6-e90c-4c02-a51a-9b09761b12ba\', \'multiverseId\': 421512}, \'multiverseid\': 421512}, {\'name\': \'Diezmar\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto objetivo, la criatura objetivo, el encantamiento objetivo y la tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La anarquía llega de muchas formas: social, individual, gruul...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'829e3e49-edef-40f2-9dc9-451495b6c7ab\', \'multiverseId\': 423267}, \'multiverseid\': 423267}, {\'name\': \'Décimation\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé, la créature ciblée, l\'enchantement ciblé et le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'anarchie se présente sous bien des formes : sociale, individuelle, Gruul...", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421863&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'208f06e0-744b-42d2-be8e-067504afef81\', \'multiverseId\': 421863}, \'multiverseid\': 421863}, {\'name\': \'Decimare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio, una creatura bersaglio, un incantesimo bersaglio e una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "L\'anarchia può assumere diverse forme: sociale, individuale, Gruul...", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8713ce7e-e13e-47d7-9521-2c27e9a14fab\', \'multiverseId\': 422214}, \'multiverseid\': 422214}, {\'name\': \'大量破壊\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つと、クリーチャー１体と、エンチャント１つと、土地１つを対象とし、それらを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'無秩序とはさまざまな形態で存在する――社会、個人、グルール……\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15be8224-7e20-488a-a30c-06a6363d40cd\', \'multiverseId\': 422565}, \'multiverseid\': 422565}, {\'name\': \'Dizimar\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato alvo, a criatura alvo, o encantamento alvo e o terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A anarquia tem muitas formas: social, individual, Gruul...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d0c9d72-2a22-4dea-b54d-52fa10d5a37c\', \'multiverseId\': 422916}, \'multiverseid\': 422916}, {\'name\': \'摧残\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器，目标生物，目标结界和目标地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'无政府状态有很多种形式：社会，个人，古鲁. . .\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cd5be3a-cac0-4aaf-9bfd-56ef99dbd13f\', \'multiverseId\': 421161}, \'multiverseid\': 421161}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Sanduhr umdrehen\', \'text\': \'Verteile die Lebenspunktestände einer beliebigen Anzahl von Spielern neu. (Jeder dieser Spieler erhält wieder einen Lebenspunktestand.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Schlimmer als das Altern war die Last der Erinnerungen. Der junge Mönch verlor seine Jugend und erhielt ein bereits gelebtes Leben voller Mühsal und Leid.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421394&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa1ea288-d2a7-42fc-aff4-6567fffba5db\', \'multiverseId\': 421394}, \'multiverseid\': 421394}, {\'name\': \'Invertir las arenas\', \'text\': \'Redistribuye cualquier cantidad de totales de vidas de los jugadores. (Cada uno de esos jugadores obtiene de nuevo un total de vidas.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Mucho peor que soportar la edad fue la carga de los recuerdos. El joven monje perdió su juventud y ganó una vida dura y miserable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16980316-ca6d-442a-8fea-3434ff31e86c\', \'multiverseId\': 423149}, \'multiverseid\': 423149}, {\'name\': \'Inversion de sablier\', \'text\': "Redistribuez les totaux de points de vie de n\'importe quel nombre de joueurs. (Chacun de ces joueurs récupère un total de points de vie.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Le fardeau de la mémoire était plus lourd que celui des ans. Le jeune moine perdit sa jeunesse et gagna une vie d\'épreuves et de malheur.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421745&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df33ca4f-1637-4314-b118-c6ed91e98fa0\', \'multiverseId\': 421745}, \'multiverseid\': 421745}, {\'name\': \'Invertire la Sabbia\', \'text\': \'Ridistribuisci i totali dei punti vita di un qualsiasi numero di giocatori. (Ciascuno di quei giocatori riceve in cambio un totale dei punti vita.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Peggiore dello scorrere degli anni fu il fardello del ricordo. Il giovane monaco perse la propria giovinezza ed ebbe in cambio una vita di sofferenza e stenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc5362c8-5513-4a96-86e0-546833b3a9f2\', \'multiverseId\': 422096}, \'multiverseid\': 422096}, {\'name\': \'砂の逆流\', \'text\': \'望む数のプレイヤーのそれぞれのライフの総量を再配分する。（各プレイヤーのライフは、誰かのそれまでのライフの総量になる。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'歳をとる年月よりも悪いものは記憶の重荷だ。若き僧は昔を捨て、代わりに艱難辛苦の人生を手に入れる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdbc7331-ac35-45e1-8405-e24a60ce5752\', \'multiverseId\': 422447}, \'multiverseid\': 422447}, {\'name\': \'Reverter as Areias\', \'text\': \'Redistribua os totais de pontos de vida de um número qualquer de jogadores. (Cada um desses jogadores recebe um dos totais de pontos de vida.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Pior que os anos de envelhecimento, era o fardo da memória. O jovem monge perdeu sua juventude e ganhou uma vida vicária de privações e aflição.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abb5d4a6-6daf-47f5-9465-5cd3b9988164\', \'multiverseId\': 422798}, \'multiverseid\': 422798}, {\'name\': \'倒转沙漏\', \'text\': \'重新调换任意数量之牌手的总生命。（受影响牌手的总生命会各自换成其他牌手原先的总生命。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'记忆的重担远比老去可怕。年轻修行僧失去青春，还替他人承受整辈子的艰困与苦痛。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aa86c60-1063-4977-afbc-19357b39eea3\', \'multiverseId\': 421043}, \'multiverseid\': 421043}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Schatzkammern öffnen\', \'text\': \'Bringe alle Artefakt- und Verzauberungskarten aus allen Friedhöfen unter der Kontrolle ihrer Besitzer ins Spiel zurück. (Auren, die nichts zum Verzaubern haben, bleiben auf dem Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Schatzkammern leer sind, ist jeder reich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421391&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'025ca2ef-26e8-488f-81e7-11c0acbc9557\', \'multiverseId\': 421391}, \'multiverseid\': 421391}, {\'name\': \'Abrir las bóvedas\', \'text\': \'Regresa al campo de batalla bajo el control de sus propietarios todas las cartas de artefacto y encantamiento de todos los cementerios. (Las auras que no tengan nada que encantar permanecen en los cementerios.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando las bóvedas están vacías, todos son ricos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a9b26f5-de9c-4d1c-8c4b-ed6fe89f8757\', \'multiverseId\': 423146}, \'multiverseid\': 423146}, {\'name\': \'Ouvrez les chambres fortes !\', \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous le contrôle de leurs propriétaires, toutes les cartes d\'artefact et d\'enchantement de tous les cimetières. (Les auras qui n\'ont rien à enchanter restent dans les cimetières.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Quand les coffres sont vides, tout le monde est riche.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421742&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25dc7d35-ceab-4721-81b3-3fcc2d7dc036\', \'multiverseId\': 421742}, \'multiverseid\': 421742}, {\'name\': \'Aprire le Cripte\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte artefatto e incantesimo da tutti i cimiteri sotto il controllo dei rispettivi proprietari. (Le Aure che non hanno nulla da incantare rimangono nei cimiteri.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Quando le cripte sono vuote, tutti ci guadagnano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8078cac-0fe4-41ae-8e83-2c637b0f4db8\', \'multiverseId\': 422093}, \'multiverseid\': 422093}, {\'name\': \'蔵の開放\', \'text\': \'すべての墓地からすべてのアーティファクト・カードとすべてのエンチャント・カードを、オーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。（エンチャントするもののないオーラは墓地に残る。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'蔵が空になれば、みんなが金持ちになる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0816481-d2df-4675-9ad5-70012c5dd399\', \'multiverseId\': 422444}, \'multiverseid\': 422444}, {\'name\': \'Abrir os Cofres\', \'text\': \'Devolva para o campo de batalha sob o controle de seus donos todos os cards de artefato e encantamento em todos os cemitérios. (As Auras sem nada para encantar permanecem nos cemitérios.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Quando os cofres estão vazios, todos são ricos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a14d6b0b-dcae-4df2-a60e-dcf59fb8c410\', \'multiverseId\': 422795}, \'multiverseid\': 422795}, {\'name\': \'打开地窖\', \'text\': \'将所有坟墓场中的所有神器和结界牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。（没有东西可结附的灵气会留在坟墓场中。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'等地窖搬空，大家就都不愁吃穿了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9bca108-8ef4-43c9-88a4-ca8d71e04d3f\', \'multiverseId\': 421040}, \'multiverseid\': 421040}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die innere Bestie\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 3/3 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„In jedem Herzen lebt ein Monster. Wir bilden uns nur ein, dass die Zivilisation es zähmt." ―Euphemia, Beobachterin des Nexus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421460&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa004399-2257-49c4-8164-399b9ac01409\', \'multiverseId\': 421460}, \'multiverseid\': 421460}, {\'name\': \'La bestia interior\', \'text\': \'Destruye el permanente objetivo. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los monstruos habitan en todos los corazones. Solo creemos que la civilización los domestica". —Eufemia, vigilante del nexo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'880bfa51-9417-4596-8936-ba5a7d01f8c8\', \'multiverseId\': 423215}, \'multiverseid\': 423215}, {\'name\': \'Réveiller la bête\', \'text\': \'Détruisez le permanent ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Bête.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Un monstre se cache dans chaque cœur. Nous croyons seulement qu\'il est dompté par la civilisation. » ―Euphemia, gardienne du Nexus", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421811&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69ca63e8-4f37-49d9-86e9-438b252e39a6\', \'multiverseId\': 421811}, \'multiverseid\': 421811}, {\'name\': \'Bestia Interiore\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un permanente bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Bestia 3/3 verde.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"In ogni cuore risiedono mostri. L\\\'idea che la civiltà li addomestichi è una mera illusione." ―Eufemia, guardiana del Nexus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'369d097e-ba8b-49ca-b01a-57c1c85173ed\', \'multiverseId\': 422162}, \'multiverseid\': 422162}, {\'name\': \'内にいる獣\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「怪物はあらゆる者の心の奥底に潜んでいる。それらを飼い慣らしているのが文明であると我々は考える。」 ――生息地の見張り、ユーフェミア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7f58c0f-bb60-4d23-b7bc-a0967f53d23e\', \'multiverseId\': 422513}, \'multiverseid\': 422513}, {\'name\': \'Fera Interior\', \'text\': \'Destrua a permanente alvo. Seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura verde 3/3 do tipo Besta.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Os monstros habitam todos os corações. Nós só achamos que a civilização os doma." ― Euphemia, vigia do Nexo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54025d90-2199-492a-9922-b7475714d304\', \'multiverseId\': 422864}, \'multiverseid\': 422864}, {\'name\': \'体内野兽\', \'text\': \'消灭目标永久物。其操控者派出一个3/3绿色野兽衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「每个人的心中都潜藏着怪物。我们只是认为文明已将之驯服。」 ～连结点看守尤菲米娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9f06c85-061c-4b36-981a-4c3216701ee3\', \'multiverseId\': 421109}, \'multiverseid\': 421109}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Aquädukt\', \'text\': \'Das Dimir-Aquädukt kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Dimir-Aquädukt ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421609&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77db49b7-0b63-4f23-9f1c-798309638c3c\', \'multiverseId\': 421609}, \'multiverseid\': 421609}, {\'name\': \'Acueducto Dimir\', \'text\': \'El Acueducto Dimir entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Acueducto Dimir entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}{B} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37c4ac28-72ad-4bb7-8a0f-f7cefcb95919\', \'multiverseId\': 423364}, \'multiverseid\': 423364}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduc de Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand l\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{B} à votre réserve.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421960&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'915792bd-5774-4902-bbd7-c8e17b947f91\', \'multiverseId\': 421960}, \'multiverseid\': 421960}, {\'name\': \'Acquedotto Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}{B} alla tua riserva di mana.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b4ddb31-7ad5-4ea3-beeb-9a6602a57a5c\', \'multiverseId\': 422311}, \'multiverseid\': 422311}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの水路\', \'text\': \'ディミーアの水路はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nディミーアの水路が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールする土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eec82358-8571-4a39-a89f-1f1dc6b25aa8\', \'multiverseId\': 422662}, \'multiverseid\': 422662}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduto Dimir\', \'text\': \'Aqueduto Dimir entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Aqueduto Dimir entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controle para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}{B} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca0acad7-dd77-4bc6-91fd-71b65ee2d9d9\', \'multiverseId\': 423013}, \'multiverseid\': 423013}, {\'name\': \'底密尔下水道\', \'text\': \'底密尔下水道须横置进战场。\\n当底密尔下水道进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{U}{B}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'168137d0-3e9c-47a4-830c-dbc572d417b4\', \'multiverseId\': 421258}, \'multiverseid\': 421258}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnernder Baloth\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nLeutnant — Solange du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, erhält der Donnernde Baloth +2/+2 und andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2 und verursachen Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du ihn hörst, ist es bereits zu spät.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421491&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'751c4ab2-970b-4610-a55f-cd2d75d5e22a\', \'multiverseId\': 421491}, \'multiverseid\': 421491}, {\'name\': \'Báloth estruendoso\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nTeniente — Mientras controles a tu comandante, el Báloth estruendoso obtiene +2/+2 y las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+2 y tienen la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Si lo oyes, es demasiado tarde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42c942d5-da40-4cfd-86ee-29ff8641f2b2\', \'multiverseId\': 423246}, \'multiverseid\': 423246}, {\'name\': \'Baloth piédetonnerre\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nLieutenant — Tant que vous contrôlez votre commandant, le Baloth piédetonnerre gagne +2/+2 et les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 et ont le piétinement.\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Quand vous l\'entendez, c\'est qu\'il est trop tard.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421842&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'253cd774-f286-4e60-b8aa-08ce7dfe5971\', \'multiverseId\': 421842}, \'multiverseid\': 421842}, {\'name\': \'Baloth Zampatonante\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nTenente — Fintanto che controlli il tuo comandante, il Baloth Zampatonante prende +2/+2 e le altre creature che controlli prendono +2/+2 e hanno travolgere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Se lo senti arrivare, è troppo tardi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc176dcd-55e7-4db3-8d42-69fc777ff9b8\', \'multiverseId\': 422193}, \'multiverseid\': 422193}, {\'name\': \'雷足のベイロス\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n副官 ― あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしているかぎり、雷足のベイロスは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、あなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'それが聞こえた時は、すでに手遅れだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d0cc43-46f2-44b4-ba41-182a3f4871c1\', \'multiverseId\': 422544}, \'multiverseid\': 422544}, {\'name\': \'Baloth dos Pés de Trovão\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nTenente — Enquanto você controlar seu comandante, Baloth dos Pés de Trovão recebe +2/+2 e as outras criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+2 e ganham atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Se você ouvi-lo, será tarde demais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6561cb3e-18c6-476e-86fe-096d0006ec88\', \'multiverseId\': 422895}, \'multiverseid\': 422895}, {\'name\': \'雷蹄巴洛西\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n副官～只要你操控你的指挥官，雷蹄巴洛西便得+2/+2，且由你操控的其他生物得+2/+2且具有践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'等你听到，就已经太迟了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4ded05a-900f-4c65-a81b-7be7b2904b70\', \'multiverseId\': 421140}, \'multiverseid\': 421140}]', "[{'name': 'Dornwaldfälle', 'text': 'Die Dornwaldfälle kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Dornwaldfälle ins Spiel kommen, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421652&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f4fe0a8-879e-4948-a4f0-7a937a598b0e', 'multiverseId': 421652}, 'multiverseid': 421652}, {'name': 'Cascadas bosquespinoso', 'text': 'Las Cascadas bosquespinoso entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\nCuando las Cascadas bosquespinoso entren al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423407&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19971c84-b947-4cef-ace4-8d63870bba4a', 'multiverseId': 423407}, 'multiverseid': 423407}, {'name': 'Chutes de Boisépine', 'text': 'Les Chutes de Boisépine arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nQuand les Chutes de Boisépine arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422003&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0fedee8e-12ae-40c4-ae3b-21403329121f', 'multiverseId': 422003}, 'multiverseid': 422003}, {'name': 'Cascate di Boscorovo', 'text': 'Le Cascate di Boscorovo entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nQuando le Cascate di Boscorovo entrano nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422354&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4028802c-d375-49a4-8104-b1abfca68919', 'multiverseId': 422354}, 'multiverseid': 422354}, {'name': '茨森の滝', 'text': '茨森の滝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n茨森の滝が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422705&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79b7f507-64cc-49d7-8312-9378292ff7cd', 'multiverseId': 422705}, 'multiverseid': 422705}, {'name': 'Cachoeira dos Espinhos', 'text': 'Cachoeira dos Espinhos entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Cachoeira dos Espinhos entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U} à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423056&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98220a28-d0f9-4aec-a25b-2f58d28e8c01', 'multiverseId': 423056}, 'multiverseid': 423056}, {'name': '棘林瀑布', 'text': '棘林瀑布须横置进战场。\\n当棘林瀑布进战场时，你获得1点生命。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421301&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50a79700-1e94-437d-864e-79c37e2caeac', 'multiverseId': 421301}, 'multiverseid': 421301}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drachenmagier\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Drachenmagier einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, wirft jeder Spieler alle Karten aus seiner Hand ab und zieht dann sieben Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Du wirst dich meinem Willen unterwerfen — egal, ob du dabei deinen Verstand verlierst."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421443&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dad108f-d62f-4cff-a1b6-520884841bb6\', \'multiverseId\': 421443}, \'multiverseid\': 421443}, {\'name\': \'Mago dragón\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Mago dragón haga daño de combate a un jugador, cada jugador descarta su mano y luego roba siete cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero dragón\', \'flavor\': \'"Cederás a mi voluntad, con tu valiosa cordura o sin ella".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0056be0e-6698-47db-9806-f5512c849749\', \'multiverseId\': 423198}, \'multiverseid\': 423198}, {\'name\': \'Dragon mage\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Dragon mage inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, chaque joueur se défausse de sa main et pioche sept cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous vous soumettrez à ma volonté, et advienne que pourra de votre santé mentale. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421794&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cdfe97d-af46-4a35-93d1-c2164b437cee\', \'multiverseId\': 421794}, \'multiverseid\': 421794}, {\'name\': \'Dracomago\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Dracomago infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, ogni giocatore scarta la propria mano, poi pesca sette carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Drago\', \'flavor\': \'"Ti piegherai al mio volere. Con o senza la tua preziosa sanità mentale."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a69407e-6aa9-4be2-ac05-fb38e4453941\', \'multiverseId\': 422145}, \'multiverseid\': 422145}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴン魔道士\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nドラゴン魔道士がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札を捨て、その後カードを７枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の正気とやらがあろうがなかろうが――お前は我が意志に従うことになるのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb02cf49-4c4a-42a9-8dc7-7811ef91d327\', \'multiverseId\': 422496}, \'multiverseid\': 422496}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Mago\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Dragão Mago causa dano de combate a um jogador, cada jogador descarta sua própria mão e depois compra sete cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Curvar-te-ei à minha vontade — com ou sem tua preciosa sanidade."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d31af4fb-e630-4c6b-a642-812cfe5993b1\', \'multiverseId\': 422847}, \'multiverseid\': 422847}, {\'name\': \'巨龙法师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当巨龙法师对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，每位牌手弃掉其手牌，然后各抓七张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「你将从我号令～不论你宝贵的神智是否应许。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31c329b6-21ff-4f8c-b317-0cf13e1360d6\', \'multiverseId\': 421092}, \'multiverseid\': 421092}]', "[{'name': 'Drachenschädel-Pass', 'text': 'Der Drachenschädel-Pass kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst einen Sumpf oder ein Gebirge.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421611&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b12fb7f-8f98-482d-9963-5777ccbb760e', 'multiverseId': 421611}, 'multiverseid': 421611}, {'name': 'Cumbre Cráneo de Dragón', 'text': 'La Cumbre Cráneo de Dragón entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles un pantano o una montaña.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423366&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b095ece-b23c-4828-a36d-49ee0acea026', 'multiverseId': 423366}, 'multiverseid': 423366}, {'name': 'Sommet du Crânedragon', 'text': 'Le Sommet du Crânedragon arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez un marais ou une montagne.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421962&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '447217bb-a26f-4e1c-8572-35028a81c930', 'multiverseId': 421962}, 'multiverseid': 421962}, {'name': 'Vetta del Teschio di Drago', 'text': 'La Vetta del Teschio di Drago entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli una Palude o una Montagna.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422313&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24086fa3-56b1-4830-ab07-c63c23136bdb', 'multiverseId': 422313}, 'multiverseid': 422313}, {'name': '竜髑髏の山頂', 'text': 'あなたが沼か山をコントロールしていないかぎり、竜髑髏の山頂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422664&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ff04617-22c6-46ff-942a-c20878ed295b', 'multiverseId': 422664}, 'multiverseid': 422664}, {'name': 'Pico da Caveira de Dragão', 'text': 'Pico da Caveira de Dragão entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle um Pântano ou uma Montanha.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {R} à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423015&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2fd7e8b-8dca-485b-b35f-c3c40f9dbe9d', 'multiverseId': 423015}, 'multiverseid': 423015}, {'name': '龙颅山峰', 'text': '除非你操控沼泽或山脉，否则龙颅山峰须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421260&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00659ea1-e9ca-4b70-bd76-dd34a8268484', 'multiverseId': 421260}, 'multiverseid': 421260}]", "[{'name': 'Dschungellichtung', 'text': 'Die Dschungellichtung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Dschungellichtung ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421622&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '332be016-1292-443f-9fb0-cdd4ba8fe3b3', 'multiverseId': 421622}, 'multiverseid': 421622}, {'name': 'Hondonada selvática', 'text': 'La Hondonada selvática entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Hondonada selvática entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423377&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca7253d6-6a24-4581-abc9-7cd704367b25', 'multiverseId': 423377}, 'multiverseid': 423377}, {'name': 'Dépression de jungle', 'text': 'La Dépression de jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Dépression de jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421973&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd26476a3-c12e-438a-b128-8bad73ee61cb', 'multiverseId': 421973}, 'multiverseid': 421973}, {'name': 'Conca nella Giungla', 'text': 'La Conca nella Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Conca nella Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422324&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1288be36-393a-4dc3-a91c-f41e4e969460', 'multiverseId': 422324}, 'multiverseid': 422324}, {'name': 'ジャングルのうろ穴', 'text': 'ジャングルのうろ穴はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nジャングルのうろ穴が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422675&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a3cdb3e-265d-42e0-9ce8-ddc06433471e', 'multiverseId': 422675}, 'multiverseid': 422675}, {'name': 'Clareira na Selva', 'text': 'Clareira na Selva entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Clareira na Selva entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G} à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423026&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aad41911-449f-4f7e-8a5b-1e6aa7462c13', 'multiverseId': 423026}, 'multiverseid': 423026}, {'name': '丛林幽谷', 'text': '丛林幽谷须横置进战场。\\n当丛林幽谷进战场时，你获得1点生命。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421271&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb99b0d7-48c4-4642-abef-11bf95e0d69f', 'multiverseId': 421271}, 'multiverseid': 421271}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dschungelschrein\', \'text\': \'Der Dschungelschrein kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {R}, {G} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'In Naya sind Ehrgeiz und Verrat selten geworden, fast ausgerottet von der Ehrfurcht, die dort den irdischen Göttern entgegengebracht wird.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421623&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a8f832e-d25e-4d1a-bd4c-b25ce5053ded\', \'multiverseId\': 421623}, \'multiverseid\': 421623}, {\'name\': \'Altar de la jungla\', \'text\': \'El Altar de la jungla entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}, {G} o {W} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'En Naya, la ambición y la traición no son corrientes, llevadas casi a la extinción por la veneración a los dioses terrestres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'118e4d0d-b2b9-4347-bb1c-69d86ba74745\', \'multiverseId\': 423378}, \'multiverseid\': 423378}, {\'name\': \'Reliquaire de la jungle\', \'text\': \'Le Reliquaire de la jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}, {G} ou {W} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Sur Naya, l\'ambition et la traîtrise sont rares. La dévotion aux divinités terrestres les ont presque portées à l\'extinction.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421974&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08680032-4881-44ef-a756-1211bc699a69\', \'multiverseId\': 421974}, \'multiverseid\': 421974}, {\'name\': \'Santuario nella Giungla\', \'text\': \'Il Santuario nella Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}, {G} o {W} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "In Naya, l\'ambizione e il tradimento sono rari, cacciati quasi fino all\'estinzione dal timore reverenziale dimostrato verso gli dei terreni.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b96ad0d-a6fc-4fad-bd7e-5bb1ac0caff8\', \'multiverseId\': 422325}, \'multiverseid\': 422325}, {\'name\': \'ジャングルの祭殿\', \'text\': \'ジャングルの祭殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}か{G}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ナヤでは、地上の神への畏怖から、野心や裏切りは絶滅に近いほど狩りつくされている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9e06d78-fbd8-4597-b7b3-9fa5282736ed\', \'multiverseId\': 422676}, \'multiverseid\': 422676}, {\'name\': \'Sacrário da Selva\', \'text\': \'Sacrário da Selva entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}, {G} ou {W} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Em Naya, a ambição e a traição são raras, pois foram caçadas até sua extinção pelo respeito devido aos deuses terrestres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7014a42-b804-4efd-9fef-1c37da3c6d2f\', \'multiverseId\': 423027}, \'multiverseid\': 423027}, {\'name\': \'丛林祭祠\', \'text\': \'丛林祭祠须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}，{G}或{W}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'野心与背叛在纳雅并不常见，早已被对现世神明的崇敬猎捕得近乎灭绝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aba6290-cbdc-447d-8304-e1cd768381c8\', \'multiverseId\': 421272}, \'multiverseid\': 421272}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkelwasser-Katakomben\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Schlammige Wellen an der Küste Otarias verbergen die vergessenen Überreste des Krieges mit den Phyrexianern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421608&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b7060cd-5493-45ff-adf6-39e53a488191\', \'multiverseId\': 421608}, \'multiverseid\': 421608}, {\'name\': \'Catacumbas Aguanegra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{B} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Las lóbregas mareas otarianas esconden las traiciones olvidadas de la guerra pirexiana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bbc979b-f996-4a8a-9b26-bb38e4ee156b\', \'multiverseId\': 423363}, \'multiverseid\': 423363}, {\'name\': \'Catacombes de Sombreau\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{B} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les boueuses vagues d\'Otaria cachent les horreurs oubliées de la guerre phyrexiane.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421959&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df5bbc56-f513-4b53-9a2a-ad1d48523401\', \'multiverseId\': 421959}, \'multiverseid\': 421959}, {\'name\': \'Catacombe di Acquascura\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{B} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Le fosche maree di Otaria celano allo sguardo i tradimenti dimenticati della guerra di Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1204a4a-4995-486a-a62b-157336b54842\', \'multiverseId\': 422310}, \'multiverseid\': 422310}, {\'name\': \'ダークウォーターの地下墓地\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'オタリアの濁った潮流が、ファイレクシア戦の古い裏切り行為を覆い隠しているんだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'961c7552-da98-434a-8b57-53c8838853aa\', \'multiverseId\': 422661}, \'multiverseid\': 422661}, {\'name\': \'Catacumbas de Darkwater\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {U}{B} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'As lodosas marés otarianas ocultam as traições esquecidas da guerra phyrexiana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6f6f78c-bc1f-4c24-939a-e93d678f080b\', \'multiverseId\': 423012}, \'multiverseid\': 423012}, {\'name\': \'黑水陵墓\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{U}{B}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'欧塔利亚的黑色浪潮，掩藏着非瑞克西亚战争中已被遗忘的变节旧事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd80a203-4ac0-4b0a-81f8-c5966fd3b2fd\', \'multiverseId\': 421257}, \'multiverseid\': 421257}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dünensturm\', \'text\': \'Bestimme bis zu eine Kreatur. Zerstöre den Rest.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Abzan wenden diesen Zauber nur im äußersten Notfall an, denn er führt unausweichlich zu dem, was sie am meisten fürchten: allein zu sein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421513&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e684afde-bd9c-4cb9-90a6-c7878936e62e\', \'multiverseId\': 421513}, \'multiverseid\': 421513}, {\'name\': \'Dunas estruendosas\', \'text\': \'Elige hasta una criatura. Destruye el resto.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los Abzan solo utilizan este hechizo como último recurso a causa de su resultado inevitable, que es su mayor temor: quedarse solos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0073a29-3863-47e6-bd31-3a89fcf4164c\', \'multiverseId\': 423268}, \'multiverseid\': 423268}, {\'name\': \'Salve des dunes\', \'text\': "Choisissez jusqu\'à une créature. Détruisez le reste.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les Abzans n\'utilisent ce sort qu\'en dernier recours, car il les confronte à leur pire crainte : la solitude.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421864&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31f2e3a0-3197-4e44-9723-0442f25bebd0\', \'multiverseId\': 421864}, \'multiverseid\': 421864}, {\'name\': \'Spazzadune\', \'text\': \'Scegli fino a una creatura. Distruggi le altre.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli Abzan ricorrono a questo sortilegio solo come ultima risorsa, perché la sua inevitabile conseguenza è ciò che più temono: rimanere soli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c93b81a-621a-4c03-bf5e-cca4d1574109\', \'multiverseId\': 422215}, \'multiverseid\': 422215}, {\'name\': \'砂塵破\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー最大１体を選ぶ。残りを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'アブザンはこの呪文を最終手段としてしか使うことがない。なぜなら、それがもたらす不可避な結果は、彼らが最も恐れていること――孤独になること――に他ならないからである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4874aa65-2049-4c22-bbb1-157aa3f3654b\', \'multiverseId\': 422566}, \'multiverseid\': 422566}, {\'name\': \'Explosão de Duna\', \'text\': \'Escolha até uma criatura. Destrua o restante.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os Abzan só usam esta mágica como último recurso, pois ela inevitavelmente resulta no que eles mais temem: a solidão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66d94824-81c3-4cc6-b67d-edbd7e425402\', \'multiverseId\': 422917}, \'multiverseid\': 422917}, {\'name\': \'尘沙暴\', \'text\': \'选择至多一个生物。将其他的消灭。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'阿布赞不到万不得已不会使用这个咒语，因为其结果注定是他们最恐惧的东西：孤单。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4a71fc8-4c0e-4bfa-aaf6-7919e72a1689\', \'multiverseId\': 421162}, \'multiverseid\': 421162}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421656&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74595eba-c0c7-4f87-99cf-adf7c88f8ed1', 'multiverseId': 421656}, 'multiverseid': 421656}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423411&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36cb4b12-7da2-4bff-a207-4b1f66b453d6', 'multiverseId': 423411}, 'multiverseid': 423411}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422007&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b837ed08-3170-42c7-bd37-639cf81b6595', 'multiverseId': 422007}, 'multiverseid': 422007}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422358&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5878e0d1-e7d4-4400-9c1d-13daca658e75', 'multiverseId': 422358}, 'multiverseid': 422358}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422709&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '904b025c-d5fe-41f2-bd74-bc1313385d8a', 'multiverseId': 422709}, 'multiverseid': 422709}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423060&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0dd0a0ad-af16-465f-a6aa-5b9d718e41ae', 'multiverseId': 423060}, 'multiverseid': 423060}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421305&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc04daae-b1a5-4135-b9b7-d3f41372a860', 'multiverseId': 421305}, 'multiverseid': 421305}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421657&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32f5cc97-672e-44ef-af0d-934f98057205', 'multiverseId': 421657}, 'multiverseid': 421657}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423412&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5fe3daac-ca04-4c22-a958-53206c735a22', 'multiverseId': 423412}, 'multiverseid': 423412}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422008&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '406173e6-160b-4b68-bdaf-8423eacfabbc', 'multiverseId': 422008}, 'multiverseid': 422008}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422359&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c313d01-3e52-413a-8400-5e83d08f1761', 'multiverseId': 422359}, 'multiverseid': 422359}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422710&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9ac7a53-4e6a-41fa-b850-1acc6ac48864', 'multiverseId': 422710}, 'multiverseid': 422710}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423061&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27d9678c-1de6-4bac-8e36-d753e09ebe63', 'multiverseId': 423061}, 'multiverseid': 423061}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421306&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9475f1aa-e504-4cf7-9eed-960409966e26', 'multiverseId': 421306}, 'multiverseid': 421306}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421658&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5defee45-776d-4909-a1ed-123d1d346dda', 'multiverseId': 421658}, 'multiverseid': 421658}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423413&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce24f09a-f5ef-47b3-b86e-d2d8143a272b', 'multiverseId': 423413}, 'multiverseid': 423413}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422009&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7119cd24-772a-4af3-8396-5bea2b90cdf0', 'multiverseId': 422009}, 'multiverseid': 422009}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422360&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ce8c274-6aa8-4dec-af3e-ccd0ce2e25c2', 'multiverseId': 422360}, 'multiverseid': 422360}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422711&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3814f15f-7fbc-4c8d-99e5-a385b52b7b26', 'multiverseId': 422711}, 'multiverseid': 422711}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423062&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '772c234d-5e66-4288-9498-fff260b4a012', 'multiverseId': 423062}, 'multiverseid': 423062}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421307&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f286caa1-a35e-4d4d-ae05-c1c57e5e8411', 'multiverseId': 421307}, 'multiverseid': 421307}]", '[{\'name\': \'Edric, Meisterspion von Trest\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur einem deiner Gegner Kampfschaden zufügt, kann ihr Beherrscher eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es steht mir nicht frei, meine Quellen zu nennen, aber ich kann dir versichern, dass das Kopfgeld auf dich hoch ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421514&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'833e8c5e-032a-4b95-abfa-d13523b7d547\', \'multiverseId\': 421514}, \'multiverseid\': 421514}, {\'name\': \'Edric, maestro espía de Trest\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura haga daño de combate a uno de tus oponentes, su controlador puede robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"No tengo la libertad de revelar mis fuentes, pero puedo asegurarte que pagan mucho por tu cabeza".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27090f5b-8d36-46fd-aa18-678249bdb661\', \'multiverseId\': 423269}, \'multiverseid\': 423269}, {\'name\': \'Edric, maître espion de Trest\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature inflige des blessures de combat à l\'un de vos adversaires, son contrôleur peut piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne suis pas libre de révéler mes sources, mais je peux vous assurer que votre tête est fort mise à prix. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421865&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbdb8df4-6783-4193-ae34-b18ee8611646\', \'multiverseId\': 421865}, \'multiverseid\': 421865}, {\'name\': \'Edric, Capospia di Trest\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura infligge danno da combattimento a uno dei tuoi avversari, il suo controllore può pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Farabutto Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non sono libero di rivelare le mie fonti, ma posso assicurarti che la taglia sulla tua testa è alta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dc2980f-2f0b-40f9-be43-3d0406a528b9\', \'multiverseId\': 422216}, \'multiverseid\': 422216}, {\'name\': \'トレストの密偵長、エドリック\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体があなたの対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、それのコントローラーはカードを１枚引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「情報元を明かすわけにはいかないが、お前の首の値段が高いのだけは保証する。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'777225fc-34b9-4116-8564-4777b5e4949d\', \'multiverseId\': 422567}, \'multiverseid\': 422567}, {\'name\': \'Edric, Espião-mestre de Trest\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura causa dano de combate a um de seus oponentes, seu controlador pode comprar um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Não posso revelar minhas fontes livremente, mas posso lhe garantir que o preço por sua cabeça é alto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b1f76d8-59e4-4955-8a6b-21339f5732c6\', \'multiverseId\': 422918}, \'multiverseid\': 422918}, {\'name\': \'崔斯特密探长埃卓克\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物向你的任一对手造成战斗伤害时，其操控者可以抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～妖精／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然我不能透露情报来源，但可以向你保证的是，你的脑袋很值钱。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e50bbca-8e27-4b7f-8f83-38edca6ed0c3\', \'multiverseId\': 421163}, \'multiverseid\': 421163}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eid der Druiden\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Spielers bestimmt dieser Spieler einen Gegner seiner Wahl, der mehr Kreaturen als er selbst kontrolliert. Der erste Spieler kann Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek aufdecken, bis er eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckt. Falls er dies tut, bringt er jene Karte ins Spiel und legt alle anderen auf diese Weise aufgedeckten Karten auf seinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421478&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc0508b3-f3b6-4a1b-a8e0-bef1637e8fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 421478}, \'multiverseid\': 421478}, {\'name\': \'Juramento de druidas\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del mantenimiento de cada jugador, ese jugador elige al jugador objetivo que controla más criaturas que él y es su oponente. El primer jugador puede mostrar cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que muestre una carta de criatura. Si lo hace, ese jugador pone esa carta en el campo de batalla y todas las otras cartas mostradas de esta manera en su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc45e99b-82b9-4360-ad8c-65587d9b85af\', \'multiverseId\': 423233}, \'multiverseid\': 423233}, {\'name\': \'Serment des druides\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'entretien de chaque joueur, ce joueur choisit un joueur ciblé qui contrôle plus de créatures que lui et qui est son adversaire. Le premier joueur peut révéler les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il révèle une carte de créature. S\'il fait ainsi, ce joueur met cette carte sur le champ de bataille et toutes les autres cartes révélées de cette manière dans son cimetière.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421829&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b9095f7-480f-462e-9aac-571ed2fb45aa\', \'multiverseId\': 421829}, \'multiverseid\': 421829}, {\'name\': \'Giuramento dei Druidi\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del mantenimento di ogni giocatore, quel giocatore sceglie un giocatore bersaglio che controlla più creature di lui ed è un suo avversario. Il primo giocatore può rivelare carte dalla cima del suo grimorio finché non rivela una carta creatura. Se lo fa, quel giocatore mette quella carta sul campo di battaglia e tutte le altre carte rivelate in questo modo nel suo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be26e80f-8ded-4f9c-bdc6-760a02e84e36\', \'multiverseId\': 422180}, \'multiverseid\': 422180}, {\'name\': \'ドルイドの誓い\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーのアップキープの開始時に、そのプレイヤーは、自分よりも多くのクリーチャーをコントロールしている自分の対戦相手１人を対象とし、「クリーチャー・カードが公開されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、そのカードを戦場に出し、これにより公開された他のすべてのカードを自分の墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da7a582c-c401-4d21-83fa-a841abc9190b\', \'multiverseId\': 422531}, \'multiverseid\': 422531}, {\'name\': \'Juramento dos Druidas\', \'text\': \'No início da manutenção de cada jogador, aquele jogador escolhe o jogador alvo que controle mais criaturas que ele e seja oponente dele. O primeiro jogador pode revelar cards do topo de seu próprio grimório até revelar um card de criatura. Se fizer isso, aquele jogador coloca aquele card no campo de batalha e todos os outros cards revelados dessa maneira no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63f82ddd-4724-4687-b985-52b91ebb0787\', \'multiverseId\': 422882}, \'multiverseid\': 422882}, {\'name\': \'德鲁伊之誓约\', \'text\': \'在每位牌手的维持开始时，该牌手选择目标所操控之生物数量比自己多的牌手，且其须为自己的对手。前者牌手可以从其牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张生物牌为止。若他如此作，则该牌手将该牌放进战场，并将所有其他以此法展示的牌置入其坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03cdcf8f-2d47-4e4c-bbdf-39e64c26cdbc\', \'multiverseId\': 421127}, \'multiverseid\': 421127}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eingeflüsterter Wahnsinn\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler wirft alle Karten aus seiner Hand ab und zieht dann so viele Karten, wie der Spieler, der auf diese Weise die meisten Karten abgeworfen hat, abgeworfen hat.\\nChiffrieren (Dann kannst du diese Zauberspruchkarte auf eine Kreatur codiert, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil schicken. Immer wenn jene Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kann ihr Beherrscher eine Kopie der codierten Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421548&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17ca8ba7-f5c0-4e2b-bd8d-ded91016e7df\', \'multiverseId\': 421548}, \'multiverseid\': 421548}, {\'name\': \'Locura susurrante\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador descarta su mano y luego roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la mayor cantidad de cartas que un jugador descartó de esta manera.\\nCifrar. (Luego puedes exiliar esta carta de hechizo, cifrándola en una criatura que controles. Siempre que esa criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, su controlador puede lanzar una copia de la carta cifrada sin pagar su coste de maná.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2942117-8cc8-4f6a-8f38-6b44573f3915\', \'multiverseId\': 423303}, \'multiverseid\': 423303}, {\'name\': \'Folie susurrante\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur se défausse de sa main, puis il pioche un nombre de cartes égal au plus grand nombre de cartes dont un joueur s\'est défaussé de cette manière.\\nCryptage (Vous pouvez ensuite exiler cette carte de sort cryptée sur une créature que vous contrôlez. À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, son contrôleur peut lancer une copie de la carte cryptée sans payer son coût de mana.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421899&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d933760c-e194-49eb-a8d4-24b8f660f6df\', \'multiverseId\': 421899}, \'multiverseid\': 421899}, {\'name\': \'Follia Sussurrante\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore scarta la propria mano, poi pesca carte pari al maggior numero di carte che un giocatore ha scartato in questo modo.\\nCifrare (Poi puoi esiliare questa carta magia codificata su una creatura che controlli. Ogniqualvolta quella creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, il suo controllore può lanciare una copia della carta codificata senza pagare il suo costo di mana.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'725cf194-74c9-4711-807f-32374d8a13a6\', \'multiverseId\': 422250}, \'multiverseid\': 422250}, {\'name\': \'囁く狂気\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札を捨てその後これによりプレイヤー１人が捨てたカードの枚数のうち最も大きいものに等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n暗号（その後、あなたはあなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体に暗号化した状態で、この呪文・カードを追放してもよい。そのクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはこの暗号化したカードのコピーを、それのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a8ad0ca-0b9d-4aa3-a10c-4e39239b35db\', \'multiverseId\': 422601}, \'multiverseid\': 422601}, {\'name\': \'Loucura Sussurrante\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador descarta a própria mão e depois compra uma quantidade de cards igual ao maior número de cards descartados por um jogador dessa maneira.\\nCifrar (Depois, você pode exilar este card de mágica cifrado numa criatura que você controla. Toda vez que aquela criatura causar dano de combate a um jogador, seu controlador poderá conjurar uma cópia do card cifrado sem pagar seu custo de mana.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4f26b68-b88d-49de-a5c2-9e7e0df540ee\', \'multiverseId\': 422952}, \'multiverseid\': 422952}, {\'name\': \'疯狂耳语\', \'text\': \'每位牌手弃掉手牌，然后各抓若干牌，其数量等同于牌手中以此法弃牌的最多数量。\\n暗码（然后你可以放逐此咒语牌，并赋码于一个由你操控的生物上。每当该生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，其操控者可以施放所赋码之牌的复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e88ff9d3-6ecb-4403-a3b1-93bb2b22377c\', \'multiverseId\': 421197}, \'multiverseid\': 421197}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eiterkraucher\', \'text\': \'Der Eiterkraucher kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\\n{1}{B}, entferne eine +1/+1-Marke vom Eiterkraucher: Alle anderen Kreaturen erhalten -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Eiterkraucher ist nie ein Einzelfall. Er ist bereits eine Verseuchung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421429&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab54d24f-7e2d-47b4-bfd6-39138505c69f\', \'multiverseId\': 421429}, \'multiverseid\': 421429}, {\'name\': \'Podredumbre reptante\', \'text\': \'La Podredumbre reptante entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\\n{1}{B}, remover un contador +1/+1 de la Podredumbre reptante: Todas las otras criaturas obtienen -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Una única podredumbre reptante no está sola. De por sí es una infestación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5d76ea8-5c89-4f8f-ab4e-f91a9943c7fb\', \'multiverseId\': 423184}, \'multiverseid\': 423184}, {\'name\': \'Fouitrescence\', \'text\': "La Fouitrescence arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.\\n{1}{B}, retirez un marqueur +1/+1 de la Fouitrescence : Toutes les autres créatures gagnent -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Une fouitrescence n\'est jamais seule. C\'est déjà une infestation.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421780&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe0e2d5d-bcca-48a2-a905-1b03d499bebd\', \'multiverseId\': 421780}, \'multiverseid\': 421780}, {\'name\': \'Strisciapiaga\', \'text\': \'Lo Strisciapiaga entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, Rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dallo Strisciapiaga: Tutte le altre creature prendono -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': "Un singolo strisciapiaga non è comunque da solo. È già un\'infestazione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07e80106-8d62-4020-bbbb-e1fe579c6caa\', \'multiverseId\': 422131}, \'multiverseid\': 422131}, {\'name\': \'膿絡み\', \'text\': \'膿絡みは＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{1}{B}, 膿絡みの上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く：ターン終了時まで、他のすべてのクリーチャーは－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'膿絡みは一体でも単体とは言わない。それはすでに蔓延だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe745313-101c-4086-8499-e9f56a8ed258\', \'multiverseId\': 422482}, \'multiverseid\': 422482}, {\'name\': \'Pústula Rastejante\', \'text\': \'Pústula Rastejante entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, Remova um marcador +1/+1 de Pústula Rastejante: Todas as outras criaturas recebem -1/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Uma pústula rastejante nunca está sozinha. Ela já é uma infestação.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4947b34-6fee-4499-955e-e36b6a7e0976\', \'multiverseId\': 422833}, \'multiverseid\': 422833}, {\'name\': \'腐行灵\', \'text\': \'腐行灵进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{1}{B}，从腐行灵上移去一个+1/+1指示物：所有其他生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'腐行灵从不孤单。它本身就是一波疯狂传染。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e63b0c28-e1cd-4610-8a79-502deadbdb90\', \'multiverseId\': 421078}, \'multiverseid\': 421078}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elite der Akademie\', \'text\': \'Die Elite der Akademie kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten in allen Friedhöfen ist.\\n{2}{U}, entferne eine +1/+1-Marke von der Elite der Akademie: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421400&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2157aef-0506-4435-97a9-82d7636bff76\', \'multiverseId\': 421400}, \'multiverseid\': 421400}, {\'name\': \'Élite de la academia\', \'text\': \'La Élite de la academia entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, donde X es la cantidad de cartas de instantáneo y de conjuro que hay en todos los cementerios.\\n{2}{U}, remover un contador +1/+1 de la Élite de la academia: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fd2327a-81d1-4456-b46f-ff6091fc3c23\', \'multiverseId\': 423155}, \'multiverseid\': 423155}, {\'name\': "Élite de l\'académie", \'text\': "L\'Élite de l\'académie arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, X étant le nombre de cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel dans tous les cimetières.\\n{2}{U}, retirez un marqueur +1/+1 de l\'Élite de l\'académie : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421751&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d3387c6-9ca8-4328-832f-c40c3c92baeb\', \'multiverseId\': 421751}, \'multiverseid\': 421751}, {\'name\': "Elite dell\'Accademia", \'text\': "L\'Elite dell\'Accademia entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1, dove X è il numero di carte istantaneo e stregoneria in tutti i cimiteri.\\n{2}{U}, Rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dall\'Elite dell\'Accademia: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1251899-8b6e-4352-a99e-a406f526b5a8\', \'multiverseId\': 422102}, \'multiverseid\': 422102}, {\'name\': \'アカデミーの精鋭\', \'text\': \'アカデミーの精鋭は、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘはすべての墓地にあるインスタント・カードとソーサリー・カードの総数に等しい。\\n{2}{U}, アカデミーの精鋭の上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く：カードを１枚引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dfae7c5-3793-4fec-bd73-7046fbca87aa\', \'multiverseId\': 422453}, \'multiverseid\': 422453}, {\'name\': \'Elite da Academia\', \'text\': \'Elite da Academia entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1, sendo X o número de cards de mágica instantânea ou feitiço em todos os cemitérios.\\n{2}{U}, Remova um marcador +1/+1 de Elite da Academia: Compre um card e, em seguida, descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b265e0c-3faf-4337-8467-6c354d6af708\', \'multiverseId\': 422804}, \'multiverseid\': 422804}, {\'name\': \'学院精英\', \'text\': \'学院精英进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物，X为所有坟墓场中瞬间牌和法术牌的数量加总。\\n{2}{U}，从学院精英上移去一个+1/+1指示物：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4d3e4e6-4ea8-45b6-8dd1-19da1fb9d660\', \'multiverseId\': 421049}, \'multiverseid\': 421049}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel des Filigranen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Engel des Filigranen ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'„Es dürstete mich nach Erleuchtung, und Crucius\\\' Ätherium öffnete mir die Augen. Ich würde meine Erkenntnis mit dir teilen, doch noch fehlt dir der Glaube."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421518&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b89b0d3-07db-415a-a41f-2c4283cb75a1\', \'multiverseId\': 421518}, \'multiverseid\': 421518}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de filigrana\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel de filigrana entre al campo de batalla, ganas 3 vidas por cada artefacto que controles.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'"Yo ansiaba la iluminación y el eterium de Crucius abrió mis ojos. Compartiría mi visión contigo, pero primero debes creer".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca1403c8-3e28-427d-8145-727728588f2b\', \'multiverseId\': 423273}, \'multiverseid\': 423273}, {\'name\': \'Ange de filigrane\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange de filigrane arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 3 points de vie pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : ange\', \'flavor\': "« Je cherchais l\'illumination et l\'étherium de Crucius m\'a ouvert les yeux. J\'aimerais partager ma vision avec vous, mais vous devez d\'abord croire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421869&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f2b1d20-3e95-4483-b6e4-a3bdf7153af3\', \'multiverseId\': 421869}, \'multiverseid\': 421869}, {\'name\': \'Angelo della Filigrana\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo della Filigrana entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 3 punti vita per ogni artefatto che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"Desideravo un\\\'illuminazione e l\\\'eterium di Crucius mi ha aperto gli occhi. Condividerei la mia vista con voi, ma prima dovrete credere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc3cac23-7e69-40b8-9d92-bd3b1669aa6c\', \'multiverseId\': 422220}, \'multiverseid\': 422220}, {\'name\': \'金線の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n金線の天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたがコントロールするアーティファクト１つにつき３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'「私は天啓を渇望し、クルーシウスのエーテリウムはその私の目を開いてくれた。私に見えるものをお前にも分け与えよう。ただ、そのためにまず信じねばならない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7421a182-6f93-4ed6-a6e7-09df05c93b22\', \'multiverseId\': 422571}, \'multiverseid\': 422571}, {\'name\': \'Anjo de Filigree\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Anjo de Filigree entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 3 pontos de vida para cada artefato que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu estava em busca de iluminação e o etherium de Crucius abriu meus olhos. Posso compartilhar minha visão com você, mas primeiro você deve acreditar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b6026e1-db66-483d-84bd-f6a4ac4ad1e1\', \'multiverseId\': 422922}, \'multiverseid\': 422922}, {\'name\': \'丝金天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当丝金天使进战场时，你每操控一个神器，便获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～天使\', \'flavor\': \'「我渴求启示，而克鲁修的乙金令我大开眼界。我将与你分享我的领悟，但你必须先得相信。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e61cdafa-b224-4912-bede-901ae161c29d\', \'multiverseId\': 421167}, \'multiverseid\': 421167}]', "[{'name': 'Entdecker der Reiche', 'text': 'Die Entdecker der Reiche kommen mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wobei X gleich der Gesamtanzahl an Karten auf den Händen aller Spieler ist.\\n{2}{G}, entferne eine +1/+1-Marke von den Entdeckern der Reiche: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Länderkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Späher', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421481&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd45f43c7-1a0c-43b7-8d79-66618cf19d88', 'multiverseId': 421481}, 'multiverseid': 421481}, {'name': 'Rastreadores de terrenos', 'text': 'Los Rastreadores de terrenos entran al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ellos, donde X es la cantidad total de cartas que haya en las manos de todos los jugadores.\\n{2}{G}, remover un contador +1/+1 de los Rastreadores de terrenos: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Criatura — Explorador elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423236&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7221f37-56d1-4f93-a175-c99046e318ce', 'multiverseId': 423236}, 'multiverseid': 423236}, {'name': 'Chercheurs de royaume', 'text': 'Les Chercheurs de royaume arrivent sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur eux, X étant le nombre total de cartes dans les mains de tous les joueurs.\\n{2}{G}, retirez un marqueur +1/+1 des Chercheurs de royaume : Cherchez une carte de terrain dans votre bibliothèque, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et éclaireur', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421832&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10f702d3-ae25-4fc0-923b-fee8578cbf87', 'multiverseId': 421832}, 'multiverseid': 421832}, {'name': 'Cercatori di Reami', 'text': 'I Cercatori di Reami entrano nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1, dove X è il numero totale di carte nelle mani di tutti i giocatori.\\n{2}{G}, Rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dai Cercatori di Reami: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra, rivelala, aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Esploratore Elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422183&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70a935c7-8679-4b8b-a596-20ee90ccc907', 'multiverseId': 422183}, 'multiverseid': 422183}, {'name': '領域の探求者', 'text': '領域の探求者は、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘはすべてのプレイヤーの手札にあるカードの総数の合計に等しい。\\n{2}{G}, 領域の探求者の上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く：あなたのライブラリーから土地・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422534&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8642f678-2ba4-4606-aca2-db204e423fff', 'multiverseId': 422534}, 'multiverseid': 422534}, {'name': 'Buscadores de Reinos', 'text': 'Buscadores de Reinos entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1, sendo X o número total de cards nas mãos de todos os jogadores.\\n{2}{G}, Remova um marcador +1/+1 de Buscadores de Reinos: Procure um card de terreno em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e, em seguida, embaralhe seu grimório.', 'type': 'Criatura — Elfo Batedor', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422885&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f962ec46-b486-477a-9988-f4362ac04b58', 'multiverseId': 422885}, 'multiverseid': 422885}, {'name': '觅境斥候', 'text': '觅境斥候进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物，X为所有牌手手牌的总数。\\n{2}{G}，从觅境斥候上移去一个+1/+1指示物：从你的牌库中搜寻一张地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '生物～妖精／斥候', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421130&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90556c34-fc42-4383-929c-a2c3f7c448b3', 'multiverseId': 421130}, 'multiverseid': 421130}]", '[{\'name\': \'Erbe des Duellanten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen angreifen, kannst du eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl bis zum Ende des Zuges Doppelschlag erhalten lassen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die besten Techniken überdauern ihre Erfinder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421320&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc10f76c-27f5-4386-b94c-626f7a39f3d1\', \'multiverseId\': 421320}, \'multiverseid\': 421320}, {\'name\': \'Legado del duelista\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más criaturas ataquen, puedes hacer que la criatura atacante objetivo gane la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Las mejores técnicas sobreviven a sus creadores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52fcb881-c7bc-4c8a-9ad4-3144a3dd15d5\', \'multiverseId\': 423075}, \'multiverseid\': 423075}, {\'name\': \'Héritage de duelliste\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature attaque, vous pouvez faire que la créature attaquante ciblée acquière la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les meilleures techniques survivent à leurs créateurs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421671&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9357d1e-4510-4339-b37b-bca1b049ee61\', \'multiverseId\': 421671}, \'multiverseid\': 421671}, {\'name\': \'Eredità del Duellante\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più creature attaccano, puoi far guadagnare doppio attacco a una creatura attaccante bersaglio fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Le tecniche migliori sopravvivono ai loro inventori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28064592-b703-477f-9fe5-74f0913dd1a6\', \'multiverseId\': 422022}, \'multiverseid\': 422022}, {\'name\': \'決闘者の遺産\', \'text\': \'１体以上のクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは「ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'最高の技は、作り手亡き後も遺る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0392d403-7a03-42a2-9bec-61b7ccdf2d47\', \'multiverseId\': 422373}, \'multiverseid\': 422373}, {\'name\': \'Herança de Duelista\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma ou mais criaturas atacam, você pode fazer com que a criatura atacante alvo ganhe golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'As melhores técnicas sobrevivem a seus criadores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d50b3ed-eb95-4e20-880b-256cec5678ed\', \'multiverseId\': 422724}, \'multiverseid\': 422724}, {\'name\': \'斗客的遗产\', \'text\': \'每当一个或数个生物攻击时，你可以让目标进行攻击的生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'最佳招式能流芳千古。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d4f663d-ca17-4e67-9118-2a52e14c24b2\', \'multiverseId\': 420969}, \'multiverseid\': 420969}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erfahrener Erforscher\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Erfahrene Erforscher stirbt, kann jeder Spieler seine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten durchsuchen und sie ins Spiel bringen. Jeder Spieler, der auf diese Weise seine Bibliothek durchsucht hat, mischt diese danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421493&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'708cc614-4113-445a-b9b3-a1f290e93aca\', \'multiverseId\': 421493}, \'multiverseid\': 421493}, {\'name\': \'Explorador veterano\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Explorador veterano muera, cada jugador puede buscar en su biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica y ponerlas en el campo de batalla. Luego cada jugador que buscó en su biblioteca de esta manera la baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado explorador humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c590ef1-2de0-4eaf-99c2-cb74596b03c0\', \'multiverseId\': 423248}, \'multiverseid\': 423248}, {\'name\': \'Explorateur émérite\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Explorateur émérite meurt, chaque joueur peut chercher dans sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base et les mettre sur le champ de bataille. Ensuite, chaque joueur qui a cherché dans sa bibliothèque de cette manière mélange sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421844&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26ae327e-189a-49db-bf83-8faf6d01a7ef\', \'multiverseId\': 421844}, \'multiverseid\': 421844}, {\'name\': \'Esploratore Veterano\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Esploratore Veterano muore, ogni giocatore può passare in rassegna il proprio grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base e metterle sul campo di battaglia. Poi ogni giocatore che ha passato in rassegna il proprio grimorio in questo modo lo rimescola.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c642a5c-d82b-4c99-b4b8-5233679ed94d\', \'multiverseId\': 422195}, \'multiverseid\': 422195}, {\'name\': \'老練の探険者\', \'text\': \'老練の探険者が死亡したとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーから基本土地・カードを最大２枚探し、それらを戦場に出してもよい。その後、これにより自分のライブラリーからカードを探した各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dd1cf45-011d-4d4d-8a68-4e6a87f88289\', \'multiverseId\': 422546}, \'multiverseid\': 422546}, {\'name\': \'Explorador Veterano\', \'text\': \'Quando Explorador Veterano morre, cada jogador pode procurar até dois cards de terreno básico no próprio grimório e colocá-los no campo de batalha. Depois, cada jogador que fez isso embaralha o próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado Batedor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'989d27f6-4dd6-4a26-92b6-58aa48868b53\', \'multiverseId\': 422897}, \'multiverseid\': 422897}, {\'name\': \'资深探险家\', \'text\': \'当资深探险家死去时，每位牌手各可以从其牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，并将它们放进战场。然后每位以此法搜寻牌库的牌手将其牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d38638c9-8832-4dce-9b4c-32032c19a82b\', \'multiverseId\': 421142}, \'multiverseid\': 421142}]', "[{'name': 'Erhabenes Scheinbild', 'text': 'Wenn das Erhabene Scheinbild ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, diese getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach deine Bibliothek mischen.\\nWenn das Erhabene Scheinbild stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421592&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a7c705f-784f-4b07-86bd-b5f0785a57df', 'multiverseId': 421592}, 'multiverseid': 421592}, {'name': 'Simulacro solemne', 'text': 'Cuando el Simulacro solemne entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, poner esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\\nCuando el Simulacro solemne muera, puedes robar una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423347&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d42e5d2-573c-4073-b8d8-d5faa88110f0', 'multiverseId': 423347}, 'multiverseid': 423347}, {'name': 'Simulacre solennel', 'text': 'Quand le Simulacre solennel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher une carte de terrain de base dans votre bibliothèque, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nQuand le Simulacre solennel meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421943&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b3ddb86-db1b-4df1-8938-cc4b652ae2ea', 'multiverseId': 421943}, 'multiverseid': 421943}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solenne', 'text': 'Quando il Simulacro Solenne entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\\nQuando il Simulacro Solenne muore, puoi pescare una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422294&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'faa90f46-0b14-41eb-bae5-8220e2439faa', 'multiverseId': 422294}, 'multiverseid': 422294}, {'name': '真面目な身代わり', 'text': '真面目な身代わりが戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探してもよい。そうしたなら、そのカードをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\n真面目な身代わりが死亡したとき、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422645&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6f3a59b-dc01-444e-829d-d4c850392153', 'multiverseId': 422645}, 'multiverseid': 422645}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solene', 'text': 'Quando Simulacro Solene entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\\nQuando Simulacro Solene morre, você pode comprar um card.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422996&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1ec6033-668c-43e5-8a9d-87861bb1cdbf', 'multiverseId': 422996}, 'multiverseid': 422996}, {'name': '黯色幻影', 'text': '当黯色幻影进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\\n当黯色幻影死去时，你可以抓一张牌。', 'type': '神器生物～魔像', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421241&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b9cb7f5-3a13-4e7e-9bbb-5e000e28483d', 'multiverseId': 421241}, 'multiverseid': 421241}]", '[{\'name\': \'Evakuierung\', \'text\': \'Bringe alle Kreaturen auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Sobald ich euch eine Brise schicke, werdet ihr sehen, dass eure Krieger in Wirklichkeit nur heiße Luft sind." —Alexi die Westwindzauberin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421410&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d285443d-44a5-4c45-8d8b-7275c0674788\', \'multiverseId\': 421410}, \'multiverseid\': 421410}, {\'name\': \'Evacuación\', \'text\': \'Regresa todas las criaturas a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una vez que tenga la brisa, verás que tus soldados no son más que humo". —Alexi, maga céfira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a56e9b6a-34e7-43ef-9674-855ea77605eb\', \'multiverseId\': 423165}, \'multiverseid\': 423165}, {\'name\': \'Évacuation\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez toutes les créatures dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Une fois que j\'aurai invoqué la brise, vous verrez comment vos guerriers partiront en fumée. » —Alexie, mage du zéphyr", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421761&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d65c2b96-7681-4aaa-88f4-a1356fc98dde\', \'multiverseId\': 421761}, \'multiverseid\': 421761}, {\'name\': \'Evacuazione\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare tutte le creature in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dopo che avrò fornito la brezza, ti accorgerai che i tuoi guerrieri in realtà sono solo fumo." —Alexi, maga dello Zefiro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'303acb05-6231-4731-8e4e-6ce712b25cfd\', \'multiverseId\': 422112}, \'multiverseid\': 422112}, {\'name\': \'脱出\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私がそよ風を吹かせたら、あなたの兵士なんか煙みたいなものよ。」 ――西風の魔道士アレクシー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a504688-127b-4c4c-a67f-303a5dbbb48d\', \'multiverseId\': 422463}, \'multiverseid\': 422463}, {\'name\': \'Evacuação\', \'text\': \'Devolva todas as criaturas para as mãos de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Assim que eu soprar a brisa, você verá a fumaça de que são feitos seus guerreiros." — Alexi, maga zefiriana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fada51c5-fe6f-494a-a344-992942f29a5f\', \'multiverseId\': 422814}, \'multiverseid\': 422814}, {\'name\': \'逃难\', \'text\': \'将所有生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「一旦我让风吹起，你会看到手下兵士如烟散去。」 ～西风法师阿蕾克丝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05037361-0123-4300-b05d-2a936a49c92d\', \'multiverseId\': 421059}, \'multiverseid\': 421059}]', '[{\'name\': \'Evolutionäre Eskalation\', \'text\': \'Lege zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments drei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, und drei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Überlebenskampf ist ein steter Wettstreit, von dem beide Seiten profitieren können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421341&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a287fde0-8e08-481f-907e-c061e0bffd44\', \'multiverseId\': 421341}, \'multiverseid\': 421341}, {\'name\': \'Carrera evolutiva\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon tres contadores +1/+1 en la criatura objetivo que controlas y tres contadores +1/+1 en la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'La supervivencia es una competición constante de la cual ambas partes pueden beneficiarse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6918b3d1-8164-4951-900f-0ecbd87440f6\', \'multiverseId\': 423096}, \'multiverseid\': 423096}, {\'name\': "Surenchère de l\'évolution", \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez et trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'La survie est une compétition constante dont les deux rivaux peuvent tirer profit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421692&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae60be85-ad45-4441-a862-7cc8f730c745\', \'multiverseId\': 421692}, \'multiverseid\': 421692}, {\'name\': \'Scontro Evolutivo\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti tre segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli e tre segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'La sopravvivenza è una competizione costante di cui entrambe le parti possono beneficiare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58763835-c050-46e9-a41b-308b3e945313\', \'multiverseId\': 422043}, \'multiverseid\': 422043}, {\'name\': \'進化増大\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体と対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、その前者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個、その後者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'生存は両者が恩恵を受けることのできる不変の競争である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69e833d3-eb02-4a06-9c6c-620216cf9190\', \'multiverseId\': 422394}, \'multiverseid\': 422394}, {\'name\': \'Escalada Evolucionária\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, coloque três marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla e três marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo que um oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'A sobrevivência é uma constante competição da qual ambos os lados podem se beneficiar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bde4407-3daa-4c9e-82d1-adb81c95eb00\', \'multiverseId\': 422745}, \'multiverseid\': 422745}, {\'name\': \'进化升级\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，在目标由你操控的生物和目标由对手操控的生物上各放置三个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'生存是场永无止境的竞争，双方都能从中获益。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'985ac72b-948b-4ecf-8295-bccbdf0f628b\', \'multiverseId\': 420990}, \'multiverseid\': 420990}]', "[{'name': 'Ewige Qualen', 'text': 'Spieler können keine Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.\\nSchaden kann nicht verhindert werden.\\nAller Schaden wird zugefügt, als ob seine Quelle Verdorren hätte. (Eine Quelle mit Verdorren fügt Kreaturen Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken zu.)', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': 'Als die Nacht endlich kam, hatte die ganze Welt Narben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421552&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '759dfe34-ee8c-405f-88d2-6cb24c05182d', 'multiverseId': 421552}, 'multiverseid': 421552}, {'name': 'Tormento eterno', 'text': 'Los jugadores no pueden ganar vidas.\\nEl daño no puede ser prevenido.\\nTodo el daño se hace como si su fuente tuviera la habilidad de debilitar. (Una fuente con la habilidad de debilitar hace daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1.)', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': 'Cuando cayó la noche, el mismo plano fue herido.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423307&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3386fc6c-262e-4f04-9bd0-2bced60504aa', 'multiverseId': 423307}, 'multiverseid': 423307}, {'name': 'Tourment sempiternel', 'text': 'Les joueurs ne peuvent pas gagner de points de vie.\\nLes blessures ne peuvent pas être prévenues.\\nToutes les blessures sont infligées comme si leur source avait la flétrissure. (Une source avec la flétrissure inflige des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1.)', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': 'Quand la nuit tomba, le plan lui-même était marqué.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421903&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '304ecc33-2459-437c-ae39-5d50a54b7f82', 'multiverseId': 421903}, 'multiverseid': 421903}, {'name': 'Tormento Eterno', 'text': 'I giocatori non possono guadagnare punti vita.\\nIl danno non può essere prevenuto.\\nTutto il danno viene inflitto come se la sua fonte avesse avvizzire. (Una fonte con avvizzire infligge danno sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1.)', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': 'Quando cadde la notte, il piano stesso ne rimase segnato.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422254&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14628b6a-97ae-4d6a-b0fa-0c7db5d55a7b', 'multiverseId': 422254}, 'multiverseid': 422254}, {'name': '恒久の拷問', 'text': 'プレイヤーはライフを得られない。\\nダメージは軽減できない。\\nすべてのダメージは、その発生源が萎縮を持つかのように与えられる。（萎縮を持つ発生源は、クリーチャーに－１/－１カウンターの形でダメージを与える。）', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '夜の帷が降りるとき、この次元自身が傷を負う。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422605&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df9cc740-01ea-4b3a-8ec1-50235cb6cc44', 'multiverseId': 422605}, 'multiverseid': 422605}, {'name': 'Tormento Eterno', 'text': 'Os jogadores não podem ganhar pontos de vida.\\nNenhum dano pode ser prevenido.\\nTodo dano é causado como se sua fonte tivesse murchar. (Uma fonte com murchar causa dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1.)', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': 'Quando a noite caiu, o próprio plano ganhou cicatrizes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422956&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '013800a0-90f1-45c1-ac77-16a176f32b90', 'multiverseId': 422956}, 'multiverseid': 422956}, {'name': '无穷折磨', 'text': '牌手不能获得生命。\\n伤害不能被防止。\\n所有来源均视同其具有干枯异能地来造成伤害。（具干枯异能的来源会以-1/-1指示物的方式对生物造成伤害。）', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '当夜晚降临，时空已遍布伤疤。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421201&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8c48339-e4fb-420f-98f0-81105b4653ca', 'multiverseId': 421201}, 'multiverseid': 421201}]", '[{\'name\': \'Exotischer Obstgarten\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das war ein seltsamer Morgen. Als wir aufwachten, hatten sich unsere Bäume verwandelt. Wir wussten nicht, ob wir sie gießen oder polieren sollten." —Pulan, Hainpfleger aus Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421614&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fbac34a-0047-4dc5-8c79-4f5fd9c5daf1\', \'multiverseId\': 421614}, \'multiverseid\': 421614}, {\'name\': \'Huerto exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega a tu reserva de maná un maná de cualquier color que pudiera producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Fue una mañana extraña. Cuando despertamos, encontramos nuestros árboles transformados. No sabíamos si regarlos o lustrarlos". —Pulan, jardinero de Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6b6a081-1414-46e3-9887-93dac2441f61\', \'multiverseId\': 423369}, \'multiverseid\': 423369}, {\'name\': \'Verger exotique\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez à votre réserve un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur qu\'un terrain contrôlé par un adversaire pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« C\'était une étrange matinée. Quand nous nous sommes réveillés, nos arbres avaient été transformés. Nous ne savions plus si nous devions les arroser ou les polir. » —Pulan, arboriste de Bant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421965&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8717a0af-faab-46ce-a379-60ac3d9124b6\', \'multiverseId\': 421965}, \'multiverseid\': 421965}, {\'name\': \'Frutteto Esotico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi alla tua riserva di mana un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Era una strana mattina. Quando ci siamo svegliati, abbiamo trovato i nostri alberi completamente trasformati. Non sapevamo più se innaffiarli o lucidarli." —Pulan, agricoltore di Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8a3d6c3-12c2-46ff-8865-7550d8c02992\', \'multiverseId\': 422316}, \'multiverseid\': 422316}, {\'name\': \'風変わりな果樹園\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、対戦相手がコントロールする土地が生み出すことのできる色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「変な朝だったよ。起きたら、俺らの樹が変わっちまってたんだ。水やったらいいのか磨いたらいいのかわかんなくってな。」 ――バントの果樹園主、プーラン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8881cd53-c3a8-46b8-a441-963dc8e25df2\', \'multiverseId\': 422667}, \'multiverseid\': 422667}, {\'name\': \'Pomar Exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione à sua reserva de mana um mana de qualquer cor que um terreno controlado por um oponente possa gerar.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Foi uma manhã estranha. Quando acordamos, nossas árvores haviam sido transformadas. Não sabíamos se deveriam ser regadas ou polidas." — Pulan, pomareiro de Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aa8675f-3cc6-40e3-a176-750a5d7269ae\', \'multiverseId\': 423018}, \'multiverseid\': 423018}, {\'name\': \'异国果园\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力到你的法术力池中，其颜色为由对手操控的地能产生之任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「那是个奇怪的早晨。我们醒来时，就发现树变了样子。不晓得该要替它浇水还是把它擦亮。」 ～班特栽果人普兰\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'921a68d1-2d0a-4708-b940-9043919b5a8a\', \'multiverseId\': 421263}, \'multiverseid\': 421263}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fadenmagierin\', \'text\': \'Weiterentwicklung (Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur mit größerer Stärke oder Widerstandskraft unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur.)\\nImmer wenn eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Fadenmagierin gelegt wird, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421517&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'678df223-f947-4092-9130-f238c54e4a93\', \'multiverseId\': 421517}, \'multiverseid\': 421517}, {\'name\': \'Maga del entendimiento\', \'text\': \'Evolucionar. (Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, si la fuerza o la resistencia de esa criatura es mayor que la de esta criatura, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura.)\\nSiempre que se coloque un contador +1/+1 sobre la Maga del entendimiento, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b72dcc99-d58c-49b7-b81d-38d0c255ab01\', \'multiverseId\': 423272}, \'multiverseid\': 423272}, {\'name\': \'Mage des grands fonds\', \'text\': "Évolution (À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, si sa force ou son endurance est supérieure à celle de cette créature, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un marqueur +1/+1 est placé sur la Mage des grands fonds, vous pouvez piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46072e11-f8c2-41e5-ba69-38f82409c5fb\', \'multiverseId\': 421868}, \'multiverseid\': 421868}, {\'name\': \'Maga della Profondità\', \'text\': \'Evoluzione (Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, se quella creatura ha forza o costituzione maggiore di questa creatura, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura.)\\nOgniqualvolta la Maga della Profondità riceve un segnalino +1/+1, puoi pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1117c175-d538-405a-9ba4-c4bee9f6354f\', \'multiverseId\': 422219}, \'multiverseid\': 422219}, {\'name\': \'水深の魔道士\', \'text\': \'進化（クリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、そのクリーチャーのパワーかタフネスがこのクリーチャーよりも大きい場合、このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。）\\n水深の魔道士の上に＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'511089ae-d78e-4d28-862d-fc27ff9d6952\', \'multiverseId\': 422570}, \'multiverseid\': 422570}, {\'name\': \'Mago da Compreensão\', \'text\': \'Evoluir (Toda vez que uma criatura entrar no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, se ela tiver poder ou resistência maior que a desta criatura, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura.)\\nToda vez que um marcador +1/+1 for colocado em Mago da Compreensão, você poderá comprar um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2809b03a-2949-488d-8a2a-34bf314fd80f\', \'multiverseId\': 422921}, \'multiverseid\': 422921}, {\'name\': \'深测法师\', \'text\': \'进化（每当一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，若该生物的力量或防御力大于此生物，则在后者上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n每当在深测法师上放置一个+1/+1指示物时，你可以抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd509143-f79b-4166-b6b0-6af629a8014b\', \'multiverseId\': 421166}, \'multiverseid\': 421166}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fallensteller-Manöver\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl opfert eine angreifende Kreatur. Du erzeugst X 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Widerstandskraft der Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Gier, blinde Wut, Blutrausch — sie alle führen in den Tod, herbeigeführt durch jene, die einen kühlen Kopf bewahren." —Feldwebel Eyra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421321&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07f57c7f-f295-47d2-843d-6b8bd5aa06c7\', \'multiverseId\': 421321}, \'multiverseid\': 421321}, {\'name\': \'Emboscada táctica\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo sacrifica una criatura atacante. Crea X fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1, donde X es la resistencia de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Avaricia. Ira. Sed de sangre. Todo ello conduce a la muerte a manos de los que mantienen sus cabezas". —Sargento Eyra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a9e3093-c650-4951-8d38-d029f558d66c\', \'multiverseId\': 423076}, \'multiverseid\': 423076}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre de capture\', \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé sacrifie une créature attaquante. Vous créez X jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat, X étant l\'endurance de cette créature.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« L\'avidité, la rage et la soif de sang conduisent à la mort, aux mains de ceux qui gardent leur sang-froid. » —Sergente Eyra", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421672&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c98aa4f-b69a-4ec5-b311-120c2a7e7a07\', \'multiverseId\': 421672}, \'multiverseid\': 421672}, {\'name\': \'Manovra di Accerchiamento\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio sacrifica una creatura attaccante. Crea X pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche, dove X è la costituzione di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Avidità, furia e sete di sangue non fanno che condurre alla morte per mano di chi sa mantenere la lucidità." —Sergente Eyra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7be3ee14-9cc5-4e9f-914f-35a3ae33ba6d\', \'multiverseId\': 422023}, \'multiverseid\': 422023}, {\'name\': \'偽計\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは攻撃クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。あなたは白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体生成する。Ｘは、そのクリーチャーのタフネスに等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「貪欲、激怒、渇望。これらすべては冷静でいられる者の手にかかれば死につながる。」 ――エイラ兵長\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b591d447-2a00-4634-be63-49c324278783\', \'multiverseId\': 422374}, \'multiverseid\': 422374}, {\'name\': \'Manobra de Aprisionamento\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo sacrifica uma criatura atacante. Você cria X fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado, sendo X a resistência daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A ganância, a fúria e a sede de sangue, todas levam à morte nas mãos dos que mantêm a cabeça no lugar." — Sargento Eyra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25011d3e-effb-4c5e-b607-b9eaacb5a4c5\', \'multiverseId\': 422725}, \'multiverseid\': 422725}, {\'name\': \'诱捕计略\', \'text\': \'目标牌手牺牲一个进行攻击的生物。你派出X个1/1白色士兵衍生生物，X为该生物的防御力。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「贪婪、狂怒、嗜血，这些终究都会败在冷静手中。」 ～士官埃拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'543588c8-8c97-4cd1-9d0c-3234331f8f38\', \'multiverseId\': 420970}, \'multiverseid\': 420970}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feen-Handwerker\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter der Kontrolle eines Gegners ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie jener Kreatur ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen auch ein Artefakt ist. Schicke dann alle anderen mit den Feen-Handwerkern erzeugten Spielsteine ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421327&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baf7fe6b-a3ac-484e-949e-ffbfeeff8c4c\', \'multiverseId\': 421327}, \'multiverseid\': 421327}, {\'name\': \'Hadas artesanas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo el control de un oponente, crea una ficha que es una copia de esa criatura, excepto que es un artefacto además de sus otros tipos. Luego exilia todas las demás fichas creadas con las Hadas artesanas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice hada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d92647f-e4a6-4d7e-85cd-132c8adcad77\', \'multiverseId\': 423082}, \'multiverseid\': 423082}, {\'name\': \'Artisans faeries\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle d\'un adversaire, créez un jeton qui est une copie de cette créature, excepté que c\'est un artefact en plus de ses autres types. Exilez ensuite tous les autres jetons créés par les Artisans faeries.", \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421678&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6080d9fa-d41d-412c-8bd7-cf4e190aeb9a\', \'multiverseId\': 421678}, \'multiverseid\': 421678}, {\'name\': \'Spiritelli Artigiani\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura non pedina entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il controllo di un avversario, crea una pedina che è una copia di quella creatura tranne che è un artefatto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi. Poi esilia tutte le altre pedine create con gli Spiritelli Artigiani.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Spiritello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0c5e7a6-b94b-40f5-8ee0-0f1408f5fb25\', \'multiverseId\': 422029}, \'multiverseid\': 422029}, {\'name\': \'フェアリーの職工\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nトークンでないクリーチャーが１体対戦相手のコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、そのクリーチャーの他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトでもあることを除きそれのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。その後、フェアリーの職工が生成した他のトークンをすべて追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c9f9984-85e8-4591-afc7-b53ea6d9c697\', \'multiverseId\': 422380}, \'multiverseid\': 422380}, {\'name\': \'Artesãos Feéricos\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que uma criatura que não seja ficha entrar no campo de batalha sob o controle de um oponente, crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia daquela criatura, com a exceção que ela é um artefato além de seus outros tipos. Depois, exile todas as outras fichas criadas com Artesãos Feéricos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91bb61e7-620d-4b1f-bce8-416f4c4337dc\', \'multiverseId\': 422731}, \'multiverseid\': 422731}, {\'name\': \'仙灵工匠\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一个非衍生物的生物在对手的操控下进战场时，派出一个衍生物，该衍生物为该生物的复制品，但额外具有神器此类别。然后放逐所有以仙灵工匠派出的其他衍生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～仙灵／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37a91822-5b32-455d-8b45-ed723db30735\', \'multiverseId\': 420976}, \'multiverseid\': 420976}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fellwarstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was besitzt du, das ich nicht erlangen kann?" —Mairsil der Täuscher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421573&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adbc93bb-8b5a-45be-b4d4-7073b381b7db\', \'multiverseId\': 421573}, \'multiverseid\': 421573}, {\'name\': \'Piedra de Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega a tu reserva de maná un maná de cualquier color que pudiera producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué tienes que yo no pueda obtener?". —Mairsil, el Usurpador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cecd66e1-abd5-4dd5-b30b-907d8fb4ab8b\', \'multiverseId\': 423328}, \'multiverseid\': 423328}, {\'name\': \'Pierre de Guermont\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez à votre réserve un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur qu\'un terrain contrôlé par un adversaire pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'avez-vous que je ne puisse obtenir ? » —Mairsil, le prétendant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421924&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9857ecf-4e16-42e3-8a16-7ae34f18bcd0\', \'multiverseId\': 421924}, \'multiverseid\': 421924}, {\'name\': \'Pietra Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi alla tua riserva di mana un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cos\\\'hai tu che io non posso ottenere?" —Mairsil, il Pretendente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76c0d019-8a9f-4af1-b9d9-18223165c310\', \'multiverseId\': 422275}, \'multiverseid\': 422275}, {\'name\': \'友なる石\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、対戦相手がコントロールする土地が生み出すことのできる色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「お前は、私が手に入れられない何を持っているのだ？」 ――詐欺師メアシル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba90ae77-3031-4f5b-86d8-6edb405435f2\', \'multiverseId\': 422626}, \'multiverseid\': 422626}, {\'name\': \'A Pedra Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione à sua reserva de mana um mana de qualquer cor que um terreno controlado por um oponente possa gerar.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"O que você tem que eu não possa obter?" — Mairsil, o Impostor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d5afeb2-5548-4852-9553-36f5827f605b\', \'multiverseId\': 422977}, \'multiverseid\': 422977}, {\'name\': \'战野之石\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力到你的法术力池中，其颜色为由对手操控的地能产生之任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「你有的东西，哪一样我得不到？」 ～伪装者梅西尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39e0cc76-acf3-43fd-9433-f79f2ce8f847\', \'multiverseId\': 421222}, \'multiverseid\': 421222}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fernsuche\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-, Insel-, Sumpf- oder Gebirge-Karte und bringe sie getappt ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Stadt muss wirklich riesig sein, denn ich bin weit gereist und habe doch noch keinen Ort gefunden, wo die Gebäude aufhören."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421468&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04b0aa58-8436-4b7f-8ea1-b67844fff0a2\', \'multiverseId\': 421468}, \'multiverseid\': 421468}, {\'name\': \'Visión lejana\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de llanura, isla, pantano o montaña y ponla en el campo de batalla girada. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Es realmente tan vasta esta ciudad, que con todo lo que he viajado y visto, todavía no he encontrado un lugar donde no haya edificios".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5d086d3-b0af-47dc-8130-164c907f09a0\', \'multiverseId\': 423223}, \'multiverseid\': 423223}, {\'name\': \'Cherchauloin\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, d\'île, de marais ou de montagne et mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Que cette cité est vaste... J\'ai tant voyagé, j\'ai vu tant de choses, et pourtant, jamais je n\'ai trouvé un lieu où les constructions s\'arrêtent. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421819&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58635072-dc63-4b8d-8c39-dda0f8db2dd9\', \'multiverseId\': 421819}, \'multiverseid\': 421819}, {\'name\': \'Lungosguardo\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, Isola, Palude o Montagna e mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Deve essere davvero vasta questa città, dato che l\\\'ho attraversata in lungo e in largo e non ho mai visto un punto in cui non ci fossero edifici."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b60a045d-c193-4164-9c6c-435eb5eef57d\', \'multiverseId\': 422170}, \'multiverseid\': 422170}, {\'name\': \'遥か見\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから、平地・カード１枚か島・カード１枚か沼・カード１枚か山・カード１枚を探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出す。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「この都市は本当になんて巨大なんだろう。あちこちを旅して様々な物を見てきたけれど、建物が崩れている場所は見たことがないよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98d256b6-b74e-4d94-aa82-f49697317617\', \'multiverseId\': 422521}, \'multiverseid\': 422521}, {\'name\': \'Busca Longínqua\', \'text\': \'Procure um card de Planície, Ilha, Pântano ou Montanha no seu grimório e coloque-o no campo de batalha virado. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"O quão vasta pode realmente ser esta cidade? Eu já viajei para tão longe e vi tantas coisas e nunca cheguei ao lugar onde os prédios acabam."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18f01838-3591-46db-8560-e859675b37db\', \'multiverseId\': 422872}, \'multiverseid\': 422872}, {\'name\': \'远眺\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻一张平原，海岛，沼泽或山脉牌，并将之横置放进战场。然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这城市究竟广大到什么地步呢？我已旅行了那么远，看了那么多，却还没找到毫无建物的地方。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ce8779b-6889-4b8a-9ce0-804b36247fb1\', \'multiverseId\': 421117}, \'multiverseid\': 421117}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammender Archon\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nKreaturen können dich nicht angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': \'„Durch den Staub der Schlacht sah ich das Glitzern der Sonne auf goldenen Mähnen, den Glanz von Ruhm auf Rüstungen — da warf ich mein Schwert weg und weinte ob der Dummheit von Kriegen." —Dravin, Gruul-Deserteur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421377&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0236a1b7-844b-425c-9c59-06b5dd9094e1\', \'multiverseId\': 421377}, \'multiverseid\': 421377}, {\'name\': \'Arconte llameante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLas criaturas no pueden atacarte.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'"A través de la bruma de la batalla divisé el fulgor del sol en una melena dorada, el resplandor de la gloria en armadura; solté mi espada y lloré por la idiotez que es la guerra". —Drávin, desertor gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e9e8558-5401-49fb-ba66-6fdcc76b5679\', \'multiverseId\': 423132}, \'multiverseid\': 423132}, {\'name\': \'Archonte brûlant\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nLes créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : archonte\', \'flavor\': "« Dans la poussière du combat, je vis soudain le reflet du soleil sur une crinière d\'or, la gloire revêtue d\'une cote de mailles ; je lâchai mon épée et sanglotai devant l\'idiotie de la guerre. » —Dravin, déserteur gruul", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421728&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cf5bbee-9370-4468-9345-743cb12ee8a6\', \'multiverseId\': 421728}, \'multiverseid\': 421728}, {\'name\': \'Arconte Sfavillante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLe creature non possono attaccarti.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'"Attraverso la furia della battaglia vidi il bagliore del sole su una chioma dorata, lo splendore della gloria vestito di una corazza; lasciai cadere la mia spada e piansi per la stupidità della guerra." —Dravin, disertore Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ddc0309-441f-4799-af54-065e722be286\', \'multiverseId\': 422079}, \'multiverseid\': 422079}, {\'name\': \'魅力的な執政官\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nクリーチャーではあなたを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': \'「戦いの喧騒の中に、私は黄金の髪の上に輝く太陽と、鎧に映る栄光が見えました。私は思わず剣を落とし、戦争の愚かしさに泣き崩れたのです。」 ――グルールの脱走者、ドレイヴィン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37cd6e34-b4ae-4ee9-948d-c6710bc2b1ad\', \'multiverseId\': 422430}, \'multiverseid\': 422430}, {\'name\': \'Arconte Flamejante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAs criaturas não podem atacá-lo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'"Através da névoa da batalha pude ver o brilho do sol na crina dourada, o resplendor da glória coberto com uma malha, então abaixei minha espada e chorei a estupidez da guerra." — Dravin, desertor Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4934a919-53e8-4be8-a259-70a729fa7378\', \'multiverseId\': 422781}, \'multiverseid\': 422781}, {\'name\': \'辉光统领\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n生物不能攻击你。\', \'type\': \'生物～统领\', \'flavor\': \'「在滚滚战尘中，我见到金色鬃毛上闪耀的阳光，荣誉之光辉披甲现身；我于是丢下了剑，为身处这愚蠢战争而流泪。」 ～古鲁叛逃者卓文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f17e7c6-5b01-4260-ac40-f23a8ae08662\', \'multiverseId\': 421026}, \'multiverseid\': 421026}]', "[{'name': 'Flegel des Eroberers', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jede Farbe unter den bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst.\\nSolange der Flegel des Eroberers an eine Kreatur angelegt ist, können deine Gegner während deines Zuges keine Zaubersprüche wirken.\\nAusrüsten {2}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421372&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de2c991f-4224-4d5d-a9e8-d1af8a4398cb', 'multiverseId': 421372}, 'multiverseid': 421372}, {'name': 'Mayal del conquistador', 'text': 'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1 por cada color entre los permanentes que controlas.\\nMientras el Mayal del conquistador está anexado a una criatura, tus oponentes no pueden lanzar hechizos durante tu turno.\\nEquipar {2}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423127&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df6ab1be-f7d8-4489-b6f3-6e0d7b04ac95', 'multiverseId': 423127}, 'multiverseid': 423127}, {'name': 'Fléau du conquérant', 'text': 'La créature équipée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque couleur parmi les permanents que vous contrôlez.\\nTant que le Fléau du conquérant est attaché à une créature, vos adversaires ne peuvent pas lancer de sorts pendant votre tour.\\nÉquipement {2}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421723&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ec1d7c9-22b6-45b7-9f70-3cebbe6dec6e', 'multiverseId': 421723}, 'multiverseid': 421723}, {'name': 'Mazzafrusto del Conquistatore', 'text': 'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1 per ogni colore tra i permanenti che controlli.\\nFintanto che il Mazzafrusto del Conquistatore è assegnato a una creatura, i tuoi avversari non possono lanciare magie durante il tuo turno.\\nEquipaggiare {2}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422074&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2dbbe89-975e-401f-9356-2b0fd499f855', 'multiverseId': 422074}, 'multiverseid': 422074}, {'name': '征服者のフレイル', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールするパーマネントの中の色１色につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n征服者のフレイルがクリーチャーにつけられているかぎり、あなたのターンに、対戦相手は呪文を唱えられない。\\n装備{2}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422425&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '520d95a9-40e6-4ec7-b8cd-fecc27736724', 'multiverseId': 422425}, 'multiverseid': 422425}, {'name': 'Mangual do Conquistador', 'text': 'A criatura equipada recebe +1/+1 para cada cor entre as permanentes que você controla.\\nEnquanto Mangual do Conquistador estiver anexado a uma criatura, seus oponentes não podem conjurar mágicas durante o seu turno.\\nEquipar {2}', 'type': 'Artefato — Equipamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422776&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '725c2882-0813-4907-8914-99929b01ef7e', 'multiverseId': 422776}, 'multiverseid': 422776}, {'name': '征服者连枷', 'text': '由你操控的永久物之中每有一种颜色，佩带此武具的生物便得+1/+1。\\n只要征服者连枷装备在生物上，所有对手在你的回合中便都不能施放咒语。\\n佩带{2}', 'type': '神器～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421021&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb4f328b-57f5-4ad8-a428-87001b8c0263', 'multiverseId': 421021}, 'multiverseid': 421021}]", '[{\'name\': \'Flinkfuß-Stiefel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Fluchsicherheit und Eile.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist weise, sich kopfüber ins Gefecht zu stürzen … wenn man vorbereitet ist." —Kenjek, Hauptmann der Tausend Schwerter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421595&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdb786b2-625d-43e6-9430-a9cf55b9bca4\', \'multiverseId\': 421595}, \'multiverseid\': 421595}, {\'name\': \'Botas de pies ligeros\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene antimaleficio y prisa.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanzarse de cabeza al combate demuestra una gran sabiduría... siempre que estés preparado". —Kenjek, capitana de las Mil espadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'291498c9-2059-428e-b607-480cb5680cef\', \'multiverseId\': 423350}, \'multiverseid\': 423350}, {\'name\': \'Bottes de piedagile\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la défense talismanique et la célérité.\\nÉquipement {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "« Foncer tête baissée dans la mêlée, c\'est très bien... à condition d\'y être préparé. » —Kenjek, capitaine des Mille épées", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421946&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73637dc0-d8db-4d6f-9c2f-768e3d40be3a\', \'multiverseId\': 421946}, \'multiverseid\': 421946}, {\'name\': \'Stivali Piedelesto\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha anti-malocchio e rapidità.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanciarsi a testa bassa nella battaglia è segno di grande saggezza... quando si è preparati." —Kenjek, capitano delle Mille Spade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc9731b2-0c7c-4d8f-9633-ab403ecaf210\', \'multiverseId\': 422297}, \'multiverseid\': 422297}, {\'name\': \'速足のブーツ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは呪禁と速攻を持つ。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「戦闘に一直線に突入するのは非常に頭のいいやり方と言えるわ……ちゃんと準備していればの話だけどね。」 ――千本剣の隊長、ケンジェク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52cfd199-3a7d-4731-a265-9c1dce49d6fb\', \'multiverseId\': 422648}, \'multiverseid\': 422648}, {\'name\': \'Botas Pé-ligeiro\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem resistência à magia e ímpeto.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Há grande sabedoria em correr e entrar de cabeça no combate... se você estiver preparado." — Kenjek, capitão das Mil Espadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d07afc8-aa0b-4879-89fd-77552c6c26f0\', \'multiverseId\': 422999}, \'multiverseid\': 422999}, {\'name\': \'疾行靴\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有辟邪与敏捷异能。\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「贸然参战乃是智者所为. . . 如果你做好了准备的话。」 ～千刃团队长肯耶珂\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'495e8783-6314-486b-af17-c965c8e98eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 421244}, \'multiverseid\': 421244}]', "[{'name': 'Fluch der Rache', 'text': 'Verzaubert einen Spieler\\nImmer wenn der verzauberte Spieler einen Zauberspruch wirkt, lege eine Grollmarke auf den Fluch der Rache.\\nWenn der verzauberte Spieler die Partie verliert, erhältst du X Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst X Karten, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Grollmarken ist, die auf dem Fluch der Rache liegen.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421331&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25eeb88c-27e8-4d72-a4e6-27a7f6be99f8', 'multiverseId': 421331}, 'multiverseid': 421331}, {'name': 'Maldición de venganza', 'text': 'Encantar jugador.\\nSiempre que el jugador encantado lance un hechizo, pon un contador de rencor en Maldición de venganza.\\nCuando el jugador encantado pierda el juego, ganas X vidas y robas X cartas, donde X es la cantidad de contadores de rencor sobre Maldición de venganza.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura maldición', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423086&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6405220e-3518-432e-a3de-5bec5b1f928b', 'multiverseId': 423086}, 'multiverseid': 423086}, {'name': 'Malédiction de vengeance', 'text': 'Enchanter : joueur\\nÀ chaque fois que le joueur enchanté lance un sort, mettez un marqueur « rancune » sur la Malédiction de vengeance.\\nQuand le joueur enchanté perd la partie, vous gagnez X points de vie et piochez X cartes, X étant le nombre de marqueurs « rancune » sur la Malédiction de vengeance.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura et malédiction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421682&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '846747b1-e5bf-41b2-8fda-d5180a98c547', 'multiverseId': 421682}, 'multiverseid': 421682}, {'name': 'Maledizione della Vendetta', 'text': 'Incanta giocatore\\nOgniqualvolta il giocatore incantato lancia una magia, metti un segnalino astio sulla Maledizione della Vendetta.\\nQuando il giocatore incantato perde la partita, guadagni X punti vita e peschi X carte, dove X è il numero di segnalini astio sulla Maledizione della Vendetta.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422033&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ecc77d89-4007-454d-98cf-eb83e6454af4', 'multiverseId': 422033}, 'multiverseid': 422033}, {'name': '復讐の呪い', 'text': 'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nエンチャントされているプレイヤーが呪文を１つ唱えるたび、復讐の呪いの上に遺恨カウンターを１個置く。\\nエンチャントされているプレイヤーがゲームに負けたとき、あなたはＸ点のライフを得てカードをＸ枚引く。Ｘは復讐の呪いの上に置かれている遺恨カウンターの総数に等しい。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422384&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '872c4769-2371-4e94-8662-bb2b0db7e505', 'multiverseId': 422384}, 'multiverseid': 422384}, {'name': 'Maldição da Vingança', 'text': 'Encantar jogador\\nToda vez que o jogador encantado conjurar uma mágica, coloque um marcador de rancor em Maldição da Vingança.\\nQuando o jogador encantado perde o jogo, você ganha X pontos de vida e compra X cards, sendo X o número de marcadores de rancor em Maldição da Vingança.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura Maldição', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422735&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb1e1a65-9003-485f-afb9-e4c515cd0ee0', 'multiverseId': 422735}, 'multiverseid': 422735}, {'name': '复仇诅咒', 'text': '结附于牌手\\n每当所结附的牌手施放咒语时，在复仇诅咒上放置一个怨恨指示物。\\n当所结附的牌手输掉这盘游戏时，你获得X点生命且抓X张牌，X为复仇诅咒上怨恨指示物的数量。', 'type': '结界～灵气／诅咒', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=420980&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18de467a-3d66-42fb-8c4f-1b5cc3476a48', 'multiverseId': 420980}, 'multiverseid': 420980}]", '[{\'name\': \'Furchtlose Eskorte\', \'text\': \'Opfere die Furchtlose Eskorte: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nashorn, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Elspeths Junker gieren nicht nach Beförderung. Für sie ist es bereits der höchste Ruhm, ihrem Champion dienen zu dürfen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421511&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9151aa32-81d2-46c8-877a-774f103556d6\', \'multiverseId\': 421511}, \'multiverseid\': 421511}, {\'name\': \'Escolta intrépido\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar el Escolta intrépido: Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'Los escuderos de Elspeth no buscan progresar. Para ellos, ninguna gloria de ser caballeros podría ser mejor que la gloria de servir a su campeón.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46c23594-1836-42d1-9576-07369e398299\', \'multiverseId\': 423266}, \'multiverseid\': 423266}, {\'name\': \'Escorte intrépide\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez l\'Escorte intrépide : Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : rhinocéros et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Les écuyers d\'Elspeth ne cherchent pas l\'avancement. Pour eux, nulle gloire ne saurait surpasser celle de servir leur champion.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421862&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4945b30e-1d0d-4c58-a818-491a9c84e883\', \'multiverseId\': 421862}, \'multiverseid\': 421862}, {\'name\': \'Scorta Intrepida\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica la Scorta Intrepida: Le creature che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': "Gli scudieri di Elspeth non desiderano acquisire un potere maggiore. Per essi, nessuna gloria cavalleresca potrà mai superare l\'onore di servire il loro campione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54e1c155-91ac-41e3-86e2-0271053ba37e\', \'multiverseId\': 422213}, \'multiverseid\': 422213}, {\'name\': \'不屈の随員\', \'text\': \'不屈の随員を生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サイ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'エルズペスの従者は昇進を求めない。彼らにとって、勇者に仕えることの名誉を上回る騎士の栄光など存在しないのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ea1ca16-2607-4520-9439-290ae8f3c834\', \'multiverseId\': 422564}, \'multiverseid\': 422564}, {\'name\': \'Acompanhante Destemido\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique Acompanhante Destemido: As criaturas que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rinoceronte Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Os escudeiros de Elspeth não estão em busca de promoções. Para eles, não há glória maior para um cavaleiro que a de servir seu campeão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'998b91ed-8f3b-4561-a612-dea58ffa4922\', \'multiverseId\': 422915}, \'multiverseid\': 422915}, {\'name\': \'不屈卫士\', \'text\': \'牺牲不屈卫士：由你操控的生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～犀牛／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'艾紫培的扈从并不希求升职。对他们来说，能够服侍这位斗士便已是无可取代的骑士荣誉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73919cce-aac3-4ff5-bd08-3074600c6692\', \'multiverseId\': 421160}, \'multiverseid\': 421160}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gargoyle des Heiligtums\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Gargoyle des Heiligtums ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Gargoyle\', \'flavor\': \'Als ihre Ätherium-Vorräte zur Neige gingen, mussten die Mechaniker ihre Gargoylen immer weiter ausschicken, um Nachschub zu erhalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421395&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'746cac74-99df-4f44-b29e-ed8a9cde3cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 421395}, \'multiverseid\': 421395}, {\'name\': \'Gárgola del santuario\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Gárgola del santuario entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gárgola\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando sus reservas de eterium menguaron, los mecanistas enviaron gárgolas más y más lejos para encontrar restos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b1c188e-8166-4ade-be69-8935bdda3c9c\', \'multiverseId\': 423150}, \'multiverseid\': 423150}, {\'name\': \'Gargouille du sanctuaire\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Gargouille du sanctuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : gargouille\', \'flavor\': "Leurs réserves d\'étherium disparaissant rapidement, les mécanistes envoyèrent les gargouilles toujours plus loin pour en récupérer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421746&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'589d0949-54ff-4848-8c1a-9110a9eb24ba\', \'multiverseId\': 421746}, \'multiverseid\': 421746}, {\'name\': \'Gargoyle del Santuario\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Gargoyle del Santuario entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi riprendere in mano una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Gargoyle\', \'flavor\': \'Man mano che le loro scorte di eterium si riducevano, i meccanicisti inviavano i gargoyle sempre più lontano in cerca di materiale di recupero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ea0c748-7b51-4b7e-ab28-4c83b2190717\', \'multiverseId\': 422097}, \'multiverseid\': 422097}, {\'name\': \'聖域のガーゴイル\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n聖域のガーゴイルが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ガーゴイル\', \'flavor\': \'エーテリウムの供給が少なくなるにつれ、商人は廃物を求めてガーゴイルをより遠くへと送り込むようになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d8aa211-d21e-4eb7-8138-4395a4ca3369\', \'multiverseId\': 422448}, \'multiverseid\': 422448}, {\'name\': \'Gárgula do Santuário\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Gárgula do Santuário entra no campo de batalha, você pode devolver o card de artefato alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Gárgula\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme seu suprimento de etherium escasseava, os mecanistas mandavam as gárgulas cada vez mais longe em busca de sucata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ab2a27b-ef5f-4171-871d-28ec64687b3a\', \'multiverseId\': 422799}, \'multiverseid\': 422799}, {\'name\': \'圣所石像鬼\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当圣所石像鬼进战场时，你可以将目标神器牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～石像鬼\', \'flavor\': \'机械师在乙金存量不足时，会派出石像鬼到遥远彼方搜寻可用材料。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59fd2642-c268-4c20-9f72-d11ed4f35134\', \'multiverseId\': 421044}, \'multiverseid\': 421044}]', "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=421665&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab779b73-0bd1-4e37-8909-4a4332bfe4f8', 'multiverseId': 421665}, 'multiverseid': 421665}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=423420&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd41ce759-042c-4e46-beff-a20e304ca1dc', 'multiverseId': 423420}, 'multiverseid': 423420}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422016&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa30e1c1-c631-4ed7-b86e-976e3acc1a96', 'multiverseId': 422016}, 'multiverseid': 422016}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422367&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a318fc3b-ec09-4e2f-9ab9-0ab8250e8b58', 'multiverseId': 422367}, 'multiverseid': 422367}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=422718&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '358150e8-8108-4289-9e98-c7edb1355184', 'multiverseId': 422718}, 'multiverseid': 422718}, {'name': 'Montanha', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Montanha',